                "weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. " ..
                "That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the " ..
                "time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and " ..
                "execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's " ..
                "a real feisty gnome in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",
            rewardMoney = 8500,
        },
        [12746] = {
            description = "We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We " ..
                "weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. " ..
                "That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the " ..
                "time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and " ..
                "execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's " ..
                "a real feisty draenei in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",
            rewardMoney = 8500,
        },
        [12747] = {
            description = "We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We " ..
                "weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. " ..
                "That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the " ..
                "time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and " ..
                "execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's " ..
                "a real feisty blood elf in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",
            rewardMoney = 8500,
        },
        [12748] = {
            description = "We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We " ..
                "weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. " ..
                "That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the " ..
                "time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and " ..
                "execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's " ..
                "a real feisty orc in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",
            rewardMoney = 8500,
        },
        [12749] = {
            description = "We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We " ..
                "weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. " ..
                "That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the " ..
                "time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and " ..
                "execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's " ..
                "a real feisty troll in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",
            rewardMoney = 8500,
        },
        [12750] = {
            description = "We got here, tore the place apart, and headed toward the prison house. We " ..
                "weren't expecting what we found in there, <name>. Seems the Crusade's been real busy. " ..
                "That whole thing is full of Argent Dawn prisoners. Most of them were already dead by the " ..
                "time we arrived, but a few were still breathing.\n\nI was about to go in there and " ..
                "execute the rest of them, but I think you should have the honors. In particular, there's " ..
                "a real feisty Forsaken in there that I think you'll take great pleasure in executing.",
            rewardMoney = 8500,
        },
        [12751] = {
            description = "Return to Thassarian at the Scarlet Tavern and let him know that Koltira's cry " ..
                "for vengeance has been answered. The Chapel of the Crimson Flame will be a pile of ashes " ..
                "in a matter of hours.\n\nYou're one cold-blooded monster, <name>. I salute you, " ..
                "<brother/sister>.",
            rewardItems = {{38675, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 8500,
        },
        [12754] = {
            description = "While you were out burning churches and murdering vermin, I've been busy " ..
                "formulating a plan.\n\nThe Scarlet courier is scheduled to pass by the Scarlet Overlook " ..
                "within the hour. The roads by the overlook are wide open and swarming with Crusaders. " ..
                "Use this makeshift cover to hide at the overlook and wait for the Scarlet Courier to " ..
                "pass. When he's close enough, strike with all your fury! Cut him down and take his " ..
                "belongings - including his clothes!\n\nThe overlook is 200 paces east of here.",
            rewardMoney = 8500,
        },
        [12755] = {
            description = "This message must reach Abbendis. We do not want to draw their suspicion. They " ..
                "must continue under the assumption that everything is going as they planned.\n\nYou will " ..
                "don the Scarlet courier's clothes and with the help of some dark magic, take on the form " ..
                "of the courier.\n\nAbbendis is at King's Harbor, southeast of the Scarlet Overlook. Drop " ..
                "off the message and get as much information out of her as you can. She will tell us what " ..
                "we need to know about the \"Crimson Dawn.\"",
        },
        [12756] = {
            description = "Listen well, courier. The Scarlet lands are lost. New Avalon and Havenshire " ..
                "are overrun by Scourge. The specter of death looms overhead and threatens to overtake us " ..
                "at any moment.\n\nReturn to Galvar with this message:\n\n\"Turn your armies around and " ..
                "prepare your ships for travel to the frozen wastes. When next we meet it will be in " ..
                "Northrend.\"\n\nGive this to Galvar.\n\n<Abbendis hands you a journal.>\n\nIt will " ..
                "explain everything.\n\nThe Scarlet Crusade is no more. Long live the Scarlet Onslaught!",
            rewardMoney = 8500,
        },
        [12758] = {
            description = "Rejek hears tales of giant metal men on faraway Stormwright's Shelf. Far to " ..
                "northwest, outside basin's lip, you will find it.\n\nImagine Rejek using heads of giant " ..
                "metal men as helmet. Make Rejek unstoppable! Make Rejek mighty!\n\nYou get for Rejek, " ..
                "but metal head might not come off metal body easy. Maybe steal bombs from little green " ..
                "men and their friends at Swindlegrin's Dig near Suntouched Pillar? Use bombs to get head " ..
                "off metal body, then bring to Rejek.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12759] = {
            description = "Zepik tell me that you maybe the best gorloc hunter he met... other than " ..
                "Zepik. Still big battle to southwest - you go help.\n\nZepik keeps some of biggest, " ..
                "baddest traps in his stash at Kartak's Hold... told Vekgar to use them for battle, so " ..
                "you use them too. Go pick out any traps you want and kill lots of big-tongues.\n\nLots " ..
                "and lots!",
            rewardMoney = 136000,
        },
        [12760] = {
            description = "Battle still going at Kartak hold... I think it time for you to learn big " ..
                "secret of Frenzyheart.\n\nWe have berries we keep from other lands we came from... they " ..
                "not so special on their own, but mix them with drunk drinks and they make Frenzyheart " ..
                "super strong. You a Frenzyheart now... it time you get to be strong too.\n\nI give some " ..
                "drink, then you be super strong and you go smash all the spark big-tongues.",
            rewardMoney = 136000,
        },
        [12761] = {
            description = "Sparktouched are still being attacked by puppy-men... we think they maybe not " ..
                "stop if we not make them stop. We have secret weapon though... we sent it out to Soo-met " ..
                "so he can use to protect all Oracles.\n\nSecret weapon is from Great Ones themselves... " ..
                "extra shiny crystals found inside sacred Great One temples. Be very careful... no break " ..
                "them.\n\nCrystals are in chest near shrine at Sparktouched Haven, in far southwest. You " ..
                "go use crystals to help Soo-met beat the puppy-men.",
            rewardMoney = 136000,
        },
        [12762] = {
            description = "We need to do something to stop puppy-men attacking Sparktouched Haven. Jaloot " ..
                "brought me very special crystal that he found in River's Heart... we seen only one like " ..
                "it before.\n\nThe crystal not have power now, but the opened up lifeblood pillar should " ..
                "have energy to recharge it if you just bring it close. Once the crystal is charged, go " ..
                "to Sparktouched Haven in far southwest and let the crystal's energy make you big and " ..
                "strong.\n\nThen it time to kick some puppy-men butt.",
            rewardMoney = 136000,
        },
        [12763] = {
            description = "As pressing as our needs are here, there's news from the lands to the north " ..
                "that cannot be ignored.\n\nI've just received a message from the Argent Crusade. It " ..
                "seems that scourge forces are gathering there and are threatening to overrun " ..
                "Zul'drak.\n\nNeedless to say, <name>, if that were to happen our struggle here would be " ..
                "meaningless. You must go there and aid the Crusaders in beating back the Lich King's " ..
                "armies.\n\nSpeak to Makki when you are ready to travel.",
            rewardMoney = 6000,
        },
        [12766] = {
            description = "<The dragon in elf form takes your letter of introduction, perusing it for a " ..
                "moment and then stashing it away within his sleeve.>\n\nEverything seems to be in order. " ..
                "However, if you don't mind, I would ask that you speak with your ambassador here at the " ..
                "temple.\n\nShe has something of great import for you that needs taking care of before we " ..
                "send you up to the queen.\n\n<He pats at the letter under his sleeve.>\n\nI'll keep this " ..
                "safe for you until your return.",
        },
        [12767] = {
            description = "<The dragon in elf form takes your letter of introduction, perusing it for a " ..
                "moment and then stashing it away within his sleeve.>\n\nEverything seems to be in order. " ..
                "However, if you don't mind, I would ask that you speak with your ambassador here at the " ..
                "temple.\n\nHe has something of great import for you that needs taking care of before we " ..
                "send you up to the queen.\n\n<He pats at the letter under his sleeve.>\n\nI'll keep this " ..
                "safe for you until your return.",
        },
        [12768] = {
            description = "You've proved that you're to be trusted and more.\n\nYou should return to " ..
                "Wyrmrest Temple and speak with the steward, Tariolstrasz, once more, <name>.",
        },
        [12769] = {
            description = "You've proved that you're to be trusted and more.\n\nYou should return to " ..
                "Wyrmrest Temple and speak with the steward, Tariolstrasz, once more, <name>.",
        },
        [12770] = {
            description = "Listen up, <class>!\n\nYour days here are numbered. As much as we need capable " ..
                "<class>s in our ranks, there's trouble up north that makes our problems look like a " ..
                "mid-summer Stormwind parade.\n\nTurns out the Scourge are concentrating their efforts - " ..
                "making a big push to take over Zul'Drak. If that happens, we may as well pack it " ..
                "in.\n\nYou're free to finish any business here, but then it's off to Light's Breach with " ..
                "you. Speak to Samuel if you need transportation.\n\nDismissed.",
            rewardMoney = 6000,
        },
        [12771] = {
            description = "Our prayers have been answered! Using the concentration of Light from the " ..
                "Naaru of Shattrath, and the shared benedictions from the faithful, we have created holy " ..
                "artifacts of profound power. These artifacts will be our weapon against the Lich King's " ..
                "machinations.\n\nTake this, <name>. Guard it close, and secure its passage to Ironforge. " ..
                "Magni Bronzebeard is eager to take the fight to Northrend, and this will bring him " ..
                "closer to his goal.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
            startedBy = {{29087}},
        },
        [12773] = {
            description = "Our prayers have been answered! Using the concentration of Light from the " ..
                "Naaru of Shattrath, and the shared benedictions from the faithful, we have created holy " ..
                "artifacts of profound power. These artifacts will be our weapon against the Lich King's " ..
                "machinations.\n\nTake this, <name>. Guard it close, and secure its passage to Darnassus. " ..
                "Deliver it to Tyrande Whisperwind -- her priests will find it a vital source of power in " ..
                "their fight against the unholy forces from the North.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
            startedBy = {{29087}},
        },
        [12774] = {
            description = "Our prayers have been answered! Using the concentration of Light from the " ..
                "Naaru of Shattrath, and the shared benedictions from the faithful, we have created holy " ..
                "artifacts of profound power. These artifacts will be our weapon against the Lich King's " ..
                "machinations.\n\nTake this, <name>. Guard it close, and secure its passage to Stormwind. " ..
                "The King of Stormwind has recently returned; I'm sure he will welcome this tool.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
            startedBy = {{29087}},
        },
        [12776] = {
            description = "Our prayers have been answered! Using the concentration of Light from the " ..
                "Naaru of Shattrath, and the shared benedictions from the faithful, we have created holy " ..
                "artifacts of profound power. These artifacts will be our weapon against the Lich King's " ..
                "machinations.\n\nTake this, <name>. Guard it close, and secure its passage to the " ..
                "Exodar. Deliver it to Prophet Velen in the Vault of Lights so that he may use its powers " ..
                "against the unholy forces from the North.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
            startedBy = {{29087}},
        },
        [12778] = {
            description = "The trap has been sprung, death knight. The armies of Hearthglen and Tirisfal " ..
                "have arrived, just in time to see their enclave in flames! If they turn back now, they " ..
                "fight us with their backs turned.\n\n<Mograine shakes his head.>\n\nNo, they have only " ..
                "one option, which has only one outcome: APOCALYPSE!\n\nAs we speak, they prepare to make " ..
                "one final stand.\n\nThe Lich King awaits your return, champion. He stands watch below " ..
                "us, at Death's Breach.",
        },
        [12785] = {
            description = "We have a breakthrough! Our zombie specimens have given us new insight into " ..
                "the nature of the Scourge's plague. They have born rotten, delicious fruit...\n\nTake " ..
                "this box to Orgrimmar. Inside is a head that is infected with the zombie plague, and " ..
                "something else we have devised -- an anti-plague. The two plagues battle within the " ..
                "zombie brain, and that brain is the key to a cure, I am certain of it.\n\nBring the box " ..
                "to my assistant, Apothecary Karlov. He attends Warchief Thrall in Orgrimmar.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
            startedBy = {{28318}},
        },
        [12786] = {
            description = "We have a breakthrough! Our zombie specimens have given new insight into the " ..
                "nature of the Scourge's plague. They have born rotten, delicious fruit...\n\nTake this " ..
                "box to Thunder Bluff. Inside is a head that is infected with the zombie plague, and " ..
                "something else we have devised -- an anti-plague. The two plagues battle within the " ..
                "zombie brain, and that brain is the key to a cure, I am certain of it.\n\nBring the box " ..
                "to my assistant, Apothecary Chaney. He attends Magatha Grimtotem in Thunder Bluff.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
            startedBy = {{28318}},
        },
        [12787] = {
            description = "The zombie plague was a blessing in disguise. In our search for a cure, we " ..
                "have learned so much of the Scourge and their contagion. Our research has given us " ..
                "weapons against them. Weapons, and tools...\n\nTake this -- it is a zombie's head and " ..
                "has been partially cured of its plague by injecting it with a compound derived from our " ..
                "recent discoveries. Deliver the head to Master Apothecary Faranell; I have a list of " ..
                "experiments I would like him to perform on it.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
            startedBy = {{28318}},
        },
        [12788] = {
            description = "We have a breakthrough! Our zombie specimens have given new insight into the " ..
                "nature of the Scourge's plague. They have born rotten, delicious fruit...\n\nTake this " ..
                "box to Silvermoon City. Inside is a head that is infected with the zombie plague, and " ..
                "something else... an anti-plague. The two plagues battle within the zombie brain, and " ..
                "that brain is the key to a cure, I am certain of it.\n\nBring the box to my assistant, " ..
                "Apothecary Tepesh. She attends Lor'themar Theron in Silvermoon City.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
            startedBy = {{28318}},
        },
        [12789] = {
            description = "Ready yourself, <class>. I'm dispatching you to Light's Breach, northeast of " ..
                "here.\n\nI've received word that the Scourge are making a push to take over " ..
                "Zul'Drak.\n\n<Valus stares you dead in the eyes.>\n\nThis will not come to pass.\n\nSee " ..
                "to it that you assist in the destruction of the Scourge there. The light demands " ..
                "it.\n\nDismissed.",
            rewardMoney = 6000,
        },
        [12790] = {
            description = "Just in case you don't already know, you can use the crystal on the platform " ..
                "behind me to teleport to the Violet Stand in Crystalsong Forest beneath " ..
                "Dalaran.\n\nCorrespondingly, you can use the crystal at the stand below to return to the " ..
                "chamber above me.\n\nI would like for you to do this now.",
        },
        [12791] = {
            description = "Hello, <name>. You may or may not be aware that we Kirin Tor moved our city " ..
                "here to Northrend.\n\nNo longer does Dalaran sit under its protective dome on the shores " ..
                "of Lordamere Lake. Now the city magically floats above the Crystalsong Forest.\n\nWe " ..
                "believe you to be ready for your journey to the city. Speak with me again and I will " ..
                "cast a spell of teleportation to transport you there.\n\nWhen you arrive, seek out " ..
                "Archmage Celindra and give her my signet as proof that we spoke.",
        },
        [12792] = {
            description = "Listen up, <race>!\n\nThis entire region is full of crises. Everywhere you " ..
                "look you'll find those who could use your assistance.\n\n<Kunz looks you squarely in the " ..
                "eye.>\n\nNo one needs your help right now more than Riannah. The scourge have forced " ..
                "their way between us, leaving her and those she commands isolated.\n\nLight's Breach, " ..
                "where her forces are holding out, lies just southwest of here.",
            rewardMoney = 6000,
        },
        [12793] = {
            description = "You hear that, <race>?\n\nThe clamor of battle far to the west reaches us " ..
                "here, even over the din of our own struggle.\n\nThe Scourge are threatening to break " ..
                "through the lines of those calling themselves the Argent Crusade. Preventing this is as " ..
                "urgent as anything in the region.\n\nTravel to Light's Breach and join in their " ..
                "struggle. Speak to Maaka and he will provide you safe passage.",
            rewardMoney = 6000,
        },
        [12794] = {
            description = "Hello, <name>. You may or may not be aware that we Kirin Tor moved our city " ..
                "here to Northrend.\n\nNo longer does Dalaran sit under its protective dome on the shores " ..
                "of Lordamere Lake. Now the city magically floats above the Crystalsong Forest.\n\nWe " ..
                "believe you to be ready for your journey to the city. Speak with me again and I will " ..
                "cast a spell of teleportation to transport you there.\n\nWhen you arrive, seek out " ..
                "Archmage Celindra and give her my signet as proof that we spoke.",
        },
        [12795] = {
            description = "A few moments ago I spotted a signal flare over the treeline to the " ..
                "east.\n\nThat can only mean that things are not going smoothly for the Crusaders at " ..
                "Argent Stand.\n\nI cannot leave our post here, <race>, but you can. When time permits, " ..
                "make your way up to Commander Falstaav and see if there's anything you can do to lighten " ..
                "their burden.",
            rewardMoney = 6000,
        },
        [12796] = {
            description = "Hello, <name>. You may or may not be aware that we Kirin Tor moved our city " ..
                "here to Northrend.\n\nNo longer does Dalaran sit under its protective dome on the shores " ..
                "of Lordamere Lake. Now the city magically floats above the Crystalsong Forest.\n\nWe " ..
                "believe you to be ready for your journey to the city. Speak with me again and I will " ..
                "cast a spell of teleportation to transport you there.\n\nWhen you arrive, seek out " ..
                "Archmage Celindra and give her my signet as proof that we spoke.",
        },
        [12797] = {
            description = "You speak the truth, <race>. I can sense the very essence of Sholazar Basin " ..
                "begin to fray by the blight of undeath even as we speak.\n\nI've bound my being into the " ..
                "rune, <race>. Deliver it to she who sent you here -- for only her power can grant me " ..
                "passage to her lands.",
            rewardMoney = 53000,
        },
        [12799] = {
            description = "You should be happy he's coming, they said. You'll enjoy his company, they " ..
                "said....\n\nWell it's not as if I had a choice in the matter. Finklestein is the " ..
                "Crusade's best alchemist. I suppose I should be honored that he's chosen my post to set " ..
                "up shop. But ever since he's arrived, I've been relegated to collecting various " ..
                "alchemical ingredients.\n\nSay, <race>, how about you give me a hand? Just south of here " ..
                "are some pools that are haunted by spirits of ancient trolls. Collect their ectoplasm " ..
                "for me.",
            rewardMoney = 59000,
        },
        [12800] = {
            description = "The Scarlet Enclave is no more. What remains of the Crusade will be dealt with " ..
                "in Northrend.\n\nWe now turn all of our efforts to Light's Hope Chapel. No longer will " ..
                "this affront to your master be allowed to exist!\n\nI have issued my final command. " ..
                "Scourge Commander Thalanor awaits your arrival at the edge of Browman Mill. Go " ..
                "northwest, through the cave, into the Noxious Glade and take the path leading out of the " ..
                "glade to the mill.\n\nDo not fail me, <name>.",
        },
        [12801] = {
            description = "The Argent Dawn stands defiantly against us at Light's Hope Chapel. They dare " ..
                "oppose the Scourge and for that reason alone they must be destroyed!\n\nThe mighty " ..
                "armies of the Lich King stand at the ready as the final battle for the Plaguelands " ..
                "approaches. Today we ascend into the immortal realm of Scourge heroes!\n\nWhen you are " ..
                "ready for battle, report to Highlord Darion Mograine. It is the highlord who will issue " ..
                "the final march orders and command our armies at Light's Hope Chapel.",
            rewardChoices = {{38632, 1}, {38633, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 33300,
        },
        [12802] = {
            description = "<Drakuru's voice fills your mind.>\n\nHey, mon! Dis eye of da prophets be " ..
                "great! I been usin' it to watch ya and I see ya got da heart now! Not bad....\n\nNow ya " ..
                "just gotta bring it to my brazier at Drak'atal Passage, a short walk east of ya.\n\nYa " ..
                "must drink my elixir at da pedestal to summon me there. This time, ya need ta mix in " ..
                "some desperate mojo from the defenders there for it ta be workin'.",
        },
        [12803] = {
            description = "I'm not sure about what I saw while flying to the northeast, but to me it " ..
                "looked like a gigantic woman kicking some Scourge butt.\n\nI'd heard the professor talk " ..
                "about a certain \"lifewarden\" appointed by the titans to look over Sholazar. I might " ..
                "not be a titan historian, but it sounds like she fits the bill.\n\nI also know that if " ..
                "the Scourge cross the border between the Lost Lands and the rest of Sholazar, our " ..
                "expedition's as good as dead. What do you say you go look for her and lend a hand?",
        },
        [12804] = {
            description = "Sometimes, there's nothing worse than a camp full of hunters. They're all so " ..
                "busy taking down prey animals that the only meat I get is tough and stringy. That's " ..
                "hardly the kind of thing you want to come home to after a long day on the hunt.\n\nLucky " ..
                "for us, though, there is a source of tender, succulent meat nearby. To the south of the " ..
                "river and the camp live longneck grazers. They're a perfect source of meat for our " ..
                "hungry hunters. Bring me back the best cuts of meat and we'll properly toast our " ..
                "comrades.",
            rewardMoney = 62000,
        },
        [12805] = {
            description = "The Lifeblood Pillar was toppled over with great force, sending the very earth " ..
                "into an upheaval.\n\nThe elementals that wander the sundered shard carry with them the " ..
                "very life essence that gave the pillar its strength. I cannot allow this energy to be " ..
                "wasted, for only four pillars remain.\n\nHead to the sundered shard, to the southeast, " ..
                "and seek the lifeblood elementals.\n\nUse this gem on their remains to recover their " ..
                "rampant energy. We'll need the energy to heal the land when all this is over.",
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
            rewardMoney = 65000,
        },
        [12806] = {
            description = "Some would say that our most critical mission lies not with the Lich King, but " ..
                "with the utter destruction of the Scarlet Onslaught. I would say that is foolish, but " ..
                "who am I to judge?\n\nDeath's Rise is far to the southwest, overlooking the sea along " ..
                "the cliff wall. There you will find Lord-Commander Arete personally overseeing the " ..
                "Onslaught's destruction himself.\n\n<The baron clears his throat.>\n\nDo see to it that " ..
                "you report to him with all due haste. He asked for you personally.",
        },
        [12807] = {
            description = "We have much to do, but first I believe a short refresher is in order.\n\nWe " ..
                "death knights have a colorful past with our Scarlet friends who idiotically rest " ..
                "comfortably in the harbor below us to the northwest.\n\nWhen you are ready for an " ..
                "earful, speak with me again and I shall provide enlightenment.",
        },
        [12809] = {
            description = "Our prayers have been answered! Using the concentration of Light from the " ..
                "Naaru of Shattrath, and the shared benedictions from the faithful, we have created holy " ..
                "artifacts of profound power. These artifacts will be our weapon against the Lich King's " ..
                "machinations.\n\nTake this, <name>. Guard it close, and secure its passage to Ironforge. " ..
                "High Tinker Mekkatorque in Tinkertown will be eager to make use of the artifact's power.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
            startedBy = {{29087}},
        },
        [12810] = {
            description = "The forces at Onslaught Harbor are heavily reinforced by gryphon riders. You " ..
                "need a mount that will enable you to put them down. But first, we need the components " ..
                "for the ritual that is going to make it all happen.\n\nA great deal of blood is " ..
                "necessary for the ritual to be undertaken.\n\n<The lord-commander points down and to the " ..
                "northwest.>\n\nThere is a readily available supply down there in the harbor... sharks. " ..
                "Do not return to me until you've filled this bladder with their blood.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12812] = {
            description = "We have a breakthrough! Our zombie specimens have given new insight into the " ..
                "nature of the Scourge's plague. They have born rotten, delicious fruit...\n\nTake this " ..
                "box to Orgrimmar. Inside is a head that is infected with the zombie plague, and " ..
                "something else we have devised -- an anti-plague. The two plagues battle within the " ..
                "zombie brain, and that brain is the key to a cure, I am certain of it.\n\nBring the box " ..
                "to my assistant, Apothecary Karlov. He attends Thrall in Orgrimmar.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
            startedBy = {{28318}},
        },
        [12813] = {
            description = "How kind... how generous our lord-commander is. Where he is flowers and " ..
                "sunshine, I am filled only with hatred.\n\nIt is not enough to end their miserable " ..
                "lives... I want them humiliated... debased!\n\nWhat could be more unspeakable than to be " ..
                "turned into that which you hate? To dedicate your existence to eradicating a thing, and " ..
                "then in the end to become it?\n\nHow sad.\n\nTake this tincture northwest to Onslaught " ..
                "Harbor. Apply it to their still corpses and watch what happens, but avoid the cathedral.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12814] = {
            description = "What could be more fitting than to take one of their own gryphons to use " ..
                "against them? Go to Onslaught Harbor and take the reins to one of their gryphons from " ..
                "the dead clutches of its rider.\n\nReturn with the gryphon, delivering it to Uzo " ..
                "Deathcaller. He will see to its proper transformation and provide you with further " ..
                "instructions.",
            rewardChoices = {{43846, 1}, {43879, 1}, {43894, 1}, {43933, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12815] = {
            description = "Now that you got your bone gryphon, I wantcha to take it back down there " ..
                "everyday and make a no fly zone over Onslaught Harbor.\n\nI gotta admit, mon, I don't " ..
                "really care if you use the bone gryphon to kill them gryphon riders or not. But I'm " ..
                "guessin' that if you do, you'll find it much easier to get to 'em.\n\nBesides, it's got " ..
                "lots of neat tricks you can use.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12818] = {
            description = "To the point... Ricket's asked me to put together some stronger land mines, " ..
                "but I'm running low on parts.\n\nJust west of town, you'll find the remains of our last " ..
                "rocket sled... Ricket got a little excited when she was fueling it, but I probably " ..
                "should have thought to not put the nozzle right over the exhaust. Live and learn, " ..
                "eh?\n\nThere should be a good stock of spare parts scattered around the destroyed " ..
                "sled... why don't you go ahead and chase off those scavengers and nab me some of that " ..
                "wreckage?",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12819] = {
            description = "Blast it! Where are my tools? I had them here just a moment ago.\n\nOh! I " ..
                "probably forgot them when I was setting up that minefield in the west. That's mildly " ..
                "inconvenient. I'd be quite appreciative if you could go get them for me. You'll need to " ..
                "watch your step though... you should be able to use the same path that I did to get " ..
                "out.\n\nOh, and don't try to fly in... I had the presence of mind to set up turrets to " ..
                "shoot down anything that might fly, and they aren't very discerning in who they target.",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12821] = {
            description = "The sapper squad is ready. That means it's time for fun!\n\nThere's only one " ..
                "thing holding us up from our full-scale assault on Garm! I sent a runner to set a " ..
                "teleporter up behind him--successfully I might add--and he returned to get the power " ..
                "cell it needs to function. It isn't working yet... which means the power cell didn't get " ..
                "there.\n\nI need you to look just on the other side of Garm's Bane for the power cell. " ..
                "When you find it, bring it farther east to Garm's Rise and activate the teleporter.",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12822] = {
            description = "Now that we have the teleporter open, my plan is quite complex... it has " ..
                "several facets and will take impeccable coordination. And there are supplies to be " ..
                "gathered! And troops to recruit! Likely, weeks of hard labor as well!\n\nHahah, I had " ..
                "you going there for a moment, didn't I? You've got this, kid. Hop through the teleporter " ..
                "and take the fight to them! Our sappers will back you up... they won't have anywhere to " ..
                "run.",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12823] = {
            description = "Hey there! Joining us for the assault I assume?\n\nI've got a special task for " ..
                "you... we're going to bring the whole cave down on their heads! Towards the back of " ..
                "their cave, you should find Frostgut's Altar. Sneak up and plant this hardpacked " ..
                "explosive bundle somewhere close to it.\n\nOnce the charge is placed, stick around just " ..
                "long enough to make sure Frostgut bites it, then get out quickly! There's no knowing how " ..
                "long the cave will last once that thing goes off!",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12826] = {
            description = "Looking good!\n\nNo, not you - my new mines. You're just a little full of " ..
                "yourself, aren't you? I, on the other hand, am absolutely brilliant! My intellect cannot " ..
                "be matched.\n\nWhat were we talking about? Oh yes, my new mines! New and improved... " ..
                "ready for whatever devious use Ricket has concocted.\n\nBe a <good lad/doll> and go hand " ..
                "them off to Ricket, will you? She's right over there... it should be quite the epic " ..
                "journey, I'm sure. Be careful though, she's a little loopy.",
            rewardMoney = 6800,
        },
        [12827] = {
            description = "Hey hey! You're a new face! Care to lend Ricket a hand?\n\nWe have a somewhat " ..
                "unexpected problem - food shortage. I know, I know... we should have seen that coming, " ..
                "but you don't get it. We tend to have somewhat of a quick turn-around here with our " ..
                "sapper squad and all, so usually we don't have to worry about long term eats. Good old " ..
                "K3's gotten popular though.\n\nConvenient solution? There are gnoll camps to the west " ..
                "and some gnolls scattered, scavenging as gnolls do. Care to go nab some of their rations?",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12829] = {
            description = "Hiya! The name's Tore. I head up the mining operation here at K3... or I will " ..
                "shortly anyway!\n\nThis here cave is full of creepy-crawlies. I think we could do with a " ..
                "few less spiders before we move in - what'd you think?",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12830] = {
            description = "We're moving in!\n\nThere were some snobolds here when we arrived... their " ..
                "mining operation seems to have met some unfortunate happenings though. Doesn't much " ..
                "matter - we were taking over soon anyway.\n\nI sent some of our miners in there to get " ..
                "me some ore samples that I can use to calibrate our machines for processing, but they " ..
                "haven't come back.\n\nMind going in there and nabbing some samples for me in their " ..
                "stead? The snobolds probably have some on them, though I'd expect most of them are dead " ..
                "by now.",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12831] = {
            description = "Oi... it's like there's a propeller in my stomach.\n\nI think I can walk, but " ..
                "I got something nasty in my system when I got bit by something in the back of the cave. " ..
                "It was bigger than the other spiders... and brightly colored.\n\nRicket can probably " ..
                "make me an antidote, but she'd need the venom sac from whatever bit me. Would you mind " ..
                "finding it for me? I don't think Tore's coming.\n\nI'll just pretend I'm dead here and " ..
                "hopefully they'll leave me alone.",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12833] = {
            description = "Hey there again! You didn't run off like all the other adventurers did? Well, " ..
                "you're just a peach, aren't ya? I was beginning to think I smelled funny or " ..
                "something!\n\nWe could still use a bit of a hand around here, and you have just the " ..
                "right experience. Remember those magnataur? Well apparently the cave didn't completely " ..
                "collapse... there are still quite a few left. So much for Gino taking care of them, " ..
                "eh?\n\nFortunately, Jeer made way more than enough mines. You've got this!",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12836] = {
            description = "I know just the job for an eager newcomer! We've got a gnoll problem. You " ..
                "might even call it a gnoll infestation! Pesky things. They keep creeping up more and " ..
                "more, and now they're on our doorstep, stealing our parts! Inconceivable.\n\nIt all " ..
                "begins and ends with their uppity leader, Gnarlhide. I want you to see to that \"ends\" " ..
                "part. Go pay him a visit at his camp all the way to the west, in Snowblind Hills.\n\nAnd " ..
                "when I say \"pay him a visit,\" that's a euphemism for \"kill him painfully.\" Kay? Kay!",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12838] = {
            description = "I need to know what the Scarlet Onslaught is planning today. You will be my " ..
                "instrument in this task.\n\nFly to Onslaught Harbor and rifle through their baggage " ..
                "trunks for documents. The trunks will be locked, so you'll have to take the keys from " ..
                "the Scarlet Onslaught members by whatever means.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12839] = {
            description = "At first this note looks like any of the other intel that you've been looking " ..
                "for. However, a quick perusal of its contents disabuses you of this notion.\n\nThe " ..
                "letter conveys that Grand Admiral Westwind is present somewhere on the island, but that " ..
                "he is keeping himself secluded for now. He speaks of a glorious day that is coming soon " ..
                "in which the Scarlet Onslaught will wash over first the Lich King and then the rest of " ..
                "world to finally bring order to Azeroth.\n\nThe lord-commander will want to see this!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12841] = {
            description = "Yes, it must be the little green prisoner you're after... We might be able to " ..
                "help each other.\n\nYou're not going to get the goblin out of here by force. Not alive, " ..
                "anyway.\n\nAmong my people I am known as a Yrkvinn, a practitioner of illusions. As you " ..
                "can see, the Hyldnir have made me their prisoner.\n\nIf I had my runes, I could make you " ..
                "go unnoticed among them. Further inside, patrolling the mines, you'll find an overseer " ..
                "named Syra. She has my runes. Retrieve them and we'll talk some more.",
        },
        [12842] = {
            description = "The mark of war is etched indelibly upon your soul, death knight. You have " ..
                "learned the dark art of runeforging and with it you will engrave runes of power upon " ..
                "your weaponry.\n\nPreparations for battle must be made. Return to one of the runeforges, " ..
                "here in the Heart of Acherus, and use the power of runeforging to emblazon your weapon " ..
                "with a rune of power!\n\nReturn to me when your blade glows with dark energy!",
        },
        [12843] = {
            description = "You have to help us! We were in the middle of an expedition into the mountains " ..
                "to set up a transmission tower when we were attacked.\n\nThey looked like vrykul, except " ..
                "their skin was blue and layered with frost... and they were all female! They took all " ..
                "the men in the expedition and let us women go. Please, <name>! We think they're being " ..
                "held in Sifreldar, the village overlooking K3.",
            rewardChoices = {{42842, 1}, {42866, 1}, {42877, 1}, {42888, 1}, {42864, 1}},
        },
        [12844] = {
            description = "Please, <name>. When the Hyldnir took our men, they also took all our " ..
                "equipment. Of course, it's more important that we get our boys back, but if you run into " ..
                "any of our equipment, I'd really appreciate it if you brought it back to us.\n\nYou'll " ..
                "find their village just above us, to the north.",
            rewardMoney = 71000,
        },
        [12846] = {
            description = "All of our boys are back... thanks to you, <name>! Well... all but one.\n\nMy " ..
                "brother Zeev is still up there according to the others. Apparently they have some sort " ..
                "of mine where they make their prisoners work. Go in there and see if you can find out " ..
                "anything.",
        },
        [12847] = {
            description = "I'd heard they have an archbishop in their cathedral, but I had no idea that " ..
                "they'd resurrected and promoted Landgren! The Crimson Cathedral is heavily guarded with " ..
                "only one entrance, so you'll need help.\n\nWe still need to know where the grand admiral " ..
                "is, but this time we're not taking any chances!\n\nTake this device. It can be used to " ..
                "summon a gate for me to step through once you've killed the archbishop.\n\nI'll have my " ..
                "answers directly from his compelled soul! We will find Grand Admiral Westwind!",
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [12848] = {
            description = "The endless hunger will soon take hold of you, <class>. When it does, you will " ..
                "feel pain immeasurable. There is only one remedy for the suffering: the hunger must be " ..
                "sated.\n\nI give you the key to your salvation.\n\nChained to the Heart of Acherus are " ..
                "those deemed unworthy of the dark brotherhood. Use the key to free an unworthy initiate. " ..
                "Allow them to equip their gear and battle you for their freedom. Kill and the pain will " ..
                "cease. Fail and suffer for eternity.\n\nLive or die - the choice is yours to make.",
        },
        [12850] = {
            description = "Scourge Commander Thalanor awaits your arrival at the overhang located " ..
                "directly southeast of our current position. Report to Thalanor and requisition a Scourge " ..
                "gryphon to deliver you to Death's Breach.\n\nPrince Valanar will be waiting for you down " ..
                "below.\n\nSuffer well, <brother/sister>!",
        },
        [12851] = {
            description = "The test awaits, woman!\n\nDo you have the heart of a warrior queen? Or that " ..
                "of a sniveling seamstress?\n\nOne taste of war and you'll know the answer.\n\nYou might " ..
                "lie to your mother, your sisters, and even yourself, but the battlefield always exposes " ..
                "one's true nature.\n\nWhen you've made your preparations, mount Icefang and ride into " ..
                "battle. From her back, you must rain down a shower of death upon our enemy.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12853] = {
            description = "Hey there, pal!\n\nDo you like excitement and explosions?! Who doesn't? I know " ..
                "just the place for you. Down at luxurious K3, they're always making innovative " ..
                "inventions and finding all-new ways to make things blow up! Sounds thrilling, doesn't " ..
                "it? If you want to be part of the fun, head on down today and speak to Jeer " ..
                "Sparksocket!\n\nMandatory disclaimer: manual labor may be required to partake in " ..
                "previously indicated \"excitement.\"",
            rewardMoney = 6800,
        },
        [12854] = {
            description = "After the discovery of Brann's journal in Grizzly Hills, we've only had one " ..
                "other communication from Brann. A mysterious note found its way to Explorers' League " ..
                "headquarters in Ironforge, with no indication of where it came from. All it said was " ..
                "that we're to meet Brann at his camp and help him with his search.\n\nFrom what I can " ..
                "tell, the camp should be located northeast of here, across the Bor's Breath River and at " ..
                "the foot of some ruins from the Path of the Titans.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12855] = {
            description = "The tone of Brann's note suggests he meant to bury something with the note, " ..
                "maybe a pack of some kind. You're sure this was all you found?\n\nOkay, I'm going to " ..
                "have you take one of these frosthounds with you. The frostborn use them for tracking. " ..
                "Bring it to the destroyed camp and let it get Brann's scent.\n\nIt should at least lead " ..
                "you to the location of those missing possessions, and if we're lucky, Brann himself.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12856] = {
            description = "To be slain honorably on the field of battle brings us all glory. To be frozen " ..
                "in a block of ice and endlessly taunted does not....\n\nYou are to fly to the frost " ..
                "giant city of Dun Niffelem, just east of the Valley of Ancient Winters, and liberate our " ..
                "captive proto-drakes. With them, you will be able to free our sisters from their frozen " ..
                "bonds and carry them safely home.\n\nBeware the giants' clubs, sister, lest you find " ..
                "yourself numbered among the captives.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12858] = {
            description = "Thank the Light that someone got my message. Now that I'm safe from the iron " ..
                "dwarves, I need to ask your help with something. I've got a lead on Norgannon's " ..
                "keystone, which guards access to Ulduar's archives, but the Titans divided it into two " ..
                "pieces and secreted them away.\n\nOne of the pieces, the keystone's shell, is held " ..
                "within the Inventor's Library on the northern coast, south of Ulduar itself. The first " ..
                "thing you'll need to do is retrieve the fragments of an access disk from the library's " ..
                "guardians.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12859] = {
            description = "Trolls attack Rageclaw Den and kick Rageclaw out! It get worse. Trolls now " ..
                "burning village! This very bad. Chief make top Rageclaw shaman, Moky, do study on fire. " ..
                "Results very surprising! Fire still hot and can burn things.\n\nWill you help Rageclaw " ..
                "and put fire out? Moky has special Rageclaw fire extinguisher for you. Use special fire " ..
                "extinguisher to put out fire at Rageclaw Den to southeast. Sometimes take many sprays to " ..
                "douse fire, but extinguisher always have water! Rageclaw magic strong!",
            rewardItems = {{41755, 1}, {199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
            rewardMoney = 59000,
        },
        [12860] = {
            description = "That disk you assembled... it's blank! That crafty Mimir must've hidden the " ..
                "information somewhere else. Look around the Inventor's Library; do you see any databanks " ..
                "there?\n\nThat might be what you need to do with the disk. Try using it near some of " ..
                "those databanks. Perhaps it's set to retrieve and store information from them. After " ..
                "you've tried your hand at that, contact me again and let me know what you've found. " ..
                "Meanwhile, I'll be trying to track down the other half of the archive key.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12861] = {
            description = "Drakuru... You know who this troll is? I think bad troll are controlled by the " ..
                "Drakuru troll. They call themself Drakuru trolls - that how I know. Now you see why I am " ..
                "chief of Rageclaw. Smartest of all wolvar!\n\nBut that not why I talk to you now. Bad " ..
                "troll come and kick Rageclaw out of den. Rageclaw that no run away held as prisoner in " ..
                "village. You go to Rageclaw Den, southeast, and free captured Rageclaw. Kill troll for " ..
                "lock opener. You maybe kill many troll for many lock opener.",
            rewardChoices = {{41760, 1}, {41761, 1}, {41762, 1}, {41763, 1}},
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
            rewardMoney = 59000,
        },
        [12862] = {
            description = "So... so I don't think we're going to be getting a good foothold in those " ..
                "mountains.\n\nTrust me, I'm not one to give up easily... but between freezing engines, " ..
                "nasty vrykul women, territorial dragon want-to-bes and the half a dozen other nasties " ..
                "settled in the area, this just ain't happening.\n\nDon't let that dissuade you though! " ..
                "Just because we can't get a foothold doesn't mean we won't get you there... one-way " ..
                "trips are pretty simple when you get down to it.\n\n< Ricket nods at some nearby " ..
                "rockets.>",
            rewardMoney = 6800,
        },
        [12863] = {
            description = "Ah! Thanks for coming up here, <lad/lass>.\n\nJudging by your wide eyes and " ..
                "shivering hands, I'd venture a guess that you're somewhat new. Sounds like it would be " ..
                "good for you to meet our gracious hosts then!\n\nWe've got some extra medical " ..
                "supplies... to be honest, we weren't expecting to have such a comfortable setup. Go " ..
                "ahead and give this crate to Glorthal over there, and lend them a hand if you would too. " ..
                "We don't want them to think we're ungrateful for how welcoming they've been.",
            rewardMoney = 6800,
        },
        [12864] = {
            description = "There is something that I could use a hand with now that I have you.\n\nWe " ..
                "have a few scouts that are extremely late in returning. The peaks are harsh... but these " ..
                "boys know what they're doing.\n\nHead to the east... along the Bor's Breath valley and " ..
                "near Bor's Fall... they should be out that direction. If you find any sign of one of " ..
                "them, bring me back news immediately. We have a few enemies in the area - if any of them " ..
                "are getting a bit uppity, the more warning the better.",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12865] = {
            description = "Fresh blood! Good to meet ya! I've got some work if you've got some " ..
                "time.\n\nOff to the east are the Foot Steppes... pretty hard land, but there's quite a " ..
                "group of rhino that graze there. Our birds have a taste for that rhino meat, but it's " ..
                "always a bit dangerous for them to go hunting with all of the proto-drakes that nest " ..
                "around there.\n\nIf you're keen, head over that way and get some rhino meat, bring it " ..
                "back to the peaks above here, and then use it to feed some of the eagles that nest there.",
            rewardChoices = {{42789, 1}, {42802, 1}, {42814, 1}, {42833, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12866] = {
            description = "Damn harpies. We've beat that bunch into submission more times than I can " ..
                "remember... and they stay quiet for a time after each bout. This time, I'd thought that " ..
                "maybe it sunk in.\n\nApparently not.\n\nTheir memory may be a bit short, but if their " ..
                "numbers are thinned enough, they'll keep to themselves. Head into the valleys in the " ..
                "north and east and clear out a fair chunk of them for me, will ya?",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12867] = {
            description = "A few weeks ago, if you looked up, you'd see dozens of those beautiful eagles " ..
                "soaring the skies. Now, only a few if any. They've taken to staying with their nests " ..
                "nearly all the time now because the harpies have been stealing their eggs.\n\nThe " ..
                "harpies have grown a taste for eagle flesh, it seems... the sick wretches are caring for " ..
                "the eggs long enough to feast on the hatchlings. Go into the valleys to the north or the " ..
                "east and find the eggs... bring them back here, and I'll take them back to the nests.",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12869] = {
            description = "You were there with Loken, weren't you? The iron dwarves captured Veranus, the " ..
                "brood mother of the proto-drakes. The drakes don't seem even a little bit happy about " ..
                "the situation... they've gotten very aggressive.\n\nThey've pushed into stormcrest " ..
                "territory and the eagles have taken to an all out fight with them. It's time to return " ..
                "the favor. We're riding to the Foot Steppes and slaughtering them there.\n\nKing " ..
                "Stormheart left this hammer to me - make good use and see to it that I get it back.",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [12873] = {
            description = "Definitely... I can see exactly what the core must look like. If any of the " ..
                "frostborn have seen it, they'll be sure to recognize the description.\n\nThere's no time " ..
                "to waste, let's get straight to business. Go talk to King Stormheart and request his " ..
                "aid... he's sure to know someone who can help us find the core. And be nice about it " ..
                "will you - he's very respected around here.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [12875] = {
            description = "I don't know where this core is hiding, but ye knew that. I said I'd help " ..
                "though, and that I shall.\n\nThere's a hermit by the name of Drom Frostgrip who lives in " ..
                "a cave north of here... down in tha valley. We've strayed away from the titans a bit " ..
                "ourselves being that there are so few about, but Drom's loyal to the old ways... he " ..
                "keeps an eye on their most precious places and speaks te the keeper Creteus " ..
                "often.\n\nYer sure to find him in the back of his cave... tell'm I sent ye and he'll " ..
                "help ye.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12876] = {
            description = "Our scouts have spotted iron dwarves in the valley north of here. I overheard " ..
                "King Stormheart sending you to visit Drom and I'm admittedly a bit worried " ..
                "about'm.\n\nIf you find any iron dwarves when you head down there, put'm down hard and " ..
                "fast for me, eh? I dun think they know exactly where we are or how to get here just yet, " ..
                "and I'd prefer to keep it that way.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12877] = {
            description = "I never found the core... but I've often spoken to the keeper Creteus, and his " ..
                "omissions give him away. You'll find Creteus over the mountains to the east, in the Foot " ..
                "Steppes, keeping watch on the Engine of the Makers. The core might well be in there, but " ..
                "you'll need to win Creteus 's favor.\n\nThe iron dwarves were here looking for " ..
                "something... it might well be the core. They took my ring. Find their leader, get the " ..
                "ring back, and show it to Creteus so that he knows I sent you.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12878] = {
            description = "During your absence, I was privileged enough to parley with the dwarf Brann " ..
                "Bronzebeard. This dwarf indicated his purpose for seeking the keystone, and I am " ..
                "satisfied that it is for satisfactory intent... I believe this dwarf may be the entity " ..
                "for which the keystone was created.\n\nNorgannon's Core is located in the Frigid Tomb to " ..
                "the southeast. Its guardians are ancient beings of ice, and they will not welcome your " ..
                "presence. Best these guardians and retrieve the keystone with my blessing, <race>.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12879] = {
            description = "<As you retrieve the core from the chest, you hear the thumping of heavy " ..
                "footsteps rushing towards you from the corridor. There is the faint sound of battle in " ..
                "the distance.>",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12880] = {
            description = "Combining the keystone will require Norgannon's Binding - a device located in " ..
                "the Engine of the Makers, the large pit beside us. Brann should be down there with the " ..
                "other half of the keystone now. I have instructed him on the use of the device. He " ..
                "awaits your presence.\n\nI will do what I can to keep the iron dwarves occupied, but I " ..
                "do not have confidence that I will hold them for long. King Stormheart is returning to " ..
                "the defense of Frosthold with some of his men shortly. Please hurry, <race>.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [12883] = {
            description = "Minions be hearin' da call of your masta! Da Lich King be givin' Drakuru full " ..
                "control of da armies of da Scourge in Zul'Drak. We be commanded ta kill " ..
                "everyting.\n\nEVERYTING MUST DIE!\n\nWe be processin' all da corpses in da Dead Fields " ..
                "and sendin' em up ta Prince Navarius' crew in Zeramas for Scourgin'! Notin' goes ta " ..
                "waste on Drakuru's watch!\n\nSoon we be drinkin' da blood of da prophets ta become " ..
                "stronger dan eva before! Zul'Drak and Gundrak gonna fall to da Scourge!",
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
            rewardMoney = 118000,
        },
        [12884] = {
            description = "West of here, across the ruined roads and structures, is the death knight " ..
                "encampment of Ebon Watch.\n\n< Crusader Lord Lantinga rolls up Drakuru's " ..
                "orders.>\n\nTake these orders and deliver them to Stefan Vadu. He is the death knight in " ..
                "command at Ebon Watch. Let him know that the Argent Crusade will deal with Prince " ..
                "Navarius. They'll have to handle Drakuru.\n\nBe careful, <name>. The way to Ebon Watch " ..
                "is teeming with Scourge.",
        },
        [12885] = {
            description = "The Storm Peaks are an intriguing place, but there's far more here than titan " ..
                "ruins. The peoples who live here face a dire threat in Loken and his minions.\n\nHe sent " ..
                "his favorite servants, the iron dwarves, on a brutal campaign against all the creatures " ..
                "of stone. He expelled the earthen from Ulduar, forcing them to take shelter at " ..
                "Bouldercrag's Refuge, on the face of a mountain west of the Inventor's Library. " ..
                "Bouldercrag and his brethren are beset by the iron dwarves there. Find and help them, " ..
                "<name>.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [12886] = {
            description = "This is it. You've passed all the tests of the Hyldsmeet... all but one. " ..
                "You've risen among our sisters' best and fiercest.\n\nThe final test is at hand. The " ..
                "Drakkensryd - the true test of a Hyldnir's worth and warrior spirit. It'll be you, your " ..
                "riding drake, a chained harpoon and a score of your sisters vying for dominance.\n\nShow " ..
                "no quarter. None will be expected.",
            rewardChoices = {{42841, 1}, {42865, 1}, {42876, 1}, {42887, 1}},
        },
        [12887] = {
            description = "The Knights of the Ebon Blade want to take the Scourge base known as The " ..
                "Shadow Vault to the northwest. I have a contact in their group who has asked for " ..
                "help.\n\nThe first step is to blind the Lich King. He's using a device known as The " ..
                "Ocular to watch the area, which floats above the vault's spires.\n\nOur dwarves have " ..
                "created something for you to use against it. After the 'eye' has been destroyed, find " ..
                "Baron Sliver on the vault grounds. He's pretending to still be under the Lich King's " ..
                "will.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12888] = {
            description = "This card allows the user to access the control panel of the scrapbot " ..
                "designated SCRAP-E, in order to perform maintenance and reprogram the bot's " ..
                "directives.\n\nSCRAP-E appears to be assigned to the interior of the building at The " ..
                "Inventor's Library. The card displays a list of the bot's broken components and failing " ..
                "systems. With the proper parts, the bot can be restored to working condition.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12889] = {
            description = "Designation SCRAP-E.\n\nDirective: Maintain consoles and databases of " ..
                "Inventor's Library in Keeper Mimir's absences.\n\nTime since last maintenance cycle: 489 " ..
                "days.\n\nStatus of schematic data: unknown.\n\nCurrent tasks: Repair prototype console.",
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [12891] = {
            description = "When I was in the - ahem - employ of the Lich King, we would often use a " ..
                "device known as a sovereign rod to keep some of the more intelligent Scourge in " ..
                "line.\n\nI require that you assist me in the construction of a new one.\n\nLuckily for " ..
                "you, all of the necessary components are at hand: a cultist rod, an abomination hook, a " ..
                "geist rope, and a handful of Scourge essences.\n\nThis should not be difficult, <class>.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12892] = {
            description = "The Knights of the Ebon Blade want to take the Scourge base known as The " ..
                "Shadow Vault to the northwest. I have a contact in their group who has asked for " ..
                "help.\n\nThe first step is to blind the Lich King. He's using a device known as The " ..
                "Ocular to watch the area, which floats above the vault's spires.\n\nOur goblins have " ..
                "created something for you to use against it. After the 'eye' has been destroyed, find " ..
                "Baron Sliver on the vault grounds. He's pretending to still be under the Lich King's " ..
                "will.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12893] = {
            description = "Vile, Lady Nightswood, and The Leaper would make excellent weapons in the " ..
                "fight against the Lich King if they can be broken from his will. That is what the " ..
                "Sovereign Rod is for.\n\nYou'll find them on the ledges to the east and west of the " ..
                "vault, as well as on the mid-tier of the vault above us. The rod is to be used upon the " ..
                "corpses of the three.\n\nFly now. We will have them as our own!",
            rewardChoices = {{43925, 1}, {43874, 1}, {43926, 1}, {43849, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [12894] = {
            description = "Crusader Dargath, Crusader MacKellar, Engineer Reed and the twins, Gerk and " ..
                "Burr, were sent to the Dead Fields to establish a battle front days ago. As of my last " ..
                "correspondence with them, they had successfully established a camp on the border of the " ..
                "Dead Fields, northwest of here.\n\nIn light of this newfound information about Drakuru " ..
                "and Prince Navarius I think it would be prudent to send someone to the Crusader Forward " ..
                "Camp post-haste.\n\nPack up your belongings, <name>. You must leave at once!",
        },
        [12895] = {
            description = "Before we left, I received the file Scout Vor'takh compiled on this Brann " ..
                "Bronzebeard. There can be no doubt that Brann was headed for the Storm Peaks from his " ..
                "journal entries and findings in Grizzly Hills. Before we crashed, I caught sight of a " ..
                "campsite south of here, across the Foot Steppes, and overlooking the frozen Bor's Breath " ..
                "River.\n\nIf Brann isn't there, search the camp and its environs for any clues as to " ..
                "where that blasted dwarf might've gone. Bring back anything you find.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12896] = {
            description = "Death knights, such as General Lightsbane, are held on too tight of a leash to " ..
                "be able to be turned from the Lich King's will except under the most extraordinary " ..
                "circumstances.\n\nThe general keeps himself within the vault overseeing the creation of " ..
                "new weapons. Disturb one of his weapon racks at the northern forge and I assure you, he " ..
                "will come. I'll send Vile, Lady Nightswood, and The Leaper in to help you.\n\nIf we are " ..
                "to finally own The Shadow Vault, General Lightsbane must fall!",
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [12897] = {
            description = "Death knights, such as General Lightsbane, are held on too tight of a leash to " ..
                "be able to be turned from the Lich King's will except under the most extraordinary " ..
                "circumstances.\n\nThe general keeps himself within the vault overseeing the creation of " ..
                "new weapons. Disturb one of his weapon racks at the northern forge and I assure you, he " ..
                "will come. I'll send Vile, Lady Nightswood, and The Leaper in to help you.\n\nIf we are " ..
                "to finally own The Shadow Vault, General Lightsbane must fall!",
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [12901] = {
            description = "Prince Navarius must be stopped. We can't let the Scourge continue to use this " ..
                "area as a zombie factory. If we can get the tank operational we might stand a chance. " ..
                "What I need right now are spare parts.\n\nNorthwest of here is an area called Thrym's " ..
                "End. The Scourge armies are using the area as a base of sorts. Spread out across the " ..
                "base is the wreckage from their arrival. Bits and pieces of Scourge scrap metal litter " ..
                "the landscape. Get that stuff to me and I'll try and put it to good use.",
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
        },
        [12902] = {
            description = "These poor creatures are the only survivors.\n\nAccording to their chief, the " ..
                "Drakkari trolls and Rageclaw wolvar have been allies for thousands of years. They've " ..
                "been living here, alongside the trolls, for generations, completely unaware of the ever " ..
                "changing world around them. To the Rageclaw, a troll is a troll, so the troll attack " ..
                "upon their den took them by surprise.\n\nWe need some answers, <name>. Scour their " ..
                "village - southeast of here - for clues as to who or what is in charge of these attacks.",
        },
        [12903] = {
            description = "We were attacked by Prince Navarius and at least a dozen Scourge. I told " ..
                "Dargath and the twins to stay inside the tank, but they wouldn't listen. Dargath looked " ..
                "me in the eyes and said, \"If somebody doesn't get out of this tank, they'll kill us " ..
                "all.\" He then made Reed cut the engine and charged. Most heroic thing I've ever " ..
                "seen.\n\nI heard the Prince barking orders to the monsters. Sounded like he was taking " ..
                "them to Thrym's End, northwest of here. We have to rescue our friends. Will you go look " ..
                "for them?",
            rewardChoices = {{39816, 1}, {39886, 1}, {39890, 1}, {39889, 1}},
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
        },
        [12904] = {
            description = "They... They killed my brother.\n\n< Gerk fights back tears.>\n\nSlaughtered " ..
                "him like he was some sort of animal. Now they got him laid out on one of their tables on " ..
                "the other side of the camp, ready for their grisly experiments. Dargath's dead too. The " ..
                "paladin made a heroic stand at the ruins to the northeast, but the leader of the Vargul, " ..
                "Algar, was too strong.\n\nI'm all that's left and I'll be dead soon too. I... I'm " ..
                "turning.\n\nIf the Light won't grant me vengeance, maybe you will, <class>. Kill them " ..
                "all.",
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
            rewardMoney = 124000,
        },
        [12905] = {
            description = "Our deal is made then, <name>. You help me get out of these chains and I'll " ..
                "help you find your little green friend.\n\nThe Hyldnir who runs this mine is known as " ..
                "Mildred the Cruel -- and with good reason.\n\nTell her you've been sent to lend a hand " ..
                "with the mines. Do whatever she asks until she trusts you with the keys to my shackles.",
        },
        [12907] = {
            description = "For every action there is an opposite reaction, sister. In the case of us " ..
                "applying pressure on the males, this has meant newly spread rumors of " ..
                "insurrection.\n\nThe bearded pig behind this rabble-rousing is called Garhal. Put an end " ..
                "to him... and make sure the other males see his demise. They must learn that " ..
                "insubordination will not be tolerated.",
            rewardMoney = 36000,
        },
        [12908] = {
            description = "You are without mercy. You will do well around these parts.\n\nI have another " ..
                "task to ask of you. There is a female vrykul prisoner that's become more of a liability " ..
                "than I had anticipated.\n\nShe had the gall to claim the right to take part in the " ..
                "Hyldsmeet, our sacred competition of strength and fighting prowess.\n\nHere's the key to " ..
                "her shackles. Make it as painless as possible. She's a female after all, even if not one " ..
                "of us.",
        },
        [12909] = {
            description = "In order to track down Brann, we're going to need a creature with a keen sense " ..
                "of smell and a good tracking ability. There weren't any hounds on the zeppelin, but I " ..
                "think I have a substitute.\n\nAfter the crash, I sent Khaliisi down the east face of the " ..
                "mountain to start hunting for food. Her cat, Frostbite, excels at tracking prey in the " ..
                "snow. Tell her that she'll have to part with her companion for a while, at least. She " ..
                "can hunt on her own, but we have no other way of catching up to Brann Bronzebeard.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [12910] = {
            description = "Boktar can have his way this time, but I'll expect him to make it up to me. " ..
                "Don't look at me like that. Boktar may be in command, but no one tells a hunter what to " ..
                "do.\n\n'Put that beast away,' he says. 'Make it stop growling.'\n\nAll of a sudden he " ..
                "changes his mind when it suits him. Next time he complains, Frostbite'll just nip him a " ..
                "bit. Don't worry, she'll do an admirable job tracking your prey. After she locates her " ..
                "target, you're on your own to deal with iron dwarves, or Brann, or whatever you find.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12912] = {
            description = "You are not like the others, little one. You do not reek of the ancient death. " ..
                "Perhaps you can be trusted.\n\nI am Gymer, king of the storm giants. I was lured here by " ..
                "my brother, Thiassi, now an undead servant of the Lich King. By the time I realized that " ..
                "his cry for help was a trap, it was too late. I am now a prisoner of the Scourge and I " ..
                "fear that soon I will suffer the same fate as many of the other storm giants.\n\nFind a " ..
                "way to release me from this cage and I will aid you to the best of my ability.",
        },
        [12913] = {
            description = "<Brann begins gesticulating wildly and rambling in his native " ..
                "language.>\n\nRuk MogOth red a mogoth ta eft Thros-garE Haldir.\n\nKha gor ruk khaz ta " ..
                "ke ruk hrim eft thros-am-kha ruk kost-um havar go kost.\n\nA modoss hine ruk bergum eft " ..
                "thros-am-kha ga eft Haldir ke loch Thon we lo gefrunon ta mitta.\n\nGar Ruk dagUm loch " ..
                "angor-magi ta har ruk!\n\n<After a few moments, you realize the conversation is going " ..
                "nowhere. Perhaps the shaman, Moteha Windborn, at the Grom'arsh Crash-Site will know what " ..
                "to do.>",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [12914] = {
            description = "Now you say that he's locked up in a 100 foot tall cage, eh?\n\nIf my " ..
                "calculations are correct, we should be able to at least weaken the hinges on the cage, " ..
                "giving the giant enough leeway to break out.\n\nIf this is going to work I'm going to " ..
                "need some plasticizers and stabilizers.\n\nBanshee essence should do nicely for the " ..
                "plasticizer. You can get that from the banshees in the Dead Fields, northeast of us. The " ..
                "stabilizer can be found on the earthragers to the southwest, near Ebon Watch.\n\nGet a " ..
                "move on!",
        },
        [12915] = {
            description = "If I hope to wrest control of the Temple of the Makers from my brother, I must " ..
                "make amends with my old allies.\n\nPerhaps by eliminating a common enemy, we may at " ..
                "least take a step towards renewing my friendship with the frost giants.\n\nFjorn has " ..
                "besieged Dun Niffelem with giants of iron. You must defeat him at Fjorn 's Anvil, far to " ..
                "the east of here, and weaken his forces sufficiently for the Sons of Hodir to emerge " ..
                "victorious.\n\nTake this charm, <name>. Use it to summon my earthen to your aid.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12916] = {
            description = "What I'm about to give you is called seaforium. It is a highly volatile " ..
                "explosive with some unique properties. Due to its malleable nature, you will be able to " ..
                "fill in the hinges and cracks of the cage for maximum damage.\n\nReturn to your friend " ..
                "and use the jumbo seaforium charge to set him free.\n\nLet's hope he honors the bargain. " ..
                "He's our only hope.",
        },
        [12917] = {
            description = "I suppose we shouldn't have expected to find Brann so easily, not with our " ..
                "luck. If we can make sense of what Brann is saying, you can persuade him to give up his " ..
                "location.\n\nThe power of the wind is strong in these mountains, and it may prove a " ..
                "great boon to us. A knowledgeable shaman can hear the sound of all the world's tongues " ..
                "on the wind.\n\nTo the northwest, on the Snowdrift Plains, you will find beings made of " ..
                "wind, the stormriders. Capture their voices and bring them to me.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12919] = {
            description = "My people have been decimated by the Lich King. The Scourge now use the " ..
                "corpses of storm giants to create mindless flesh giants, or worse, stitched together " ..
                "aberrations like Thrym.\n\nI will stop at nothing to see them all driven from this " ..
                "world. We will work together to destroy the Scourge that threaten Zul'Drak.\n\nWe will " ..
                "kill them all: Navarius, Algar and Thrym!\n\nWhen you are ready, let me know and we will " ..
                "begin our destructive journey.",
            rewardChoices = {{41826, 1}, {41829, 1}, {41844, 1}, {41845, 1}, {41846, 1}},
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
            rewardMoney = 186000,
        },
        [12920] = {
            description = "What are you waiting for? The language barrier has been broken, thanks to " ..
                "Moteha. Contact Brann Bronzebeard and find out anything you can about where he's hiding " ..
                "and what he's chasing after.\n\nMaybe we can still salvage something from this disaster.",
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [12921] = {
            description = "Excellent. There's an exit in the eastern end of the mine that leads to " ..
                "Brunnhildar Village. Follow it and I'll meet you there.\n\nWe must not be seen together " ..
                "so no one suspects you of aiding me. I'll use my magic to disguise my appearance. Do not " ..
                "worry, <race> -- we'll find your friend in no time.",
        },
        [12922] = {
            description = "Beneath its porous exterior, this hunk of metal gleams with a mysterious " ..
                "quality.\n\nYou feel it would only be prudent to burn off the slag at Fjorn's " ..
                "Anvil.\n\nAs you ponder where in this frozen waste you might find something hot enough " ..
                "for the job, a fire revenant crosses your path...",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12925] = {
            description = "The Lich King sent emissaries to us on three different occasions. All three " ..
                "were promptly dismembered.\n\nOur sisters in Valkyrion were not as dedicated to our " ..
                "traditions and accepted the Scourge's advances. Now instead of capturing their drakes " ..
                "from the wild, they raise them from the blight and filth that the Scourge wallow " ..
                "in.\n\nTake the frost oil that the Valkyrion Hyldnir carry on them and use it to freeze " ..
                "any blighted eggs you find. Rumors speak of a fetid pool of blight where the eggs are " ..
                "kept.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12926] = {
            description = "We've seen the iron dwarves and their constructs making war on the creatures " ..
                "of stone that Brann calls the earthen, along with their giant allies. Contact him and " ..
                "aid him in any way you can, and remember that anything we can learn from his search may " ..
                "aid us in fighting against the iron dwarves and their master.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12927] = {
            description = "That disk you assembled... it's blank! Keeper Mimir, the tinker who built this " ..
                "library, must've hidden the information elsewhere. Look around the Inventor's Library; " ..
                "do you see any databanks there?\n\nThat might be the disk's purpose. Try using it near " ..
                "some of those databanks. Perhaps it's set to retrieve and store information from them. " ..
                "After you've tried your hand at that, contact me again and let me know what you've " ..
                "found. Meanwhile, I'll be trying to track down the other half of the archive key.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12928] = {
            description = "Charging inventor's disk.\n\nDisk charging completed.\n\nPreparing emergency " ..
                "protocol gamma.\n\nEmergency protocol loaded. Please use the charged disk to activate " ..
                "the guardian of Norgannon's shell, Archivist Mechaton. The archivist will release the " ..
                "shell once your identity has been verified.\n\nPlease have a pleasant millennium.",
            rewardChoices = {{42794, 1}, {42807, 1}, {42819, 1}, {42824, 1}, {42831, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12929] = {
            description = "The earthen who once inhabited, built, and maintained Ulduar were ousted from " ..
                "their home when Loken took over the city. Since then, his iron dwarf followers have " ..
                "relentlessly attacked the exiles.\n\nThey have taken refuge in an old titan building, " ..
                "which they now call Bouldercrag's Refuge, on the face of a mountain west of the " ..
                "Inventor's Library. Bouldercrag and his brethren fight to keep the irons from " ..
                "overrunning their haven, but they cannot hold their ground long. Find and help them, " ..
                "<name>.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [12930] = {
            description = "It seems so long ago that these hammers pounded and hewed stone instead of " ..
                "iron. Our expulsion from Ulduar saw the weakest of us dead and the strongest of our " ..
                "craftsmen reborn as warriors.\n\nAs the irons beat us back, even the strongest find " ..
                "themselves failing.\n\nWe can do little for the wounded, save when we have a stock of " ..
                "enchanted earth. We used to mine it from the deposits on the sheer cliff face to the " ..
                "northwest, but the constant battle has prevented us from replenishing our stock. Would " ..
                "you help?",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12931] = {
            description = "The refuge's defenders have done their best to blunt the iron dwarves' " ..
                "attacks, but we keep losing ground inch by inch. My men are hardy, but not tireless. " ..
                "Without reinforcements, it's only a matter of time until we will be overrun.\n\nWould " ..
                "you lend your skills to the refuge's defense? It would greatly improve the morale of the " ..
                "defenders and give them -- and me -- hope of mounting a counterattack.\n\nKill any of " ..
                "the stormforged or their creations you encounter outside the refuge.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12932] = {
            description = "I'll tell you what, buddy, this place is a far cry from the rolling plains of " ..
                "Nagrand. These trolls are dirtier than ogres; but hey, I go where the gold's at! So " ..
                "welcome to Zul'Drak, pal.\n\nYou're new to this racket, so let me set you straight. I'm " ..
                "the fight promoter and this feisty troll next to me is Wodin, my bodyguard. You're the " ..
                "entertainment. When you wanna fight, let me know and I'll set up the match.\n\nIf you're " ..
                "ready and got a group of friends with you, we can start! What do you say?",
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
            rewardMoney = 195000,
        },
        [12933] = {
            description = "This next match is a doozy, buddy! Apparently some magnataur from the " ..
                "Dragonblight wants a piece of the action. You ever fought one of those before? All I can " ..
                "tell you is to aim high!\n\nWe'll get this party started when you give me the word.",
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
            rewardMoney = 195000,
        },
        [12934] = {
            description = "I'm not gonna lie to you, pal. You might be overmatched here. This next one is " ..
                "a being from the elemental planes! I don't even know what's gonna show up in that " ..
                "arena!\n\nIf you think you're up to it, get in there and give 'em hell!",
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
            rewardMoney = 195000,
        },
        [12936] = {
            description = "You're not gonna believe this, pal. Your next fight is against Korrak the " ..
                "Bloodrager! Looks like the Drakkari trolls are pulling a power play! And let me tell " ..
                "you, buddy, he's been sippin' the animal god juice. He's good and ready to pound you " ..
                "into the ground.\n\nAre you ready?",
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
            rewardMoney = 195000,
        },
        [12937] = {
            description = "The refuge's defenders fight bravely, but they cannot keep up with the iron " ..
                "onslaught.\n\nWith the earth you collected, I can make bandages to help heal the wounds " ..
                "of some of the fallen. The more defenders we can patch up, the longer we'll last out " ..
                "there.\n\nTake these poultices and use them to heal the wounds of the fallen defenders " ..
                "outside the refuge. Get as many back into the battle as possible, <name>. Every casualty " ..
                "is one too many.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12938] = {
            description = "We need you focused, <name>. We're barely holding The Shadow Vault as it is. " ..
                "As you can see, we've greatly angered the Lich King.\n\n<The baron chuckles.>\n\nI need " ..
                "you to speak with Duke Lankral. He's in charge here now. You'll find him inside the " ..
                "vault building proper.\n\nWere I you, I would not keep him waiting.",
        },
        [12939] = {
            description = "The first step we're going to take is at a place in Jotunheim called the " ..
                "Savage Ledge. It's just over the mountains to the west.\n\nOn the ledge the vrykul " ..
                "warriors are always sparring, being instructed in the finer arts of battle by their " ..
                "thane's men.\n\nI want you to take this flag and issue a challenge to a number of them. " ..
                "Let's demoralize them with the 'mere' skills of a <race>, shall we?\n\n<The duke grins, " ..
                "his rotting teeth flashing in the dim light of the vault.>",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12942] = {
            description = "Traitors. We Hyldnir have little love for them.\n\nThe dwellers of Valkyrion " ..
                "have gone unpunished for far too long. While we remained loyal to Thorim, they became " ..
                "the Lich King's lapdogs!\n\nThey call the ones who receive his gift val'kyr. They fly on " ..
                "feathered wings, like the harpies they are.\n\nYou will find Valkyrion far to the " ..
                "northwest, beyond the Temple of Storms. Slay these winged she-wolves, sister. Slay them " ..
                "and I will reward you with one of my most prized possessions.",
            rewardChoices = {{42849, 1}, {42862, 1}, {42872, 1}, {42883, 1}, {42892, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12948] = {
            description = "This is the end, my friend! Your last opponent is going to be your greatest " ..
                "challenge. He's a vrykul champion from the steppes of Icecrown and he's out for blood! " ..
                "Defeat him and you'll be crowned the champion of the Amphitheater of Anguish! This fight " ..
                "is going to make us both rich!\n\nLet me know when you're ready and we'll start.",
            rewardChoices = {{41815, 1}, {41816, 1}, {41821, 1}, {41822, 1}, {41824, 1}, {41825, 1}},
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
            rewardMoney = 204000,
        },
        [12949] = {
            description = "<class>, the key to my shackles is hanging around the neck of Instructor " ..
                "Hroegar outside.\n\nPerhaps you could retrieve it by separating his head from his " ..
                "shoulders?",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12951] = {
            description = "The most important thing that you can do right now is to return to The Shadow " ..
                "Vault and let Baron Sliver know that I've failed.\n\nYou see, I wasn't the only one " ..
                "captured by these vrykul devils. My entire contingent of death knights was also " ..
                "taken.\n\nI should have seen the trap before it was sprung, but there's no use crying " ..
                "over spilled milk now is there?\n\nGo on before you get captured, too! I'll see you back " ..
                "at the vault.",
            rewardMoney = 19000,
        },
        [12954] = {
            description = "I was wondering when you'd show up, <name>! Having a past champion of the Ring " ..
                "of Blood here will be a huge draw! We're gonna be rich, buddy! RICH!\n\nAnyway, this " ..
                "dump is Zul'Drak. All the ice trolls seem to use it as a toilet. I dunno, the whole " ..
                "place is off its rocker if you ask me! Who cares, though, right? We're here to make some " ..
                "gold!\n\nYou know the drill, <name>. When you're ready let me know and we'll get this " ..
                "show on the road!",
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
            rewardMoney = 195000,
        },
        [12956] = {
            description = "Clearly, this is more than an ordinary hunk of metal.\n\nUnlike any ore you're " ..
                "familiar with, it is hard but not brittle, far lighter than it looks, and glows even " ..
                "when cool.\n\nLooking closer, you can make out one of Thorim 's runes shining beneath " ..
                "the surface....",
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [12957] = {
            description = "To the southwest, on the western side of the Snowdrift Plains, the iron " ..
                "dwarves have dug a mine into the hillside. There, they use captive mechagnomes, servants " ..
                "of Keeper Mimir, to mine ore.\n\nI don't know where these mechagnomes came from, nor " ..
                "what they would do with their freedom, but perhaps we can win their help.\n\nGo to the " ..
                "Frozen Mine, <name>, and set these creatures free from their bondage. Ask if they would " ..
                "fight alongside us against iron dwarf tyranny.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12958] = {
            description = "A wealthy shipping concern has requested a collection of Blood Jade Amulets to " ..
                "sell at Undermine. If you can bring me one, I can reward you with a Dalaran " ..
                "Jewelcrafter's Token.",
            rewardMoney = 15,
        },
        [12959] = {
            description = "A wealthy shipping concern has requested a collection of Glowing Ivory " ..
                "Figurines to sell at Undermine. If you can bring me one, I can reward you with a Dalaran " ..
                "Jewelcrafter's Token.",
            rewardMoney = 102000,
        },
        [12960] = {
            description = "A wealthy shipping concern has requested a collection of Wicked Sun Brooches " ..
                "to sell at Undermine. If you can bring me one, I can reward you with a Dalaran " ..
                "Jewelcrafter's Token.",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
        },
        [12961] = {
            description = "A wealthy shipping concern has requested a collection of Intricate Bone " ..
                "Figurines to sell at Undermine. If you can bring me one, I can reward you with a Dalaran " ..
                "Jewelcrafter's Token.",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
        },
        [12962] = {
            description = "A wealthy shipping concern has requested a collection of Bright Armor Relics " ..
                "to sell at Undermine. If you can bring me one, I can reward you with a Dalaran " ..
                "Jewelcrafter's Token.",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
        },
        [12963] = {
            description = "A wealthy shipping concern has requested a collection of Shifting Sun Curios " ..
                "to sell at Undermine. If you can bring me one, I can reward you with a Dalaran " ..
                "Jewelcrafter's Token.",
            rewardMoney = 15,
        },
        [12964] = {
            description = "At the Frozen Mine in the western part of the Snowdrift Plains, the " ..
                "stormforged iron dwarves have constructed a mine manned by slaves.\n\nIt's well behind " ..
                "the lines, so we haven't been able to find out much about what's going on there, but my " ..
                "scouts have reported seeing them remove cartloads of dark, sickly looking ore.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12965] = {
            description = "The one who commands the stormforged iron dwarves is called Runeseer Valduran. " ..
                "Although I have never seen them, it is said that his master, Keeper Loken, who took over " ..
                "Ulduar, has given Valduran powerful titan artifacts.\n\nIt could explain the strength " ..
                "and ferocity my men see in the stormforged warriors.\n\nValduran's base, Nidavelir, lies " ..
                "to the southwest, across the Snowdrift Plains. Go there, <name>, and neutralize his " ..
                "power. Destroy these gifts of Loken's and help us to sap the strength of his followers.",
            rewardChoices = {{42795, 1}, {42820, 1}, {42827, 1}, {42808, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12966] = {
            description = "<Jokkum listens patiently to your request, then ponders it carefully before " ..
                "responding.>\n\nSo it is you we have to thank for Fjorn's demise?\n\nWhile it's true " ..
                "that you have aided us in our time of need, there is still much that must be done to " ..
                "repair our relations with Thorim.\n\nFor now, I shall allow Njormeld to reforge the " ..
                "armor we gifted to the Stormlord so many ages ago. Consider it payment for your " ..
                "assistance against Fjorn.\n\nNjormeld was sent to recover Fjorn's anvil. You should find " ..
                "him there.",
        },
        [12967] = {
            description = "Snorri was once the pride of our nation. A mighty warrior, many an enemy fell " ..
                "to his club.\n\nWe honor him, though he's no longer what he once was. Age has taken its " ..
                "toll, dulling his senses and sapping his strength. Still, he remains as proud as ever, " ..
                "never missing an opportunity to join a battle.\n\nSpeaking of battle, we're cooling " ..
                "Fjorn's anvil so it can be taken home. The remaining fire revenants are putting up some " ..
                "resistance. Help Snorri relive his glory days, <race>. Guide him against this enemy.",
        },
        [12968] = {
            description = "The witch that started it all, Yulda the Stormspeaker came to our very " ..
                "village. She dared to insult our noble traditions and spouted the Lich King's venomous " ..
                "promises of power.\n\nShe ought to have left with a sword through her, but her magic was " ..
                "strong and she managed to escape.\n\nSeek her in Valkyrion inside the largest dwelling " ..
                "and show her that we are not to be trifled with.",
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [12969] = {
            description = "I trust that's the green little one you've been looking for. If I were you I'd " ..
                "step in before that Hyldnir splits him in half.\n\nYou've arrived in the middle of the " ..
                "Hyldsmeet, so all challenges must be accepted by participants. There's nothing to stop " ..
                "you from taking your green friend's place.",
        },
        [12970] = {
            description = "Whether you've noticed or not, by defeating your first Hyldnir in hand-to-hand " ..
                "combat, you've entered the Hyldsmeet -- the great competition of Hyldnir against Hyldnir " ..
                "to determine who will rule by Thorim's side.\n\nThe Hyldsmeet is the reason why I was " ..
                "imprisoned, for I sought to partake in the competition but was far too old and frail to " ..
                "be a match for the Hyldnir.\n\nIf you're willing to listen, I've a proposal for you.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [12971] = {
            description = "Let's get you started. The good news is that by defeating Agnetta, you've " ..
                "earned yourself a spot in the next round of matches.\n\nThe bad news is that all your " ..
                "opponents will also have defeated someone in the first round. Do not expect pushovers.",
            rewardChoices = {{42868, 1}, {42879, 1}, {42890, 1}, {43204, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12972] = {
            description = "You've succeeded in the first rounds of the Hyldsmeet. To advance further, " ..
                "you're going to need a warbear of your own.\n\nUnfortunately, the Hyldnir don't give " ..
                "them out to just anyone. You'll have to emerge victorious from true battle, not just " ..
                "gladiatorial combat.\n\nThe Hyldnir of Brunnhildar are currently involved in a feud " ..
                "against the Sons of Hodir, Thorim's former allies. Speak to Brijana just outside the " ..
                "village and see how you can help them and prove yourself in the process.",
        },
        [12974] = {
            description = "Pfft, what happens down here ain't fightin'. It's a couple of guys dancin' " ..
                "around a flag.\n\nYou lookin' for some real action, buddy? 'Cause if you are I got the " ..
                "hottest ticket in town.\n\nEver heard of Gurgthock and Wodin? Goblin and troll who ran " ..
                "the Ring of Blood back in Outland? Well they're here in Northrend and they've started up " ..
                "a whole new fight club over in Zul'Drak. If you're interested go to Zul'Drak, east of " ..
                "Crystalsong. They're at the big arena in the center. Tell 'em Shifty sent ya!",
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
        },
        [12975] = {
            description = "Surely Thorim has told you of the tragedy that divides us.\n\nIt was in " ..
                "Thunderfall, northeast of here, that these events unfolded. The frozen fossils there are " ..
                "a reminder of that dark day, as are the spirits that haunt that place.\n\nIf my people " ..
                "are to forgive Thorim, something must take the place of those images. A memorial must be " ..
                "constructed to bring our hearts peace.\n\nGo there, <race>. Collect the fragments of " ..
                "Hodir's Horn that was shattered that day.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12976] = {
            description = "Bring these fragments to Njormeld. He will use the pieces of that sacred relic " ..
                "in the construction of a mighty monument.\n\nMay it soothe the pains and heal the scars " ..
                "my people have borne these many years.\n\nMay its presence help to bring about a new age " ..
                "that sees us once again in glorious battle at Thorim's side.\n\nGo now, <class>. " ..
                "Njormeld awaits you.",
            rewardMoney = 37000,
        },
        [12977] = {
            description = "You have done a great service to the giants of Dun Niffelem. Without your aid, " ..
                "this monument would not exist.\n\nAs you silently ponder its significance, feelings " ..
                "begin to flood your heart. The feelings fill your mind with thoughts and images... as " ..
                "well as a sense of urgency.\n\nThe sensations fade and leave you with a knowledge of " ..
                "what you must do. The restless spirits at Thunderfall must be put to rest.\n\nAs you set " ..
                "off, you find that your hands have been filled with an ethereal horn.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12978] = {
            description = "Like Bouldercrag, I once served the keepers as a craftsman in Ulduar, but with " ..
                "Loken's betrayal, I turned my hammer toward our new foes.\n\nWhen we could spare the " ..
                "men, I led raids on Nidavelir to relieve the pressure on our defenders, but our lines " ..
                "are near collapse.\n\nYou've proven yourself a capable combatant and a staunch ally. " ..
                "Perhaps you'd be willing to take up our banner and take the fight to Nidavelir, the iron " ..
                "dwarf stronghold to the southwest, across the Snowdrift Plains.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12979] = {
            description = "This armor plate is thick and oversized compared to the rest of the golem's " ..
                "defenses. A quick examination of the golem's corpse reveals that this heavier plate " ..
                "seems to have been bolted on as an afterthought or a crude upgrade.\n\nWhy would the " ..
                "iron dwarves have added this redundant and mismatched armor to their war " ..
                "golems?\n\nPerhaps Bruor Ironbane would know if he had the chance to examine several of " ..
                "these plates from stormforged war golems.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12980] = {
            description = "The presence of that armor plate is disorienting, but we need to find out all " ..
                "we can from it. It could be part of one of Valduran's schemes.\n\nHe's dedicated an " ..
                "extraordinary amount of effort to mining, refining, smithing, and testing this " ..
                "metal.\n\nTo the east, along the northern mountain face, is a building called Mimir's " ..
                "Workshop. It hasn't been used in quite some time, but if we're lucky, some of its " ..
                "attendants are still functional. Take your armor plate there and learn what you can from " ..
                "it.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12981] = {
            description = "As you stare at the anvil you relive your recent accomplishments, particularly " ..
                "those which brought this artifact to rest here.\n\nIt suddenly occurs to you that more " ..
                "remains to be done. To the east, smoldering scraps clutter the landscape--shrapnel from " ..
                "the battle fought there.\n\nIf they could be cooled and gathered somehow, the frost " ..
                "giants would have an abundant supply of metal and the region would be cleared of these " ..
                "remnants of war.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12982] = {
            description = "Now that I'm back, I'm certain that the baron will want me to recover my men. " ..
                "I can see that we're barely hanging on here. The Lich King's forces are about to break " ..
                "through and we won't be able to hold without my captured death knights.\n\nCan you " ..
                "assist me once more, <name>?\n\nGo back to Jotunheim and let them out of those cages. " ..
                "Break the damn locks, I don't care what you have to do. The vrykul likely have the " ..
                "keys.\n\nJust get my men free!",
            rewardChoices = {{43844, 1}, {43859, 1}, {43910, 1}, {43935, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12983] = {
            description = "For as long as I can remember, we've obtained our best bears from the Hibernal " ..
                "Cave to the east.\n\nThose times might finally be gone. The cave has been overrun by " ..
                "ravenous jormungar and the wild bears are all but extinct.\n\nIf you were to find a " ..
                "surviving matriarch, however, I would guarantee you that she would fight better than any " ..
                "of these bears born in captivity.\n\nTake this harness to the Hibernal Cave and rescue a " ..
                "surviving matriarch. Good luck finding one.",
        },
        [12985] = {
            description = "Greetings, <race>.\n\nI have a task that King Jokkum felt you would be suited " ..
                "for, assuming you still strive to gain favor with our people.\n\nI have developed plans " ..
                "for another artifact, one that will grant Hodir's blessing of protection to our " ..
                "stronghold. I have nearly all that I require for its construction. All that remains to " ..
                "collect are the very eyes of our fallen enemies.\n\nTake this tool, and gather the eyes " ..
                "from the iron giant corpses that litter our fields.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12987] = {
            description = "The helm is forged.\n\nYour efforts have not gone unnoticed, small one. Though " ..
                "there remains much to do, we sons of Hodir are grateful for your accomplishments.\n\nIn " ..
                "return, I offer you the opportunity to present Hodir's helm to our king and our " ..
                "brethren.\n\nFly to the sparkling tip of the small ice spike in front of me and read to " ..
                "our people from this tablet.\n\nEnjoy the privilege, <class>. Never before has an " ..
                "outsider been given such an honor!",
            rewardMoney = 19000,
        },
        [12988] = {
            description = "In my folly, I'd thought Valduran's project at Narvir's Cradle, a large " ..
                "construction area to the south, no more than a grotesque monument to \"Keeper\" Loken's " ..
                "cruelty.\n\nNow we know the truth, that it was meant to be used as a weapon against us " ..
                "and our allies. We must not allow this iron colossus to reach completion, <name>, for it " ..
                "will mean the end of the refuge.\n\nGo to Narvir's Cradle, find the lightning forges the " ..
                "stormforged artisans use, and sabotage them.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12991] = {
            description = "Bouldercrag's got a good plan to stymie the efforts of the iron dwarves at " ..
                "Narvir's Cradle, and I've got an idea of my own. Work on the iron colossus will come to " ..
                "a halt without any artisans.\n\nNarvir's Cradle is on the south side of the hill " ..
                "sheltering Bouldercrag's Refuge. Go there and slay any stormforged artificers in your " ..
                "path. They may be no different from what we once were, but they build a weapon that " ..
                "threatens us all.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12993] = {
            description = "You've done an excellent job of delaying the work on the iron colossus, but I " ..
                "fear we've only made the stormforged more determined to complete the weapon.\n\nEven " ..
                "now, they're bringing in new laborers and the overseers push them to the limit. We may " ..
                "not be able to keep them from bringing the colossus online, after all. Return to " ..
                "Narvir's Cradle, to the south and find the documents detailing the colossus' offensive " ..
                "and defensive abilities. They should be near the tents and forges on the bottom level.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12994] = {
            description = "The rapport you've developed with the inhabitants of Dun Niffelem has yielded " ..
                "some unexpected discoveries.\n\nFor example, you somehow find yourself able to " ..
                "understand the denmother's guttural growls and sharp quips--at least you think you " ..
                "do.\n\nIt would seem that she senses danger outside the stronghold and wants you to do " ..
                "something about it.\n\nWith her forepaw, she removes the chain from around her neck and " ..
                "lets it drop at your feet. As you pick it up you notice an aged fang attached to it...",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12995] = {
            description = "We must attack the vrykul of Jotunheim on many levels. Brute force, of course, " ..
                "is good, but I prefer a more cerebral approach.\n\nI want you to demoralize them.\n\nMy " ..
                "men here have forged a number of banners for you. I would like for you to take and plant " ..
                "them near the corpses of fallen vrykul.\n\nLet the banners serve as a constant reminder " ..
                "to them that they face a more immediate threat than the wrath of the Lich King.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12996] = {
            description = "You've been very fortunate, sister. This is a matriarch the likes of which " ..
                "hasn't been seen in years.\n\nA good bear won't do you much good without the skill to " ..
                "ride it.\n\nI'm going to have you practice some moves on Kirgaraak. He's the largest " ..
                "yeti we've ever managed to capture so be careful. Don't be afraid to walk away if he " ..
                "gives you a beating... there's a reason why we keep him chained.",
        },
        [12997] = {
            description = "Besting a tethered opponent is one thing. Fighting other bear riders on equal " ..
                "footing is another.\n\nHead into the Pit of the Fang and use what you've learned to " ..
                "defeat your opponents. Good luck, sister.\n\nGlory awaits, should you succeed.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12998] = {
            description = "According to the documents you captured at Narvir's Cradle, the iron colossus " ..
                "is complete except for one key component -- the Heart of the Storm.\n\nWithout it, the " ..
                "iron colossus' weapons would be much weaker than the design predicts. If we can deny " ..
                "Overseer Narvir the heart, we could defeat the colossus!\n\nNotes on the documents you " ..
                "found say that the heart is in Uldis, a titan facility far to the south. Its entrance is " ..
                "on the south side of a tall mountain overlooking the Bor's Breath River.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [12999] = {
            description = "You remember Lady Nightswood, don't you? She certainly remembers you. She's " ..
                "the forlorn and very angry banshee that you 'saved' when you also broke Vile and myself " ..
                "out from under the Lich King's dominion.\n\nThe lady has gone into Jotunheim and " ..
                "possessed their bone witch. She intends to wreak havoc upon the vrykul from " ..
                "within.\n\nShe has asked that you seek her out. You'll find her in the cave on the south " ..
                "side of Njorndar Village to the southwest within Jotunheim.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [13000] = {
            description = "The cold in these mountains is brutal. We have a day or two before we burn up " ..
                "all the wood from the wreckage.\n\nWe spotted worgs inside a cave directly east of here. " ..
                "I need you to find the cave and obtain some furs. It might not sound like much, but it " ..
                "might be the difference between freezing to death and living another day.\n\nWorgs don't " ..
                "hunt alone, so I'm giving you a flare. It should buy you some time if you find yourself " ..
                "outnumbered.",
            rewardChoices = {{42788, 1}, {42801, 1}, {42813, 1}, {42832, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 71000,
        },
        [13001] = {
            description = "The time has come, little <class>. The stars have foretold of this day.\n\nI " ..
                "have received a vision from mighty Hodir himself, revealing the secret to the creation " ..
                "of a great artifact.\n\nWe must obey! Were we to fail in receiving this gift, doom would " ..
                "surely follow.\n\nI call upon you to assist me in this sacred undertaking.\n\nGo across " ..
                "the valley, deep into the Hibernal Cavern and gather everfrost shards from the icy " ..
                "crater there, then collect hides from the mammoths outside the cavern.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13003] = {
            description = "Hodir's Spear is an icon of great prowess in battle.\n\nIts mere presence " ..
                "instills a deep hunger for glory in all who enter Dun Niffelem. In fact, simply being " ..
                "near it has compelled you to test your own abilities.\n\nScanning the horizon, your " ..
                "vision locks on a wild wyrm as it flies nearby.\n\nIt is decided. Of you and he, only " ..
                "one shall see the next sunrise....",
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [13006] = {
            description = "As you draw near the helm, you notice that the frigid environment is already " ..
                "taking its toll on the artifact's surface. What is now just a thin layer of ice will " ..
                "surely grow to envelop it entirely.\n\nNot about to let your hard efforts go to waste, " ..
                "you resolve to scour the region in search of a solution.\n\nJust as you set off, the " ..
                "eyes of the helm flash and an image of the nearby Hibernal Cavern enters your mind.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13007] = {
            description = "We have failed to prevent the completion of the iron colossus, <name>, which " ..
                "means we have no choice but to face it in battle.\n\nBruor has devised a plan to exploit " ..
                "the colossus' only weakness.\n\nNo matter how tough the colossus' armor is, it is still " ..
                "vulnerable to a jormungar's acid. Take control of one using the orbs along the northern " ..
                "edge of the Snowdrift Plains, then use it to fight the iron colossus on the Snowdrift " ..
                "Plains. If you need help controlling the creature, speak to one of the nearby handlers.",
            rewardChoices = {{43200, 1}, {43201, 1}, {43202, 1}, {43203, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 222000,
        },
        [13008] = {
            description = "We had the element of surprise on our side! We blew a hole in the side of the " ..
                "mountain and charged into Scourgeholme. Scourge opposition was fierce and it wasn't long " ..
                "until we were overwhelmed. We fell back to the valley and began raining artillery down " ..
                "on the Scourge that followed. This held them back for awhile until... Those monsters " ..
                "began using crusaders as living shields. We had to stop shelling for fear of killing our " ..
                "own soldiers.\n\nFree our crusaders trapped on the field outside the base, <class>!",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [13009] = {
            description = "It remains uncertain whether or not our people can ever rekindle the affection " ..
                "we once held for Thorim.\n\nMay this armor, if nothing else, remind him of the days when " ..
                "we stood together in honor, invincible.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13010] = {
            description = "One task remains before I can reclaim my home at the Terrace of the " ..
                "Makers.\n\nKrolmir must be found.\n\nOn that fateful day, I threw it to the earth with " ..
                "all the power and rage I possessed. A mighty explosion followed.\n\nI've thought it lost " ..
                "for these many years, but now I must be certain.\n\nReturn to King Jokkum and discover " ..
                "what, if anything, he knows of my hammer's fate.",
            rewardChoices = {{42806, 1}, {42818, 1}, {42835, 1}, {42793, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [13011] = {
            description = "I have an opportunity that will help you to gain approval with my people, " ..
                "provided you prevail.\n\nThe jormungar are a nuisance best dealt with quickly. If given " ..
                "any quarter, they breed like hares and spread like fire.\n\nThey have appeared southwest " ..
                "of here, in the Hibernal Cavern. If their spawnmother is not slain soon, they will gain " ..
                "a foothold in our region.\n\nShe cannot refuse food. Take this knife and get the flank " ..
                "of a bear corpse from their cave. Place it near her crater and kill her as she feeds.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13034] = {
            description = "When I began my travels in Northrend, I visited the Borean Tundra and met the " ..
                "taunka for the first time. There, Wind Tamer Barah told me the tale of Stormhoof and his " ..
                "battle against the North Wind, their people's ancient enemy.\n\nI set out for the Storm " ..
                "Peaks to learn more of this hero, but strangely, the people of Tunka'lo seem to know " ..
                "nothing of him.\n\nPerhaps the camp's own records will give us greater insight. Find and " ..
                "read the history scrolls kept throughout the camp, then tell me what you learned.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13035] = {
            description = "The attack on the Terrace of the Makers was not a half-hearted move on my " ..
                "brother's behalf. He sent a legion of iron dwarves and some of his most powerful " ..
                "lieutenants.\n\nUse the Horn of the Peaks to call the earthen to your side and defeat " ..
                "Loken's servants.\n\nYou'll find the giant, Eisenfaust, inside the Hall of the Shaper to " ..
                "the north. You'll find the others deeper inside the Terrace of the Makers, beyond the " ..
                "stairs to the northwest.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13036] = {
            description = "Long has been the path to our salvation, young <class>. We have fought across " ..
                "continents, worlds even, to reach this point. Now we face our greatest challenge: the " ..
                "destruction of the Lich King and his Scourge.\n\nAlas, we fight this battle divided. The " ..
                "Horde and Alliance are in the throes of war and will lend us no support. We must remain " ..
                "unyielding in our cause! For what choice have we to do otherwise?\n\nDo you join the " ..
                "cause? Lend us your strength, <class>! My commander, Entari, awaits you at his post.",
        },
        [13037] = {
            description = "When the bronze dragonflight gifted me with immortality and set me on the path " ..
                "of the witness, Nozdormu entrusted me with the Lorehammer.\n\nThe hammer's reaction to " ..
                "your findings means that time has gone awry here and it is our duty to restore the true " ..
                "timeline.\n\nWe must find it. To the northwest is Frostfloe Deep, ancient burial cave of " ..
                "the warriors of Tunka'lo. Seek out the spirit of Chieftain Swiftspear, Stormhoof's " ..
                "brother. Ask him what he remembers of his brother's battle against the North Wind.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13038] = {
            description = "This, the tomb of Tunka'lo's warriors, is supposed to be a serene place, free " ..
                "from the terror of the elements.\n\nFrostfloe Deep has been invaded by a strange force, " ..
                "one that disturbs the spirits of the fallen and blurs my memories of my own " ..
                "life.\n\nIt's as though our deeds and memories are being erased from history.\n\nIn " ..
                "life, this totem was a symbol of my authority. It is the last true link I have to this " ..
                "world. Take it, use it to restore calm to the tomb, and then return it to Camp Tunka'lo.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13041] = {
            description = "I'm glad you showed up! A shipment of Glowing Ivory Figurines needs to go out " ..
                "to Undermine right now, and I am still short a Chalcedony to complete an eye for the " ..
                "last one.\n\nBring me one and a Dalaran Jeweler's token will be yours.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
        },
        [13042] = {
            description = "Deep in the bowels of The Underhalls to the northeast, a mad scientist known " ..
                "as Dr. Terrible is up to something befitting his name.\n\nThe doctor has been given " ..
                "dispensation by the Lich King to perform experiments upon the vargul -- the vrykul who " ..
                "fall in battle and are found unworthy, and then turned into Scourge.\n\nWe must put an " ..
                "end to his work, but my auguries have been unable to find him. He does, however, have an " ..
                "assistant.\n\nBeat the information out of his apprentice, and then dispose of the body.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13044] = {
            description = "Across the Valley of Echoes, west of here, and through the Breach, is the " ..
                "first Scourge encampment in Icecrown known as Scourgeholme. We fought a good fight at " ..
                "Scourgeholme and killed many Scourge, but in the end we were forced to retreat. Many " ..
                "soldiers were left behind - their fate unknown.\n\nIf there are survivors, we must " ..
                "attempt a rescue. Directly down this southeastern path is Penumbrius, ally of the bronze " ..
                "dragonflight and caretaker of the proto-brood. Seek him out and ask for his assistance.",
        },
        [13045] = {
            description = "We will do all that we can to assist you, <name>. The proto-brood have " ..
                "volunteered to fly you across the Breach and into Scourgeholme. Rescue any captured " ..
                "Argent Crusaders that you find. Return them immediately to the Vanguard Infirmary, " ..
                "located at the center of this base.\n\nChoose one of the Argent Skytalons in the pen " ..
                "behind me and go!\n\nScourgeholme is located northwest, across the Valley of Echoes, " ..
                "through the great Breach.",
            rewardMoney = 136000,
        },
        [13046] = {
            description = "Arngrim's hunger was legendary.\n\nEven in death, his expression is one of " ..
                "famished yearning. You find that just looking at him is making your stomach growl.\n\nIt " ..
                "is said that throughout his life he was never truly sated, and that there was absolutely " ..
                "nothing he wouldn't eat. You wonder to yourself if there might be a way to feed the old " ..
                "king.\n\nNo sooner does the thought enter your mind than one of the massive frozen teeth " ..
                "falls from Arngrim's head, bounces off of his beard and lands in your hand.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13048] = {
            description = "The Lorehammer can help us correct the damage to the timeline, but only if we " ..
                "can discover where the history was originally corrupted.\n\nFrom Chieftain Swiftspear " ..
                "and your findings at Frostfloe Deep, we know that the change happened around the time of " ..
                "Stormhoof's death.\n\nNow, you must go to the Howling Hollow, north of the camp, and " ..
                "inspect the gravesites the North Wind's minions have already destroyed. The Lorehammer " ..
                "will react to artifacts from Stormhoof's era and attune itself to the proper time.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13049] = {
            description = "Not all of the camp's records have yet been corrupted. My staff has helped me " ..
                "to find those records which reflect the true timeline.\n\nThey agree that Stormhoof was " ..
                "given a burial of honor among the village elders on the bottom level of the Howling " ..
                "Hollow, to the north.\n\nMost of the graves there have already been destroyed, their " ..
                "contents taken as trophies by the North Wind's subjects. Go to the hollow and see if you " ..
                "can recover Stormhoof's spear and armor from the scions of storm who have claimed them.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13050] = {
            description = "If I'm to launch an attack against my brother's army, I'm going to need some " ..
                "way to get around.\n\nI released my riding drake back into the wild years ago. Veranus " ..
                "was magnificent. The leader of her own brood -- to whom she has now returned.\n\nFinding " ..
                "her will be hard, but perhaps there's a way. She keeps her old empty nest out of pure " ..
                "pride. She's a broodmother in name only, for she is beyond the age of breeding.\n\nBring " ..
                "me small eggs from the other nests near Brunnhildar. I think I've an idea.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13051] = {
            description = "Veranus is proud like no other beast I've known. She still keeps her old nest " ..
                "and makes sure none of the younger proto-drakes takes it over.\n\nTake the eggs you've " ..
                "collected and place them on her nest. You'll find it atop a small peak, directly " ..
                "southeast of here.\n\nI should be able to get control of her before she kills you in a " ..
                "fit of rage. Hopefully.",
            rewardChoices = {{42848, 1}, {42857, 1}, {42858, 1}, {42859, 1}, {42860, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 37000,
        },
        [13054] = {
            description = "I can't in good conscience send you to the worg cave without warning you that " ..
                "the previous person we sent there hasn't returned.\n\nWe're prepared for the worst, but " ..
                "perhaps there's a chance that he's alive. We'd appreciate it if you helped him return -- " ..
                "Tracker Val'zij is one of the only hunters we have.",
            rewardMoney = 37000,
        },
        [13055] = {
            description = "It's good to see a friendly face. Might be the last one I see.\n\nOne of those " ..
                "jormungar stung me with some sort of toxin before I managed to get away. I can feel my " ..
                "whole body getting numb, mon.\n\nI'm going to need a toxin gland to make an antidote. I " ..
                "will also need some of the cave mushrooms that grow here... they'll slow the toxin " ..
                "down.\n\nHurry, please. I don't have much time.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13057] = {
            description = "It is time, <name>. I am prepared to face Loken now.\n\nLet us make our way to " ..
                "the Terrace of the Makers and face my brother's forces. The fool will regret ever " ..
                "crossing me.",
        },
        [13059] = {
            description = "I've been praying to The Lady of the Sword for one to come and strike down my " ..
                "enemy. Thane Illskar must pay for what he did to me!\n\nI was the champion of Thane " ..
                "Ufrang the Mighty. During my fight for ascendance in Valhalas, Illskar sabotaged me with " ..
                "dark magic, causing me to lose and be reduced to this.\n\nThe thane and his champions " ..
                "can be found below in The Circle of Suffering. Challenge him on my behalf. Defeat " ..
                "him.\n\nMake him know the suffering that I know!",
            rewardChoices = {{43862, 1}, {43908, 1}, {43924, 1}, {43943, 1}, {43978, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [13060] = {
            description = "So... so I don't think we're going to be getting a good foothold in those " ..
                "mountains.\n\nTrust me, I'm not one to give up easily... but between freezing engines, " ..
                "nasty vrykul women, territorial dragon want-to-bes and the half a dozen other nasties " ..
                "settled in the area, this just ain't happening.\n\nDon't let that dissuade you though! " ..
                "Just because we can't get a foothold doesn't mean we won't get you there... one-way " ..
                "trips are pretty simple when you get down to it.\n\n< Ricket nods at some nearby " ..
                "rockets.>",
            rewardMoney = 6800,
        },
        [13061] = {
            description = "This is it then. I'll take care of your bear now, you won't be needing her. " ..
                "The great Drakkensryd will be your next challenge.\n\nSay goodbye to your friends and " ..
                "leave your affairs in order, for you will return victorious... or you won't return at " ..
                "all.",
            rewardMoney = 7200,
        },
        [13062] = {
            description = "You've been a great ally, <name>. Now comes your true test. You will need " ..
                "skill, courage and a little luck.\n\n<Lok'lira attaches a thin strand of hair to " ..
                "yours.>\n\nYou cannot fail now sister. Speak to Gretta the Arbiter. She'll see you on " ..
                "your way.",
        },
        [13063] = {
            description = "You have succeeded where many have failed, sister. Whether it be by strength " ..
                "and courage or mere luck remains to be seen.\n\nGo back to the village and seek out " ..
                "Astrid Bjornrittar. Tell her of your accomplishments. But be warned. She is not easily " ..
                "impressed.",
            rewardMoney = 37000,
        },
        [13064] = {
            description = "Sif? Is it truly you?\n\nNo? A <race>? But for a moment....\n\nEnough of this! " ..
                "The visions of my Sif have tormented me for far too long. It is time for me to avenge " ..
                "her, and to bring honor to her memory.\n\nMy brother must pay!",
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [13068] = {
            description = "Perhaps you've heard the praises for our missing hero?\n\nCrusader Bridenbrad " ..
                "was in the Broken Front aiding the attack against the Scourge when the undead army came " ..
                "down upon them. The many men of that allied force scattered, but Bridenbrad alone " ..
                "returned and dragged more than a dozen men to safety, one by one through the " ..
                "carnage.\n\n<class>, he has not returned since. He was spotted heading to the far " ..
                "northeast, towards the Silent Vigil. Bring him back to me that I might honor him for his " ..
                "valor.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [13069] = {
            description = "Jotunheim has aerial defenses, both in terms of proto-drake riders and harpoon " ..
                "guns. They've concentrated these on their northern and western facings where they are " ..
                "most vulnerable.\n\nLet's use their defenses against them!\n\n< The Leaper pierces you " ..
                "with his single eye and cackles maniacally.>\n\nTake control of a harpoon gun on the " ..
                "platforms that overhang the cliffs on either side of Valhalas to the southwest. Take out " ..
                "the proto-drakes and their riders. Shoot 'em up!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13070] = {
            description = "The chill of death stirs in the west, threatening to freeze our hearts and " ..
                "souls to this wasteland and bind us to its dark master. We will stand and we will " ..
                "fight!\n\nThe preparations have begun. Report to Siegemaster Fezzik at the front gate " ..
                "for your assignment.",
        },
        [13071] = {
            description = "Vile like fire! Vile like proto-drakes!\n\n<The abomination claps its hands " ..
                "excitedly.>\n\nLittle <name> go to Jotunheim and steal a pretty proto-drake in Njorndar " ..
                "Village. Make proto-drake make pretty fires on Jotunheim buildings!",
            rewardMoney = 37000,
        },
        [13072] = {
            description = "I know why you've come... they've sent you to bring me back, but that cannot " ..
                "happen. I carry the plague of undeath, <class>, and I'll not share my fate with those " ..
                "near me. No, I shall stay here.\n\nMy only regret lies in what I may become when death " ..
                "grips me. I do not fear death itself, but I loathe to consider serving the traitor, " ..
                "Arthas.\n\nLeave me... and see to it that no one else comes looking. You would do me a " ..
                "great disservice if you were to expose anyone to the plague that I carry.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13073] = {
            description = "There are those of this world that tap into power unrestricted by the bounds " ..
                "of our mortal frames - powers of restoration, powers of life, and powers of light. And " ..
                "Bridenbrad, this is no ordinary man... his valor and devotion shine through. We can only " ..
                "hope that one of these beings will intervene and bring this hero back from a fate worse " ..
                "than death.\n\nGo now and speak to Arch Druid Lilliandra in the Argent Vanguard... " ..
                "request passage to Moonglade and seek the aid of Keeper Remulos.",
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [13074] = {
            description = "What we need exists only in the emerald dream... acorns that are infused with " ..
                "a powerful restorative magic. Many places in this sacred glade are closely tied with the " ..
                "dream, and my shrine is among them.\n\nI will send you into the dream to recover some of " ..
                "these acorns. Be prepared though <class>, for this method of entering the dream is " ..
                "dangerous, and it is very likely you will be beset by nightmares.\n\nRecover a few " ..
                "acorns quickly, and then depart from my shrine or pinch yourself to return to our world.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13075] = {
            description = "I shall open a portal to take you back to the druid that brought you here. You " ..
                "and your crusader have my well wishes. I hope that this acorn is able to purify your " ..
                "crusader and save him from the wretched fate of the plague.\n\nFarewell, <race>.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13076] = {
            description = "I feel refreshed... renewed... but the plague still grips me. Not to worry, I " ..
                "am still eternally grateful that you went to such lengths for me, a complete stranger. " ..
                "If nothing else, you've bought me a few more precious hours not plaguing the world as a " ..
                "hideous undead.\n\nThank you, <class>. Please extend my thanks to Tirion as well, and " ..
                "let him know that it has been an honor to serve beside him.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [13077] = {
            description = "The dragon-queen, Alexstrasza, possesses magics over all life. In the past, " ..
                "she has used great fire to incinerate undead and rebirth fresh new life in their place. " ..
                "Perhaps her powers might be able to save our Bridenbrad as well.\n\nAlexstrasza makes " ..
                "her home at Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight - please go to her and humbly request her " ..
                "aid on my behalf.",
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [13078] = {
            description = "In this dark time, I'll not be the one to abandon a champion of the " ..
                "Light.\n\nWe will need something sacred for this to have a hope of saving your " ..
                "Bridenbrad... a remnant of a devout being that fell victim to this very same " ..
                "plague.\n\nGo now to the sacred soil of the passages outside my Ruby Dragonshrine where " ..
                "the battle is joined. As my Ruby Keepers fly down and set flame to the ground beneath " ..
                "undead feet, you will witness new life grow forth. Among that life are Dahlia's Tears - " ..
                "bring them to me.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13079] = {
            description = "You must understand, young <race>, that cleansing the body in favor of life " ..
                "anew is something well within my grasp... removing the plague of undeath without " ..
                "affecting the body, however, is beyond the scope of the powers that I control.\n\nIf " ..
                "this Bridenbrad is the beacon of light that you profess him to be, perhaps he will " ..
                "endure such a cleansing and thrive, but I cannot state with confidence that this is the " ..
                "salvation that you seek. Take it and go with all of my blessings.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13080] = {
            description = "<Bridenbrad raises a hand to you as he catches his breath.>\n\nIt was nearly " ..
                "as painful as it looked, but it was as if I could feel some of the corruption being " ..
                "burnt away from within my body. It seems the plague is not so readily bested " ..
                "though.\n\n<class>, thank you for everything that you have done. Your selfless actions " ..
                "have renewed my hope that there is yet great good left within this world - I can depart " ..
                "without fear that darkness will prevail in my absence.\n\nGo now, go with no regrets.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [13081] = {
            description = "I appreciate everything that you have done for us, <name>. I have one last " ..
                "errand for you... one last gleaming hope for a paladin who deserves any salvation that " ..
                "we can extend.\n\nGo now to Shattrath and speak to the naaru, A'dal. He has long been a " ..
                "beacon of light and powerful ally to devout paladins. Impart Bridenbrad's story and seek " ..
                "any aid that he might have to offer.\n\nI cannot impress how important it is that you " ..
                "move quickly - I fear our crusader does not have much more time in this world.",
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [13082] = {
            description = "I am pleased that you have come to me, <name>. I know of Crusader Bridenbrad, " ..
                "and of your travels in hope of saving him. Bridenbrad's valor has sparked remarkable " ..
                "selflessness in you, and this is a miracle unto itself.\n\nThe Light will take care of " ..
                "its own. I will extend my blessing to Bridenbrad and he shall not endure the corruption " ..
                "of undeath. I shall return you to Dalaran, and you shall return to him. Know that I " ..
                "remain with you.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13083] = {
            description = "< Crusader Bridenbrad's tabard rests in the bottom of the chest, shifting " ..
                "slightly as the howling wind finds its way in.>\n\nTirion will desire this last remnant " ..
                "of the great crusader.",
            rewardChoices = {{44018, 1}, {44041, 1}, {44042, 1}, {44043, 1}, {44039, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 222000,
        },
        [13084] = {
            description = "Let us see if we can further weaken the resolve of the vrykul, <name>.\n\nEach " ..
                "day I wish you to travel to Jotunheim and put their banners to the torch. It may seem a " ..
                "trivial thing, but to see their ancestral home vandalized on a daily basis will " ..
                "demoralize them more than any physical punishment you can inflict.\n\nAt least... it " ..
                "can't hurt.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13085] = {
            description = "I just saw that incompetent fool, Vaelen the Flayed, sneak into the vault " ..
                "building.\n\nGo see to it that he rectifies his mistake and returns my death knights to " ..
                "me!",
        },
        [13087] = {
            description = "So what are ya doin' if you dinna have any stew for me. I got me a HUNGER! At " ..
                "least bring me some chilled meat so I kin cook me own stew! If ya do, I kin give ya the " ..
                "recipe so you kin make it for yourself. NOW GO GET ME SOME MEAT!",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
        },
        [13088] = {
            description = "We got a lot of new recruits here and these lads are hungry! If you could go " ..
                "out and get me some chilled meat for stew, I could teach you how to make it for yourself.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
        },
        [13089] = {
            description = "Nothing like a stew made from the living to warm your bones. Bring me some of " ..
                "the chilled meat that can be found on the wretched beasts of this place, and I shall " ..
                "teach you to make a warm stew.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
        },
        [13090] = {
            description = "The warriors of the Warsong Offensive need food in their bellies to keep their " ..
                "strength up. If you could bring some chilled meats from the Rhinos or other beasts, I " ..
                "could make them some stew. I would be willing to teach you the recipe if you were " ..
                "willing.",
            rewardMoney = 57000,
        },
        [13091] = {
            description = "The water lock outside my cave is teeming with elementals that the vrykul magi " ..
                "have yet to tame. I am going to teach you a trick for possessing these creatures for a " ..
                "short time, and you will use them to wreak havoc upon Jotunheim!\n\n<The " ..
                "banshee-infested vrykul draws magic in the air and touches a large finger to your " ..
                "forehead.>\n\nGo now and open the gate to the lock. A water terror will rush out and you " ..
                "will possess it to destroy our enemies!",
            rewardChoices = {{43863, 1}, {43907, 1}, {43942, 1}, {43977, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13092] = {
            description = "One of the benefits of possessing this creature is that I have access to all " ..
                "of her powers. As a bone witch and rune reader, she has the power to throw the bones and " ..
                "determine one's fate.\n\n< The Bone Witch smirks.>\n\nLucky for you and I that I have it " ..
                "within my power to influence those readings.\n\nBring me the bones of the vrykul that " ..
                "you kill here in Jotunheim and I will toss them to allow you to determine your own fate.",
            rewardChoices = {{43090, 1}, {43135, 1}, {43094, 1}, {43134, 1}, {43141, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13093] = {rewardChoices = {{43090, 1}, {43135, 1}, {43094, 1}, {43134, 1}, {43141, 1}}},
        [13094] = {
            description = "Archmage Berinand loaned me his research on the Arcanomicron, some sort of map " ..
                "that Malygos is trying to assemble.\n\nI made the mistake of discussing it with a group " ..
                "of Horde adventurers and now it's gone!\n\nIt must have been them. Please, recover the " ..
                "book.",
            rewardChoices = {{43181, 1}, {43182, 1}, {43183, 1}, {43184, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 188000,
        },
        [13095] = {
            description = "Archmage Berinand loaned me his research on the Arcanomicron, some sort of map " ..
                "that Malygos is trying to assemble.\n\nI made the mistake of discussing it with a group " ..
                "of Alliance adventurers and now it's gone!\n\nIt must have been them. Please, recover " ..
                "the book.",
            rewardChoices = {{43181, 1}, {43182, 1}, {43183, 1}, {43184, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 188000,
        },
        [13100] = {
            description = "We have an important order that needs to go out! Orton Bennet in Curiosities & " ..
                "Moore needs a mushroom meatloaf.\n\nGet some infused mushrooms found in the Dalaran " ..
                "sewers, chilled meat, and cook them in this meatloaf pan. When you're done, deliver the " ..
                "cooked meatloaf to Orton.",
            rewardItems = {{44113, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 71000,
        },
        [13101] = {
            description = "Arille Azuregaze at the Legerdemain Lounge has a convention coming in and " ..
                "needs a feast pronto!\n\nYou need to provide some Northern Stew and a Jug of Wine from " ..
                "the cheese shop \"One More Glass\" in central Dalaran. The owner of the cheese shop owes " ..
                "me the wine and you should find it somewhere around the shop.\n\nBring the wine and " ..
                "stews to Arille.",
            rewardItems = {{44113, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 86000,
        },
        [13102] = {
            description = "Ajay Green the innkeeper in the Dalaran sewers needs a vegetable stew for his " ..
                "customers as they are running low on food down there.\n\nCollect 4 Crystalsong Carrots " ..
                "from the Crystalsong Forest and cook them together with 4 Chilled Meat.\n\nYou can get " ..
                "to the Crystalsong Forest from the portal chamber in the eastern corner of Runeweaver " ..
                "Square.\n\nOnce the vegetable stew is ready, bring it to Ajay.",
            rewardItems = {{44113, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 86000,
        },
        [13103] = {
            description = "Ranid Glowergold in the Leatherworkers shop in Dalaran has had a sudden " ..
                "craving for wine and cheese.\n\nCollect cheese which is on the shelf at \"One More " ..
                "Glass\" in central Dalaran and half full wine glasses found on tables all over the city. " ..
                "Pour the wine together into a bottle and serve it with the cheese to Ranid.\n\nWe don't " ..
                "think he will know the difference.",
            rewardItems = {{44113, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 86000,
        },
        [13104] = {
            description = "The Vanguard is secure, ally. We have reclaimed the Valley of Echoes and taken " ..
                "down the web walls blocking entry to the Breach. Now is the time to strike at " ..
                "Scourgeholme and establish our presence inside Icecrown. The battlefront moves on!\n\nI " ..
                "have asked the Ebon Watcher for his assistance with our assault upon Scourgeholme. His " ..
                "intimate knowledge of the Scourge will be invaluable in our effort.\n\nGo now and report " ..
                "to him at the tent outside of the Breach, northwest of here.",
        },
        [13105] = {
            description = "The Vanguard is secure, ally. We have reclaimed the Valley of Echoes and taken " ..
                "down the web walls blocking entry to the Breach. Now is the time to strike at " ..
                "Scourgeholme and establish our presence inside Icecrown. The battlefront moves on!\n\nI " ..
                "have asked the Ebon Watcher for his assistance with our assault upon Scourgeholme. His " ..
                "intimate knowledge of the Scourge will be invaluable in our effort.\n\nGo now and report " ..
                "to him at the tent outside of the Breach, northwest of here.",
        },
        [13106] = {
            description = "The Scourge has a large facility called the Fleshwerks, dedicated to producing " ..
                "abominations and flesh giants. If we can shut it down, we can deprive the Lich King of a " ..
                "large component of his armies.\n\nI've sent Darkrider Arly to the area. She has a small " ..
                "base, Blackwatch, on a ridge overlooking the Fleshwerks and to the west of Corp'rethar. " ..
                "I'm told the Argent Crusade is sending someone to coordinate their efforts there, but " ..
                "the darkrider will know what to do. Find and assist her.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [13107] = {
            description = "Archmage Pentarus likes to watch the occasional game of battle ball and is " ..
                "preparing to go, but needs food for the trip.\n\nYou need to fill his picnic basket with " ..
                "4 rhino dogs that you cook and then 4 wild mustard that are found in grassy areas of the " ..
                "city.\n\nBring him his picnic basket so he can be ready to go see the big game.",
            rewardItems = {{44113, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 86000,
        },
        [13110] = {
            description = "Not all of our soldiers made it out of Scourgeholme. Many were slain and " ..
                "turned into twisted reflections of their former selves. Such is the way of the Scourge. " ..
                "For those damned souls, there is no eternal peace. We must provide their souls " ..
                "rest.\n\nTravel through the Breach into Scourgeholme and slay the skeletal reanimated " ..
                "crusaders. Sprinkle this holy water on their bones so that their spirits may be freed.",
            rewardChoices = {{43832, 1}, {43833, 1}, {43834, 1}, {43835, 1}},
        },
        [13112] = {
            description = "Orton Bennet in Curiosities & Moore be needin' a mushroom meatloaf.\n\nGet ya " ..
                "some infused mushrooms found in the Dalaran sewers, chilled meat, and cook 'em in the " ..
                "meatloaf pan. When ye be done, bring that meatloaf to Orton.\n\nIf only de council would " ..
                "let me serve me gnome specialty, I would show dem a real treat!",
            rewardItems = {{44113, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 86000,
        },
        [13113] = {
            description = "Can you believe da horde has outlawed cannibalism...it just ain't right I tell " ..
                "ya! I guess I should keep me mind on me work when we gots an order to fill.\n\nArille " ..
                "Azuregaze at the Legerdemain Lounge has many a guest a'comin to his place, mon. You gots " ..
                "to be providin' some Northern Stew and a Jug of Wine from the cheese shop in central " ..
                "Dalaran.\n\nBring the wine and stew to Arille.",
            rewardItems = {{44113, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 86000,
        },
        [13114] = {
            description = "We be havin' another order to fill. Da innkeeper in da Dalaran sewers needs a " ..
                "vegetable stew as his customers dey don't have so much to eat, mon.\n\nHe asked for a " ..
                "vegetable stew as he didn't appreciate da gnome that was in the last stew I sent. Get 4 " ..
                "Crystalsong Carrots from the Crystalsong Forest and cook them together with 4 Chilled " ..
                "Meat and bring it to Ajay.\n\nYou can be gettin' to da Forest from da portal chamber in " ..
                "da eastern corner of Runeweaver Square.",
            rewardItems = {{44113, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 86000,
        },
        [13115] = {
            description = "Ranid Glowergold in da Leatherworkers shop be havin' a need for wine and " ..
                "cheese. Why he don't want some tasty gnome is beyond me.\n\nCollect da cheese from da " ..
                "cheese shop in central Dalaran and da half full wine glasses found on tables around da " ..
                "city. Bring da wine and serve it with the cheese to Ranid.\n\nYou can call da wine a " ..
                "Wine Medley, mon'.",
            rewardItems = {{44113, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 86000,
        },
        [13116] = {
            description = "Da Archmage Pentarus likes to be watchin' his crazy battle ball game, but he " ..
                "be needin' some food for da game.\n\nYou be needin' to fill his picnic basket with 4 " ..
                "cooked rhino dogs and then 4 wild mustard that are found in da grassy corners of de " ..
                "city.\n\nFill up his basket with the mustard dog goodies, mon'.",
            rewardItems = {{44113, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 86000,
        },
        [13117] = {
            description = "The Lich King's tireless minions labor away night and day to assemble scores " ..
                "of abominations and flesh giants down there in the Fleshwerks.\n\nYet, that is not " ..
                "enough. More and more skeletal constructors keep appearing to increase the pace of " ..
                "work.\n\nIf we do not discover where they're coming from and how they're able to work so " ..
                "quickly, we'll be overrun before we can act in force. Search to the southeast and see if " ..
                "you can find the source of these skeletons.",
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [13118] = {
            description = "The Scourge have sent their armies at the Argent Crusade and have been " ..
                "repelled. What they do now is called a 'slash and burn.' All prisoners that they hold at " ..
                "Scourgeholme will be executed and raised as servants of the Lich King.\n\nUndoubtedly " ..
                "the Argent Crusade will request that you give their soldiers a proper farewell. I'll ask " ..
                "no such thing of you. To succeed we must kill Scourge indiscriminately.\n\nVenture to " ..
                "Scourgeholme, northwest through the Breach, and lay waste to all that stand in your way.",
        },
        [13119] = {
            description = "So they're summoning in their workers and warriors at those altars?\n\nThey'll " ..
                "need to be the first thing to go. The master summoner should have a staff which allows " ..
                "him to activate the portal. If you kill the master summoner and take the staff, you can " ..
                "use it to overload the summoning portal and destroy its altar.\n\nDo this at all four of " ..
                "the altars and return to me once they've been destroyed.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13120] = {
            description = "The Fleshwerks is a vast operation, and it will be difficult to keep an eye on " ..
                "all that transpires there. Fortunately, I have a plan.\n\n<Arly produces an orb from the " ..
                "folds of her cloak and shows it to you.>\n\nThis is a death's gaze orb. With it, we can " ..
                "observe the Scourge's actions and decide how best to strike.\n\nPlace these orbs on the " ..
                "stands at three crucial areas -- the abomination lab and the flesh giant lab to the " ..
                "southwest, along with the area surrounding the green cauldron far to the west.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13121] = {
            description = "We must use the Lich King's tools against him if we are to decide our next " ..
                "step.\n\nOver the mountain to the southwest lies Kul'galar Keep. Within it reside the " ..
                "oracles of Jotunheim who receive orders from their master and scry upon others through " ..
                "the Eye of the Lich King.\n\nIt is the eye that you must fight your way to. While it " ..
                "cannot be used to pierce the veil within Icecrown Citadel, you should be able to use it " ..
                "to discern something of value so that we will know how best to proceed.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13122] = {
            description = "A Scourgestone is an item given to all Scourge upon birth or creation. It " ..
                "provides certain benefits to the holder, but more importantly it allows Scourge leaders " ..
                "visibility into the location and movement of all of their units.\n\nWith enough " ..
                "Scourgestones, I might be able to track the movement of other Scourge units across " ..
                "Icecrown.\n\nAs you slaughter Scourge in Scourgeholme, gather all of the Scourgestones " ..
                "that you find. Return to me when your bags are full.",
            rewardMoney = 68000,
        },
        [13124] = {
            description = "Malygos and his underlings grow stronger in power with each passing day. And " ..
                "now, our latest assault team has been captured and is being held in the Oculus.\n\nWe " ..
                "must attempt a rescue! Belgaristrasz and his companions are invaluable to our cause.",
            rewardChoices = {{44334, 1}, {44336, 1}, {44335, 1}, {44337, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 296000,
            startedBy = {{26117}},
        },
        [13126] = {
            description = "From here, it will take our combined efforts to proceed.\n\nAbove us, Varos " ..
                "hides behind an impenetrable shield. To reach him, you must defeat the Centrifuge " ..
                "Constructs that power his shield.\n\nWe can each provide you with drakes from our " ..
                "respective flights to help you reveal him.",
            rewardMoney = 296000,
        },
        [13127] = {
            description = "Only one obstacle stands between us and our ultimate goal here. His name is " ..
                "Urom.\n\nHe guards the third ring above us. Beware his powerful conjurings, " ..
                "friend.\n\nBring him down. Make him pay for his treacherous allegiance to the enemy!",
            rewardMoney = 296000,
        },
        [13132] = {
            description = "Only luck spared me from the same fate as me mates.\n\nIn the scurry I got " ..
                "knocked down - was a wee bit tipsy to begin with. Looked up ta see the first of 'em " ..
                "turn.\n\nThere was a big ol' fella watchin' with a whole mess o' guards. They were " ..
                "chantin' Ymiron... maybe killin' him will free me mates?",
            rewardChoices = {{44408, 1}, {44409, 1}, {44410, 1}, {44411, 1}, {44412, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 296000,
        },
        [13133] = {
            description = "Quickly, <name>, head southwest to the Halls of the Ancestors!\n\nWithin you " ..
                "will find slumbering mjordin. Wake them until you find Iskalder. When you do, use this " ..
                "amulet upon him and bring him back to me.\n\nNow go. There is no time to waste!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13134] = {
            description = "The Scourge cannot create their flesh monsters without blood and embalming " ..
                "fluid to preserve the parts and keep them functioning. If we can deny them these " ..
                "materials, their army will fall apart and we can easily destroy their " ..
                "creations.\n\nThroughout the labs where the flesh giants and abominations are cobbled " ..
                "together, you will find vats of embalming fluid and large orbs filled with blood. " ..
                "Destroy these, and bring death to any who would stop you!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13135] = {
            description = "Southeast of here, at the eastern reaches of Crystalsong Forest, is an area " ..
                "known as the Unbound Thicket. Within that thicket creeps all manner of life. One thing " ..
                "all of the affected creatures of the thicket share in common is their affinity for " ..
                "magical energy. Each of them holds pure, crystallized energy. Enough to kill us all " ..
                "should it ever destabilize!\n\nTravel to the Unbound Thicket and kill its denizens for " ..
                "crystallized energy. We need fuel and they need to die. We call that a \"win-win.\"",
            rewardMoney = 71000,
        },
        [13136] = {
            description = "You pulled this jagged, dark brittle shard from the body of a ghoul. The metal " ..
                "blade lacks a smooth edge, suggesting it was forged by an unskilled hand, or was broken " ..
                "from a larger piece.\n\nYou recall seeing similar shards embedded in the bodies of all " ..
                "the ghouls you've encountered at the Fleshwerks, leading you to wonder why their " ..
                "creators bothered to include the metal at all. Perhaps Crusader Olakin Sainrith would " ..
                "have some insight if you brought him the shards from several ghouls.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13138] = {
            description = "<Olakin turns one of the shards over in an armored fist.>\n\nThese could " ..
                "pierce armor with enough force. We have to find out what they're made of and what the " ..
                "Lich King intends to do with them.\n\nTo the east, nestled next to Icecrown Citadel " ..
                "itself, lies Malykriss. From the few reports we have, it's full of smelting and smithing " ..
                "equipment. Bring these shards there, and smelt them in one of the open furnaces on the " ..
                "bottom level of Malykriss. Once the metal has been reformed, we can identify it.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13139] = {
            description = "Silas and Spitzpatrick have signed off on the materials and fuel needed to " ..
                "begin construction of Justice Keep. Thanks to you and the Ebon Blade the Scourge " ..
                "presence within Scourgeholme has been decimated and their lieutenants have been " ..
                "defeated.\n\nI have chosen the site at which we will break ground, but first you must " ..
                "deliver my report to Highlord Tirion Fordring. We will begin our march into Icecrown on " ..
                "his command.",
        },
        [13140] = {
            description = "Those shards you recovered can only have come from one place, Malykriss. It's " ..
                "the seat of the Lich King's metalworking operations, to the east of " ..
                "Corp'rethar.\n\nWhat's puzzling is that metal isn't needed to stitch together " ..
                "abominations or flesh giants, or to summon skeletal servants. Find the skeletal " ..
                "runesmiths working on the bottom level of Malykriss and capture the plates they're " ..
                "working on. We need to find out why this metal is finding its way to the Fleshwerks.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13141] = {
            description = "<Highlord Fordring holds a banner of the Argent Crusade.>\n\nThis banner is " ..
                "like no other, <name>. It carries with it a powerful blessing, able to sanctify large " ..
                "tracts of blighted land.\n\nYou must take it northwest, through the Breach, to an area " ..
                "the Scourge have mockingly named Crusaders' Pinnacle. Plant the banner atop the skulls " ..
                "of our fallen brethren at Crusaders' Pinnacle and defend it against attack. Once the " ..
                "land is sanctified, return to Father Gustav.\n\nGo now, <name>. Hold no fear in your " ..
                "heart.",
            rewardMoney = 71000,
        },
        [13143] = {
            description = "First things first. I saw some Lithe Stalkers on the ramparts just east of us. " ..
                "They used to serve us before we broke with Arthas, and they're about as perfect a scout " ..
                "as you can get... with a little prodding from an eye of dominion.\n\nFly up, find one of " ..
                "the stalkers, beat it down a bit, and then use this Sigil of the Ebon Blade to command " ..
                "its obedience. It will recognize the sigil, guaranteed. Lead it back to the top of the " ..
                "rocks northeast of here and it will find its way to me.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13144] = {
            description = "The workers in the Fleshwerks abomination lab have already completed a number " ..
                "of their creations. For now, the creatures are chained to the pillars around the edge of " ..
                "the lab, but if we do not act, they will march with the Lich King's armies.\n\nGrasping " ..
                "arms reach out of the bone piles spread throughout the Fleshwerks. These arms belong to " ..
                "skeletons enchanted with the power of fire. Find and free these skeletons, then take " ..
                "them near the completed abominations and watch the show!",
            rewardChoices = {{38739, 1}, {39038, 1}, {39068, 1}, {39104, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13145] = {
            description = "We need to know what we're up against.\n\nUse the eye of dominion to assume " ..
                "control of a lithe stalker and scout out the area. There are a few spots in particular I " ..
                "saw when flying in that I want you to get a closer look at: the overlook in the " ..
                "northeast, the work area in the southeast, the large forge near the center, and the " ..
                "ritual area in the southwest.\n\nThe stalker can leap far and won't be hurt by large " ..
                "falls - use that to your advantage to get up and down from those ramparts.",
            rewardChoices = {{43845, 1}, {43866, 1}, {43906, 1}, {43934, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13146] = {
            description = "We need to cause some disruption to bring those death knights away from their " ..
                "leaders. If we lay waste to their minions below, I suspect they'll have to devote more " ..
                "attention to keeping a close eye on operations.\n\nAbominations are easy prey - slow, " ..
                "predictable, and most importantly, stupid. Take advantage of their trust of the stalkers " ..
                "to drag them near some of the Scourge bombs scattered throughout the construction area. " ..
                "You'll be able to light the bombs far before they figure out what's going on.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13147] = {
            description = "The major difference between vargul and lesser undead minions is that vargul " ..
                "still possess enough of their minds to despise being used for labor. Never will a vargul " ..
                "be pleased to be working aside skeletons or ghouls.\n\nLets take advantage of this " ..
                "inevitable animosity and start some fights between the umbral brutes and the other " ..
                "undead in Malykriss. That should serve to slow production and bring the death knights " ..
                "down to babysit.\n\nShould be simple - throw rocks at the brutes as they near lesser " ..
                "undead.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13148] = {
            description = "This damaged necklace has an invoice with it that reads \"Property of Timothy " ..
                "Jones - Cartier and Co Fine Jewelry - Magus Commerce Exhange - Dalaran\".\n\nPerhaps you " ..
                "should repair it and return it to him.",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
        },
        [13149] = {
            description = "The infinite dragonflight seek to disrupt history by deceiving Prince " ..
                "Arthas.\n\nIf they can convince him that none of the grain here carries the plague, then " ..
                "he'll never have to make the fateful decision to cull Stratholme.\n\nUse this arcane " ..
                "disruptor on any suspicious crates of grain you find.",
            rewardMoney = 296000,
        },
        [13151] = {
            description = "Arthas will soon face a desperate dilemma, and make a momentous decision.\n\nI " ..
                "must call upon you to accompany the prince in his culling.\n\nArthas must make it " ..
                "through Stratholme alive and you must see to it that he defeats Mal'Ganis!",
            rewardChoices = {{44396, 1}, {44397, 1}, {44398, 1}, {44399, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 296000,
        },
        [13152] = {
            description = "So they've been embedding these ghouls with broken shards of saronite down in " ..
                "the Sanctum of Reanimation? We must put a stop to this, before these ghouls can be " ..
                "deployed against our troops.\n\nFind the entrance to the Sanctum of Reanimation in the " ..
                "flesh giant lab area of the Fleshwerks. There, the ghoul mastermind, Doctor Sabnok, " ..
                "keeps the most fearsome of his creations, Patches. Free Patches from his chains and help " ..
                "him take his revenge on the doctor. Let his own creation be his undoing.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13153] = {
            description = "<name>, good to see you. While the battle has subsided for now, we must hurry " ..
                "and replenish our stocks. My research indicates that the armor of soldiers recently " ..
                "slain in the Glacial Falls becomes imbued with an incredible amount of energy. The Horde " ..
                "has been seen collecting armor in the area.\n\nHead to the Glacial Falls and slay any of " ..
                "the Horde you find there. Return their imbued armor to me.\n\nIf you cannot find any of " ..
                "the Horde, you might find the armor of an adventurer slain by the elementals.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
            startedBy = {{31051}},
        },
        [13154] = {
            description = "Dragons are incredible! Well, their bones at least! I've been equipping our " ..
                "archers with arrowheads made of Dragonbone. Unfortunately, since the massacre at " ..
                "Angrathar, it has become almost impossible to get bone from Dragonblight.\n\nHowever, " ..
                "the Forest of Shadows on the western edge of Wintergrasp has enough bones to tide us " ..
                "over.\n\nHead to the Forest of Shadows and bring back any bone splinters you can " ..
                "find!\n\nThe Horde have been seen collecting bone splinters in the area. Slay them!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
            startedBy = {{31052}},
        },
        [13155] = {
            description = "I've already heard some rumors regarding Malykriss and Arthas's new death " ..
                "knight order, but I assumed it nothing more than filling the void. These numbers suggest " ..
                "he's trying to take it up a notch though.\n\nWe dispatched one of our best to Malykriss " ..
                "not long ago - Vereth the Cunning. You should be able to find him on the Rise of " ..
                "Suffering, just west of Malykriss, and inside the Court of Bones.\n\nTry not to draw too " ..
                "much attention on your way in.",
            rewardMoney = 37000,
        },
        [13156] = {
            description = "My, it its quite chilly up here! Reminds me of the stormy peaks of Kaarinos on " ..
                "Argus. However, with all of this snow and ice, our soldiers can easily catch " ..
                "cold.\n\nHead to the Steppe of Life in southwestern Wintergrasp, and bring me back 10 of " ..
                "the Horde herb pouches you find. I will grind them into a medicine to help protect " ..
                "against the cold.\n\nThe Horde have been seen collecting them from the plant life in the " ..
                "area. Do not hesitate to slay them and retrieve the herbs!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
            startedBy = {{31054}},
        },
        [13160] = {
            description = "Gargoyles make effective scouts and can be deadly if left to rain attacks from " ..
                "the air, but they have a very obvious weakness. Most of them have to go through long " ..
                "periods resting as stone to maintain the energy they need to carry their heavy bodies " ..
                "through the air.\n\nAs I peered through the eye you were using, I noticed dozens of " ..
                "iceskin sentries resting on the eastern and southern walls inside. Use the stalker to " ..
                "leap up to their ledges and devastate them while they sleep.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13165] = {
            description = "The haze has been lifted. I can see as clearly now as the day that I plunged " ..
                "the Ashbringer into my own heart to free my father's cursed soul: my last memory as a " ..
                "free man.\n\nWe must take back Acherus from the Scourge if our order is to survive in " ..
                "this new world. I have taught you how to call forth a death gate. The death gate will " ..
                "return you to Acherus when you call upon it, <name>. Use it now and meet me at Acherus. " ..
                "The first battle of the Knights of the Ebon Blade is underway! Death to the Scourge!",
        },
        [13166] = {
            description = "The Hall of Command has been secured, but the Lich King has left us a little " ..
                "present in the Heart of Acherus. The stitched terror, Patchwerk, and a horde of " ..
                "abominations have taken over the second floor.\n\nUse the teleporter to get to the " ..
                "second floor and destroy the Scourge forces that remain. Do not engage Patchwerk alone! " ..
                "You must fight the monstrosity with other death knights of Acherus!\n\nGo, <name>. You " ..
                "have my strength to carry you!",
            rewardMoney = 25000,
        },
        [13168] = {
            description = "Look what we have here... eyes of dominion. The Cult normally goes to great " ..
                "lengths to keep these things safe, but I suppose their options for retreat are few when " ..
                "we're slaughtering them in their own home.\n\nThe eyes allow a being of any relative " ..
                "power to control an undead minion's actions precisely. As you can imagine, this can be " ..
                "extremely useful when it comes to your typical clumsy ghoul or skeleton.\n\nCare to try " ..
                "your hand at it? Use one of the eyes to control a captured shade.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [13169] = {
            description = "As is usual practice, the undead at the saronite quarry to the southwest " ..
                "starve plaguehounds to keep them extra aggressive. Use the shade to get up close and " ..
                "feed some of those hounds and I promise you they'll be content to leave you alone, if " ..
                "not side with the hand that fed them.\n\nDon't get too close to those things until " ..
                "you've fed them though. Their noses don't fall victim to your shade's elusiveness.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13170] = {
            description = "Ghouls are fragile things when it comes down to it, and the lookouts at the " ..
                "saronite quarry down the path to the southwest are no exception. Using one of the " ..
                "shades, I have no doubt that you can sneak up and put down their lookouts without making " ..
                "a sound.\n\nClear out as many lookouts as you can reach in a reasonable amount of " ..
                "time... we'll want their ranks thinned for our assault to come.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13171] = {
            description = "My main concern is the saronite quarry down the path to the southwest. They " ..
                "are pulling up immense amounts of ore from that quarry and I'd like to know what they're " ..
                "building with it. To that end, we'll start by weakening their defenses.\n\nI noticed a " ..
                "series of crystals scattered throughout the base and I assume they are defensive " ..
                "structures of some sort, not unlike ziggurats. Use the eidolon watcher to destroy any of " ..
                "those crystals that you find.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13174] = {
            description = "Shutting down their operation is just half of the plan. The other important " ..
                "goal here is to find out where all that saronite is being sent. We know of a few places " ..
                "it's been ending up, but the amount they're pulling out suggests to me that there's a " ..
                "bigger project in the works.\n\nOnce you're inside the quarry, get your hands on any of " ..
                "their documents that you can find. If you're assaulting the place with one of the " ..
                "gryphons, you can drop down from it as soon as the wetwork is done.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13177] = {
            description = "Welcome to the Wintergrasp Fortress, <name>. Your mission is simple. Defeat " ..
                "ten of the Horde's finest. Now, go! Bring victory to the Alliance!",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
            startedBy = {{31036}},
        },
        [13178] = {
            description = "Welcome to the Wintergrasp Fortress, <name>. Warlord Garrosh demands one " ..
                "thing: Slay them all!\n\nReturn to me when ten of the strongest members of the Alliance " ..
                "are dead.",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
            startedBy = {{31091}},
        },
        [13179] = {
            description = "Welcome to Wintergrasp, <name>. Your mission is simple. Defeat ten of the " ..
                "Horde's finest. Now, go! Bring victory to the Alliance!",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
        },
        [13180] = {
            description = "Welcome to Wintergrasp, <name>. Warlord Garrosh demands one thing: Slay them " ..
                "all!\n\nReturn to me when ten of the strongest members of the Alliance are dead.",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
        },
        [13181] = {
            description = "Commander Zanneth might be satisfied with a pile of Horde corpses at his feet, " ..
                "but controlling Wintergrasp is of the utmost importance to the Valiance Expedition. Make " ..
                "sure it remains in our control.\n\nHowever, don't think we'll just let you stand around " ..
                "while your allies do your dirty work for you. If you're not at least a second level " ..
                "recruit by the end of the battle, don't come back.",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
        },
        [13183] = {
            description = "While Dardosh might be content with slaying our foes, it is of the utmost " ..
                "importance that we control Wintergrasp Fortress. Do whatever it takes to ensure " ..
                "Wintergrasp is ours.\n\nHowever, don't think we'll just let you stand around while your " ..
                "allies do your dirty work for you. If you're not at least a second level recruit by the " ..
                "end of the battle, don't come back.",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
        },
        [13185] = {
            description = "I hears dem! The Alliance come soon. Destroy three Alliance siege devices and " ..
                "come back to Murp.",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
        },
        [13186] = {
            description = "It is only a matter of time before this castle is besieged by the forces of " ..
                "the Horde. Destroy three of their siege devices and return to me.",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
        },
        [13188] = {
            description = "You are now, and forever will be, a Knight of the Ebon Blade, <name>, but know " ..
                "this: you were once a hero of the Alliance.\n\n<Darion stares at you.>\n\nThis order " ..
                "must establish allies for itself if it is to survive. You must represent the Knights of " ..
                "the Ebon Blade to the Alliance.\n\nOn the platform, southeast of me, is a portal to " ..
                "Stormwind City. Take this letter, given to me on your behalf by Lord Fordring, and " ..
                "deliver it to King Varian Wrynn. Use the portal.",
        },
        [13189] = {
            description = "You are now, and forever will be, a Knight of the Ebon Blade, <name>, but know " ..
                "this: you were once a hero of the Horde.\n\n<Darion stares at you.>\n\nThis order must " ..
                "establish allies for itself if it is to survive. You must represent the Knights of the " ..
                "Ebon Blade to the Horde.\n\nOn the platform, southeast of me, is a portal to Orgrimmar. " ..
                "Take this letter, given to me on your behalf by Lord Fordring, and deliver it to the " ..
                "Warchief. Use the portal.",
        },
        [13191] = {
            description = "Lok'tar, <name>! While the battle may be over, we must prepare for the " ..
                "Alliance's next assault! Travel to the Cauldron of Flames in south eastern Wintergrasp " ..
                "and retrieve ten eternal embers.\n\nThe embers are mixed in with coal to fuel the " ..
                "Demolishers and Siege Engines.\n\nWe've heard reports of Alliance pigs collecting the " ..
                "embers all day. Slay them and take their embers! If they have already abandoned the " ..
                "area, then be prepared to fight the fire elementals there until you find some!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
            startedBy = {{31106}},
        },
        [13192] = {
            description = "Hey 'mon. This place be givin' me dah heebie jeebies, don't cha know?\n\nWay " ..
                "too many spirits haunting dis place. I want ta be placing hoodoo wards up, but I be " ..
                "needin' some souls, mon. Not any soul though, only da soul of a strong warrior could do " ..
                "da job.\n\nThe Glacial Falls in east Wintergrasp be havin' dem special properties to " ..
                "extract da soul. Slay the Alliance there, mebbe they be havin' the stuff we " ..
                "need.\n\nBring back da armor of the slain. If there be no Alliance maybe da elementals " ..
                "got 'em, mon.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13193] = {
            description = "Why would they set me to the task of arming our archers? I was a poet, not a " ..
                "ranger! Well, no use complaining. <name>, I am in need of dragon bone for our " ..
                "arrowheads.\n\nTravel to the Forest of Shadows on the western side of Wintergrasp. Ever " ..
                "since the last skirmish, the Alliance have been scavenging dragon bones in the area. " ..
                "Slay them and take the bones.\n\nIf that fails, you might be lucky and get one from the " ..
                "spirits in the area. I hear they love to impale their living victims on the bones as " ..
                "they die.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
            startedBy = {{31102}},
        },
        [13194] = {
            description = "Between the battles, one might almost believe that there was hope for peace in " ..
                "this land. Sadly, that is not to be our fate.\n\nTravel to the Steppe of Life in " ..
                "southwestern Wintergrasp. I have need of the roses that grow there for salve to treat " ..
                "the wounded.\n\nSadly, the rose has become scarce due to the Alliance harvesting it too " ..
                "rapidly. Slay them on the Steppe of Life and retrieve their herb pouches from the " ..
                "bodies.\n\nIf that fails, perhaps a lasher or two might have one.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
            startedBy = {{31053}},
        },
        [13195] = {
            description = "My, it is quite chilly up here! Reminds me of the stormy peaks of Kaarinos on " ..
                "Argus. However, with all of this snow and ice, our soldiers can easily catch " ..
                "cold.\n\nHead to the Steppe of Life in southwestern Wintergrasp, and bring me back 10 " ..
                "Horde Herb Pouches. I will grind the herbs into a medicine to protect against the " ..
                "cold.\n\nThe Horde have been seen collecting them from the plant life in the area. Do " ..
                "not hesitate to slay them and retrieve the herbs!\n\nYou may also find one on a lasher " ..
                "in the area.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13196] = {
            description = "Dragons are incredible! Well, their bones at least! I've been equipping our " ..
                "archers with arrowheads made of Dragonbone. Unfortunately, since the massacre at " ..
                "Angrathar, it has become almost impossible to get bone from Dragonblight.\n\nHowever, " ..
                "the Forest of Shadows on the western edge of Wintergrasp has enough bones to tide us " ..
                "over.\n\nHead to the Forest of Shadows and bring back any bone splinters you can " ..
                "find!\n\nThe Horde have been seen collecting bone splinters in the area. Slay them!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13197] = {
            description = "<name>! About time you showed up. While we may have lost the last battle, we " ..
                "should prepare for the next! Travel to the Cauldron of Flames in southeastern " ..
                "Wintergrasp and retrieve several eternal embers.\n\nThe embers are mixed in with coal to " ..
                "fuel the Demolisher and Siege Engines.\n\nOh, and if you happen to see some of the Horde " ..
                "in the Cauldron, don't hesitate to slay them and take their embers. We must prevent them " ..
                "from holding the keep!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13198] = {
            description = "<name>, good to see you. We must prepare for our next assault on the fortress. " ..
                "My research indicates that the armor of soldiers recently slain in the Glacial Falls " ..
                "becomes imbued with an incredible amount of energy. The Horde has been collecting armor " ..
                "in the area.\n\nHead to the Glacial Falls and slay any of the Horde you find there. " ..
                "Return their imbued armor to me.\n\nIf you cannot find any of the Horde, you might find " ..
                "the armor of an adventurer slain by the elementals.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13199] = {
            description = "Why would they set me to the task of arming our archers? I was a poet, not a " ..
                "ranger! Well, no use complaining. <name>, I am in need of dragon bone for our " ..
                "arrowheads.\n\nTravel to the Forest of Shadows on the western side of Wintergrasp. Ever " ..
                "since the last skirmish, the Alliance have been scavenging dragon bones in the area. " ..
                "Slay them and take the bones.\n\nIf that fails, you might be lucky and get one from the " ..
                "spirits in the area. I hear they love to impale their living victims on the bones as " ..
                "they die.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13200] = {
            description = "Lok'tar, <name>! While the battle may have subsided, we must prepare to retake " ..
                "the fortress! Travel to the Cauldron of Flames in south eastern Wintergrasp and retrieve " ..
                "ten eternal embers.\n\nThe embers are mixed in with coal to fuel the Demolishers and " ..
                "Siege Engines.\n\nWe've heard reports of Alliance pigs collecting the embers all day. " ..
                "Slay them and take their embers! If they have already abandoned the area, then be " ..
                "prepared to fight the fire elementals there until you find some!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13201] = {
            description = "So many of our braves were lost during the battle, but even more shall die if " ..
                "left untreated.\n\nTravel to the Steppe of Life in southwestern Wintergrasp. I have need " ..
                "of the roses that grow there for salve to treat the wounded.\n\nSadly, the rose has " ..
                "become scarce due to the Alliance harvesting it too rapidly. Slay them on the Steppe of " ..
                "Life and retrieve their herb pouches from the bodies.\n\nIf that fails, perhaps a lasher " ..
                "or two might be in bloom.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13202] = {
            description = "Hey 'mon. See dem Alliance sitting comfy in their keep?\n\nI think they be a " ..
                "bit too comfy, ya? I want ta be jinxing the place, but I be needin' some souls, mon. Not " ..
                "any soul though, only da soul of a strong warrior could do da job.\n\nThe Glacial Falls " ..
                "in east Wintergrasp be havin' dem special properties to extract da soul. Slay the " ..
                "Alliance there, they be havin' the stuff we need.\n\nBring back da armor of the slain. " ..
                "If there be no Alliance maybe da elementals got 'em, mon.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13206] = {
            description = "We must discover the secret to these savages' weapons!\n\nIf you'd have seen " ..
                "how easily they cut through my companions, you'd understand my sense of " ..
                "urgency.\n\nScour the place. Gather all of their arms that you can carry.",
            rewardChoices = {{44400, 1}, {44401, 1}, {44403, 1}, {44402, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 188000,
        },
        [13207] = {
            description = "Well now, I'm surprised to see other adventurers in a place such as " ..
                "this.\n\nIf my research on these halls is accurate, there be monumental discoveries to " ..
                "be made here!\n\nAssumin' I can count on ya to watch my back, you're welcome to tag " ..
                "along.",
            rewardChoices = {{44370, 1}, {44371, 1}, {44372, 1}, {44373, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 272000,
        },
        [13212] = {
            description = "With the abduction of Crusader Olakin, the Argent Crusade's forces will have " ..
                "no commander in the final assault on the Fleshwerks. While one crusader is the same as " ..
                "any other to me, the argents won't see it that way.\n\nI hate to see us waste time " ..
                "chasing after this, but I have no choice. Our gallant crusader has likely been " ..
                "dismembered by now, and his remains used to construct abominations. Go down into the " ..
                "Fleshwerks, kill the corpulent horrors fighting our forces, and recover Olakin's body " ..
                "parts.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13213] = {
            description = "I see and hear many things, <name>, and something very important has happened " ..
                "since your defeat of Overthane Balargarde: you are wanted for battle in Valhalas!\n\nYou " ..
                "will find the battle pit to the north. Go now with your friends and speak with Geirrvif " ..
                "the val'kyr. The challengers that she will offer you within Valhalas are sure to require " ..
                "their help.\n\nGood luck.",
        },
        [13214] = {
            description = "If you believe yourself ready to begin then I have just the match for you to " ..
                "cut your teeth on.\n\nAnother group of outsiders thought themselves prepared for the " ..
                "rigors of Valhalas. They had much hubris, but in the end they fell like all of the " ..
                "others.\n\nIf you think yourselves so different -- if you think that you have the skill " ..
                "and experience to fight here amongst such storied warriors -- then please accept the " ..
                "challenge.",
            rewardMoney = 222000,
        },
        [13215] = {
            description = "A variety of beings travel the world to prove themselves within Valhalas. Some " ..
                "even come from under the world.\n\nKhit'rix the Dark Master is one such.\n\nHailing from " ..
                "deep within the ground where insanity reigns, Khit'rix has asked for someone exotic to " ..
                "face in the ring. You will do.\n\nDare you face this Nerubian nightmare, <race>?",
            rewardMoney = 222000,
        },
        [13217] = {
            description = "You've been successful up to this point, <name>, but what you must face to " ..
                "continue to battle within Valhalas is a gigantic horror beyond imagining.\n\nI must warn " ..
                "you to turn away now. Carnage is a mountain of flesh constructed by the Lich King's most " ..
                "fiendish minds.\n\nI do not see how you and your friends will defeat it. However, the " ..
                "choice is yours.",
            rewardMoney = 222000,
        },
        [13218] = {
            description = "Your skills have not gone unnoticed by the vrykul of Jotunheim, <name>. Thane " ..
                "Banahogg has taken a personal interest in you and has insisted that he be your next " ..
                "match.\n\nIf you thought Carnage was bad, then you might want to go home now. Thane " ..
                "Banahogg's nickname is The Deathblow. I think you can guess how he earned it.\n\nDo you " ..
                "accept the thane's challenge?",
            rewardMoney = 222000,
        },
        [13220] = {
            description = "We can't afford to waste any time putting Olakin back together. Fortunately, " ..
                "the Scourge has provided a perfect place for you to stitch him back together.\n\nNear " ..
                "the Fleshwerks' flesh giant lab is the Sanctum of Reanimation. Search the area for a " ..
                "spool of thread and the doctor's cleaver. Then, take Olakin's remains to the large slab " ..
                "in the middle of the sanctum and get to work.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13221] = {
            description = "The Light smiles upon me. I have not yet died in this living nightmare, but " ..
                "the Scourge will kill me and tear my body apart for use in their 'work' here if I cannot " ..
                "escape.\n\nI cannot make it on my own, my child, but with your help, I may yet live to " ..
                "fight the Scourge again.\n\nWill you help me make my escape before the Scourge's " ..
                "butchers come to finish me off?",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13222] = {
            description = "Front and center, <name>! We're beginning our assault on Wintergrasp Fortress. " ..
                "Those Horde animals think they can hide cowardly behind their walls? Well, I think not! " ..
                "We'll show them the power of Gnomish technology and smash their walls to " ..
                "bits!\n\nHowever, even the most powerful siege device is helpless without a crew. Pilot " ..
                "or protect one of our siege vehicles as it destroys three of the Horde structures.",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
        },
        [13223] = {
            description = "Dem Alliance won't be long to hold that keep. Murp would smash walls, but Murp " ..
                "has to stay in camp. Murp wish he could smash Alliance who want to hurt Horde " ..
                "demolishers.\n\nYou, <name>! You go in Murp's place. Protect 3 siege vehicles while they " ..
                "smash Alliance buildings. Alliance not expect you to defend demolisher. Show Alliance " ..
                "how smart Murp is!",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
        },
        [13224] = {
            description = "The Argent Crusade pulled my ravaged body from the Broken Front. What a " ..
                "glorious battle, <race>. My axe sang as it cut down Alliance filth and Scourge " ..
                "alike.\n\nMy time is over. It will be a good death. Carry a message for me, " ..
                "soldier.\n\nOur base flies out of reach of Scourge - overhead between Mord'rethar and " ..
                "Aldur'thar. It is called \"Orgrim's Hammer.\"\n\n<Hork futilely attempts to " ..
                "salute.>\n\nFly high and avoid the Alliance juggernaut, Skybreaker. Tell Korm... tell " ..
                "him I died... fighting... For the Horde.",
        },
        [13225] = {
            description = "We were neck deep in Scourge and Horde. The screams of the dying covered that " ..
                "field. It was torturous... unrelenting!\n\nAt some point my body gave out. I fell, only " ..
                "to be awoken by the Argent Crusade. They pulled me out of the Broken Front and brought " ..
                "me here. I'm not going to make it. Grant a dying soldier one last wish, <race>? Our " ..
                "base, the Skybreaker, flies high above Icecrown. It is there that you'll find my " ..
                "commanding officer, High Captain Bartlett. Tell him that I died a soldier of the " ..
                "Alliance.",
        },
        [13226] = {
            description = "We cannot defeat the Lich King on our own. Divided we shall all fall!\n\nI " ..
                "implore you to answer the call, <brother/sister>. The Argent Crusade accepts all who " ..
                "would volunteer to aid in the war effort. Highlord Tirion Fordring himself awaits you at " ..
                "the Argent Vanguard! Get upon your mount and fly to the southeastern reaches of " ..
                "Icecrown. It is there that you will find Lord Fordring and the soldiers of the Argent " ..
                "Crusade.\n\nGo now, <class>, for judgment day comes!",
        },
        [13227] = {
            description = "We cannot defeat the Lich King on our own. Divided we shall all fall!\n\nI " ..
                "implore you answer the call, <brother/sister>. The Argent Crusade accepts all that would " ..
                "volunteer to aid in the war effort. Highlord Tirion Fordring himself awaits you at the " ..
                "Argent Vanguard! Get upon your mount and fly to the southeastern reaches of Icecrown. It " ..
                "is there that you will find Lord Fordring and the soldiers of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo " ..
                "now, <class>, for judgment day comes!",
        },
        [13228] = {
            description = "What battle?! Those troops were on a recon mission!\n\nAnd what's this talk of " ..
                "Alliance - you're sure he said Alliance?\n\nListen to me, <name>! I need to know what's " ..
                "going on and I need to know NOW!\n\nGet yourself down there and get me some answers! " ..
                "Scour the battlefield and look for survivors - clues - anything!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13229] = {
            description = "The Light smiles upon me. I have not yet died in this living nightmare, but " ..
                "the Scourge will kill me and tear my body apart for use in their 'work' here if I cannot " ..
                "escape.\n\nI cannot make it on my own, <class>, but with your help, I may yet live to " ..
                "fight the Scourge again.\n\nWill you help me make my escape before the Scourge's " ..
                "butchers come to finish me off?",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13230] = {
            description = "I hear them, <brother/sister>....\n\nThe moans of the wounded Alliance... they " ..
                "taunt me...\n\nFinish what we have begun here, <class>. Show no mercy... let none of " ..
                "them survive.\n\nFor... the Horde...",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13231] = {
            description = "What?! Noooo!\n\nWe went to such great pains to keep this attack secret. How " ..
                "could the Horde have known? The resources... the men... all lost? Inconceivable!\n\nOur " ..
                "plans here in Icecrown hinged upon our taking that gate before the Horde could. We must " ..
                "recover quickly and prepare to mount another offensive.\n\nVisit the battlefield and " ..
                "search for any survivors. See if there's anything to be learned from this " ..
                "tragedy.\n\nAnd prepare yourself, <name>, for a war - on two fronts...",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13232] = {
            description = "They taunt us - even as they lie dying here...\n\nPlease, <brother/miss>... " ..
                "Don't allow their mocking to be the last sounds I hear...\n\nFinish me... deliver me " ..
                "from this torment... into... the Light.\n\nSeek out my companions... offer them the same " ..
                "mercy.\n\nLeave nothing for the Scourge to raise!\n\nI beg you...",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13233] = {
            description = "It is as I told you. They were not merely idle words spoken in a fit of " ..
                "anger.\n\nTime and again, the Horde have demonstrated their disdain for everything we " ..
                "hold dear and holy. They must pay with their lives for their transgressions against the " ..
                "light.\n\nAll of them.\n\nJust imagine a world free of their stain, <name>. Envision the " ..
                "joy our children will know. Think of the reverence your descendants will have for your " ..
                "memory, knowing they owe their happiness to you.\n\nNow go, and make that vision a " ..
                "reality!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13234] = {
            description = "The time has come!\n\nToo long have we suffered the company of the " ..
                "self-righteous Alliance! Too long have we stayed our hand from cleansing our world of " ..
                "the weak and the desperate.\n\nNow, we bring an end to our humiliation! Now, we show " ..
                "them the true meaning of fear! Now, we bring honor to the Horde!\n\nHere, at Icecrown, " ..
                "we break the Alliance!\n\nGo, <class>. Hunt them down. Break them. Take their will to " ..
                "live!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13235] = {
            description = "You've done well in destroying the Fleshwerks and slaughtering the Lich King's " ..
                "servants. Now, all that remains is to defeat the Fleshwerks' greatest accomplishment -- " ..
                "the flesh giant known as Morbidus.\n\nIt will not be an easy fight, but the Shadow Vault " ..
                "has dispatched Margrave Dhakar with some reinforcements. Meet up with him at the highest " ..
                "point at the western end of the Fleshwerks. Tell him when you're ready to begin the " ..
                "attack and he'll order his forces into battle.",
            rewardChoices = {{44378, 1}, {44379, 1}, {44380, 1}, {44381, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [13236] = {
            description = "You probably think you're quite strong -- fighting these undead and crushing " ..
                "their bones beneath your war machines.\n\nThat is nothing compared to the strength it " ..
                "took to create them.\n\nI saw the prince do it himself. I can show you how it " ..
                "happened... if you'd like.",
        },
        [13237] = {
            description = "While your commander has his focus diluted by his loathing of your Alliance " ..
                "rivals, you can depend on me to direct my attention squarely on the real enemy here - " ..
                "the Lich King and his minions.\n\nIn order to hold any hope of conquering him at the " ..
                "citadel, your people must take and hold each gate.\n\nFor now, let us focus on the " ..
                "first. Return to the front and prod their defenses. Look for any sign of weakness that " ..
                "we might exploit.\n\nI'll await your report, <class>.",
            rewardChoices = {{43889, 1}, {43903, 1}, {43884, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13238] = {
            description = "Goblins! Hyper little busy-bodies...\n\nListen, <name>. Copperclaw, our " ..
                "resident engineer, is insisting that he's got something useful to show me.\n\nI'm in no " ..
                "mood to endure his squeaky nagging. The last time I acknowledged him, he chirped on for " ..
                "an hour straight. It was all I could do to keep from drop-kicking him into Sindragosa's " ..
                "Fall!\n\nYou go in my place and humor him. Let me know if indeed he's on to anything.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [13239] = {
            description = "Where to begin... well, you must know that as chief engineer of this vessel I " ..
                "have access to all of the intelligence reports - yes, yes, it's true, and I've recently " ..
                "taken a particular interest in the frostwyrms you reported seeing to the south, and I do " ..
                "believe I've developed a plan that just might work against them... now it'll take a " ..
                "little legwork on your part, but essentially, you build a dummy out of armor and coat it " ..
                "with a splash of this solution, then run for cover!\n\n...You still here, <race>?",
            rewardChoices = {{38736, 1}, {39035, 1}, {39065, 1}, {39100, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13242] = {
            description = "Darkness stirs, <name>. A tragic event has transpired that none but the " ..
                "Timeless One could have foreseen. Soon your people will be gripped by anger and hatred. " ..
                "War is on the horizon.\n\nThe red dragonflight has done all that it can. What happens " ..
                "next is in the hands of the mortal races of Azeroth.\n\nRegrettably, your journey begins " ..
                "with anguish. A father has lost a child today. You must bear the grim news. Gather the " ..
                "armaments of Saurfang and return them to the elder Saurfang.",
            startedBy = {{31333}},
        },
        [13257] = {
            description = "The Warchief needs you, champion. Orgrimmar is in a state of martial law. All " ..
                "merchants and services have been shut down as the Warchief prepares for an unavoidable " ..
                "conflict.\n\nI cannot tell you much more - not now. Not in this place.\n\nThe Warchief " ..
                "commands that our strongest champions report to his throne room. Go now, <name>! Take " ..
                "the portal back to Orgrimmar and seek out Thrall.",
            startedBy = {{25256}},
        },
        [13258] = {
            description = "We recently came upon schematics that indicate a weakness in Icecrown Citadel. " ..
                "An opening in its defenses, both figuratively and literally.\n\nThe captured diagrams " ..
                "show an orifice leading several hundred feet into the ground. We're unsure of its " ..
                "purpose, but our scouting has revealed it to be of high importance to the " ..
                "Scourge.\n\nSpeak to Sergeant Kregga below Icecrown Citadel, she's leading the attack on " ..
                "the site.",
        },
        [13260] = {
            description = "While we should never miss an opportunity to strike out against the Alliance, " ..
                "we mustn't forget about the Scourge.\n\nWe won't have the numbers here to make a proper " ..
                "assault in the glacier for weeks, but that won't keep us from learning all we can know " ..
                "about their defenses.\n\nI have asked our resident death knight to advise you in this " ..
                "effort. After all, who better knows this enemy than they?\n\nAllow me to introduce " ..
                "Koltira Deathweaver.",
        },
        [13261] = {
            description = "Wahooo! It works! Not that I had any doubts in my supernatural ingenuity, only " ..
                "that I wasn't quite sure what kind of explosion to expect - let's just say I'm glad to " ..
                "see that you didn't get your eyebrows singed off. So now I just need to show ol' Korm " ..
                "how ya thaw out one 'a them wyrms. He'll hafta promote me to... to... to whatever comes " ..
                "after Chief Engineer! Here, you take another batch of the stuff and head back out to the " ..
                "front and I'll go get Korm...\n\nWell? Move out!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13262] = {
            description = "This is probably as under-control as this situation is going to get. Let's do " ..
                "this, <name>.\n\nI need someone to light the fuse on those bombs and it looks like " ..
                "you're the one to do it.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [13263] = {
            description = "As you light the fuse, you notice that it is consumed by fire far quicker than " ..
                "you would expect.\n\nThe bombs are about to go off and your best chance at surviving is " ..
                "to lean towards the pit and hope the fall doesn't kill you.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [13271] = {
            description = "The object is not a crystal at all, but some form of organ, encased in " ..
                "ice.\n\nAs you touch it, your hand reels in horrible pain. You feel as if your hand has " ..
                "been cut, yet there is no visible wound.\n\nAs you collect your thoughts, you hear a " ..
                "young boy's voice nearby.\n\n\"You really shouldn't have done that.\"",
        },
        [13273] = {
            description = "With Norgannon's Shell in hand, only half of the archive key remains to be " ..
                "found. Luckily, I've had the Explorers' League hard at work chasing down leads about the " ..
                "whereabouts of Norgannon's Core.\n\nFar to the southeast of the Inventor's Library, on " ..
                "the slopes to the north of Dun Niffelem, is a camp bearing my name. The Explorers' " ..
                "League representatives seeking the second half of the key are based there. Bring me the " ..
                "maps and the notes they've made and we should be able to track down the other key half.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13274] = {
            description = "Prospector Soren's notes say that Norgannon's Core is in the keeping of a " ..
                "sentinel named Athan, one of Mimir's creations.\n\nSoren says the vault where Athan " ..
                "resides is called \"Loken's Bargain\" these days.\n\nLoken, eh? The earthen have " ..
                "mentioned him.\n\nThe vault is said to be southwest of the ruined Explorers' League " ..
                "camp, with a round entrance on a mountainside overlooking the Valley of Ancient " ..
                "Winters.\n\nFind this Athan and get the core from him, but I wouldn't be surprised if " ..
                "you were in for a fight.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13276] = {
            description = "You know what to do, <class>.\n\nTake this kit and use the guts from their " ..
                "abominations to create one of your own, then command it to attack the enemy forces at " ..
                "the gate.\n\nYou would do well to refine this tactic for when we make our assault on the " ..
                "gate.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13277] = {
            description = "While it's going to be crucial to defeat the Scourge on the ground, we mustn't " ..
                "neglect the gate itself.\n\nThe flesh giants on the ramparts are capable of hurling " ..
                "massive boulders and chunks of ice, inflicting devastating damage to enemy infantry " ..
                "below.\n\nMuster a force and defeat these giants. We need to know just what we're up " ..
                "against in terms of their strength.\n\nOh... and bring me their spines. If memory " ..
                "serves, there's a little trick I can share with you.",
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [13278] = {
            description = "Reports of a powerful zombie at the death gate have reached my ears, " ..
                "<class>.\n\nWe cannot allow a potential threat such as this to go unchallenged. Any " ..
                "information you are able to glean from engaging it will be better than what we know " ..
                "now.\n\nGo to the western chamber of the gate and find this creature. Fight him, and " ..
                "find a weakness we might exploit.",
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [13279] = {
            description = "<Koltira takes the pustulant spines and drains their fluid into a flask.>\n\nA " ..
                "little-known quality of the flesh giants...\n\nTheir spinal fluid interacts with the " ..
                "plague in a very interesting way, turning it into a corrosive acid.\n\nPoured from the " ..
                "towering ramparts, acid may not be a welcome sight to the troops below, but at least the " ..
                "victims won't rise up and add to the enemy's numbers.\n\nPour the contents of this flask " ..
                "into one of the plague cauldrons in the western chamber of the death gate.",
            rewardChoices = {{44386, 1}, {44388, 1}, {44387, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13280] = {
            description = "You've just got to get my jumpbot to the tippy top of the mountain to the " ..
                "northwest here at Ymirheim pronto, <name>!\n\nThat dastardly, no-good Blast Thunderbomb " ..
                "is working on his own bot, and I'm afraid he almost has it completed. We're in a race to " ..
                "see who's gonna be king of the mountain!\n\nOnce you jump up there, plant our battle " ..
                "standard in the pile of bones and show everyone that the Alliance, and my engineering " ..
                "skills, are the best!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13281] = {
            description = "You no longer need my assistance in neutralizing the enemy's plague cauldrons, " ..
                "<race>.\n\nHunt down the flesh giants at the death gate and use the fluid from their " ..
                "spines to render batches of the plague ineffective.\n\nYou are striking at the heart of " ..
                "the enemy's strategy. This is an important mission - vital to our cause, and should be " ..
                "carried out whenever time permits.\n\nRemember, the giants and the plague cauldrons can " ..
                "be found on Mord'rethar.",
            rewardMoney = 222000,
        },
        [13282] = {
            description = "You should leave now. You'll find a portal behind me. It'll take you to the " ..
                "surface.\n\nWe'll meet again. He'll be looking for you.\n\nIt's only a matter of time " ..
                "until he finds you.",
            rewardMoney = 37000,
        },
        [13283] = {
            description = "Yo, <name>, I need you to get my jumpbot to the top of this mountain to the " ..
                "southeast, like yesterday!\n\nThat girly, self-righteous Frazzle Geargrinder thinks that " ..
                "her jumpbot's better than mine. Hah! We're in a race to see who's gonna be king of the " ..
                "mountain!\n\nOnce you jump up there, plant our battle standard in the pile of bones and " ..
                "show everyone that the Horde, and my mad engineering skills, are the best!",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13284] = {
            description = "Greetings <class>.\n\nOur troops have been attempting to storm Ymirheim for " ..
                "some time, but these vrykul are far more vicious than any we've faced before. They've " ..
                "been ambushing us repeatedly as we try to make it up the pass, and we've lost a lot of " ..
                "men.\n\nIf you want to lend yourself to the battle and help get my squad to the gates of " ..
                "Ymirheim safely, we will gladly reward you for your efforts. Once at the gates, we'll " ..
                "dig in and wait for reinforcements to catch up to us.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13285] = {
            description = "Aha! Here it is: the Temple of Invention, the seat of Keeper Mimir himself! Of " ..
                "course, that's where one would go to join the two parts of the key.\n\nAccording to the " ..
                "prospector's notes, the Temple of Invention is one of the highest points on the western " ..
                "side of the Terrace of the Makers. That means it should be roughly east of your " ..
                "Grom'arsh Crash Site.\n\nI'll meet you at the temple and we'll combine the parts " ..
                "together.",
            rewardChoices = {{43189, 1}, {43190, 1}, {43191, 1}, {43192, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [13286] = {
            description = "Desperate times, <class>...\n\nAs uncomfortable as it makes me, I'm prepared " ..
                "to accept assistance from anyone - including our resident death knight.\n\nGo to " ..
                "Thassarian and see if he can help us develop tactics against the Scourge that will " ..
                "ensure victory once we are able to mount another offensive.\n\nWe have come so far... we " ..
                "must not fail here!",
        },
        [13288] = {
            description = "Abominations...\n\nThey can be a very capable enemy. I've seen them turn the " ..
                "tide of battle more than once. What few realize, is that they can also be very capable " ..
                "friends.\n\nThey are not deep thinkers. If you know the secrets of their creation, you " ..
                "can issue them basic orders that they will not question.\n\nFortunately for you, I know " ..
                "these secrets.\n\nThis kit will reanimate the remains of the abominations you defeat. " ..
                "Take it, and learn to use them against the Scourge on the death gate.",
            rewardChoices = {{39814, 1}, {39881, 1}, {39887, 1}, {39888, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13289] = {
            description = "You know what to do, <class>.\n\nTake this kit and use the guts from their " ..
                "abominations to create one of your own, then command it to attack the enemy forces at " ..
                "the gate.\n\nYou would do well to refine this tactic for when we make another assault on " ..
                "the gate.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13290] = {
            description = "Chief Engineer Boltwrench has proven invaluable in his service aboard the " ..
                "Stormbreaker. Were it not for his ingenuity, we'd be sprinkled across half of the " ..
                "glacier several times over by now.\n\nThe thing is, he feels he must share his every " ..
                "miniscule invention or discovery - most of which I don't even understand.\n\nMy focus " ..
                "must be squarely on our enemies right now. I cannot afford any distractions.\n\nPlease " ..
                "visit him in my stead, <name>. And if you can, assist him. You'll find him belowdecks.",
        },
        [13292] = {
            description = "Oh, yes, yes. Back again, are we? Never enough practice, I suppose.\n\nHere we " ..
                "are, the solution to that pesky frostwyrm problem.\n\nMake them scarce, <race>. The more " ..
                "you take out now, the less we face when we are again ready to attempt our march on the " ..
                "citadel.\n\nBest of luck, now. And do bring back whatever you don't use.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13293] = {
            description = "You need to get down to Ymirheim, that big frost vrykul town in the middle of " ..
                "Icecrown.\n\nOur boy, Blast Thunderbomb, is down there on the west side of town " ..
                "representing the Warsong Offensive in a competition against the Alliance. It's his " ..
                "jumpbot versus theirs in a king of the mountain contest!\n\nDon't let us down, <name>. " ..
                "Goblin engineering pride is on the line! Besides, all the boys here in the hold are " ..
                "counting on you.\n\nThat and we've got money riding on it that you can kick those " ..
                "cowards in the pants!",
        },
        [13294] = {
            description = "While it's going to be crucial to defeat the Scourge on the ground, we mustn't " ..
                "neglect the gate itself.\n\nThe flesh giants on the ramparts are capable of hurling " ..
                "massive boulders and chunks of ice, inflicting devastating damage to enemy infantry " ..
                "below.\n\nMuster a force and defeat these giants. We need to know just what we're up " ..
                "against in terms of their strength.\n\nOh... and bring me their spines. If memory " ..
                "serves, there's a little trick I can share with you.",
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [13296] = {
            description = "I need you down in Ymirheim, that big frost vrykul town in the middle of " ..
                "Icecrown.\n\nFrazzle Geargrinder is down there on the south side of town representing " ..
                "the Valiance Expedition in a competition against the Horde scum. It's her jumpbot versus " ..
                "theirs in a king of the mountain contest!\n\nDon't let us down, <name>. Gnomish " ..
                "engineering pride is on the line! Besides, all the boys here in the hold are counting on " ..
                "you.\n\nThat and we've got money riding on it that you can kick those idiots in the " ..
                "pants!",
        },
        [13297] = {
            description = "You no longer need my assistance in neutralizing the enemy's plague cauldrons, " ..
                "<race>.\n\nHunt down the flesh giants at the death gate and use the fluid from their " ..
                "spines to render batches of the plague ineffective.\n\nYou are striking at the heart of " ..
                "the enemy's strategy. This is an important mission - vital to our cause, and should be " ..
                "carried out whenever time permits.\n\nRemember, the giants and the plague cauldrons can " ..
                "be found on Mord'rethar.",
            rewardMoney = 222000,
        },
        [13298] = {
            description = "Reports of a powerful zombie at the death gate have reached my ears, " ..
                "<class>.\n\nWe cannot allow a potential threat such as this to go unchallenged. Any " ..
                "information you are able to glean from engaging it will be better than what we know " ..
                "now.\n\nGo to the western chamber of the gate and find this creature. Fight him, and " ..
                "find a weakness we might exploit.",
            rewardMoney = 222000,
        },
        [13300] = {
            description = "Our people are being captured and put to work as slaves in the saronite mines " ..
                "of Ymirheim, the vrykul stronghold in the middle of Icecrown. The Lich King has them " ..
                "mining that unholy ore day and night.\n\nI made a promise to Highlord Fordring that we " ..
                "would get those wretches out of there alive, and that's exactly what we will " ..
                "do.\n\nUnfortunately, I've been ordered to stay on this gunship and serve as an " ..
                "ambassador to the Valiance Expedition. Will you please rescue them in my stead, <name>?",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13301] = {
            description = "Greetings <class>.\n\nOur troops have been attempting to storm Ymirheim for " ..
                "some time, but these vrykul are far more vicious than any we've faced before. They've " ..
                "been ambushing us repeatedly as we try to make it up the pass, and we've lost a lot of " ..
                "men.\n\nIf you want to lend yourself to the battle and help get my squad to the gates of " ..
                "Ymirheim safely, we will gladly reward you for your efforts. Once at the gates, we'll " ..
                "dig in and wait for reinforcements to catch up to us.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13305] = {
            description = "You're going to use this machine against the Scourge? You're not going to win " ..
                "against them like that.\n\nYou can destroy hundreds... even thousands of them. But you " ..
                "won't win. Not out here.\n\nWhen you're done playing with your machine, meet me to the " ..
                "north. There is an old army encampment. What I will show you will teach you a little bit " ..
                "about who you're up against.",
            rewardChoices = {{43847, 1}, {43881, 1}, {43892, 1}, {43930, 1}, {43932, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13324] = {
            description = "Now that you have gathered all of the Prism cards together into a deck, a " ..
                "ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight. On this card " ..
                "is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\" You have " ..
                "heard that the entrance to this faire appears near Mulgore and Goldshire every month.",
            rewardItems = {{42988, 1}},
        },
        [13343] = {
            description = "There you are! Or, were we just talking?\n\n< Chromie muses over the temporal " ..
                "possibilities.>\n\nAnyway, the Infinites are after you! Well, not you per-se. Rather, " ..
                "they're after the past version of you that defended the Hourglass of Eternity. You " ..
                "remember, right?\n\nThat was you back then, except it's you now too. Wait, that's not " ..
                "important. What is important is that you head back to the Bronze Dragonshrine and defend " ..
                "yourself and the hourglass from their attacks before you get erased from history!",
            rewardChoices = {{38763, 1}, {38764, 1}, {38765, 1}},
            rewardItems = {{199210, 1, "Northrend Adventuring Supplies"}},
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [13347] = {
            description = "Our fate is emblazoned upon our souls at birth. Bolvar's fall, while tragic, " ..
                "was unavoidable.\n\nAll that you can do now is honor your hero, <name>. Collect Bolvar's " ..
                "shield from the field of battle and return it to your king. When you present the shield " ..
                "to Varian, tell him this: \"All is not lost. From the ashes of the fallen will rise a " ..
                "force that will unite nations and purge the evil from this world.\"\n\nHe mustn't lose " ..
                "faith. Go now, <name>. Your people need a hero. They need you.",
            startedBy = {{31333}},
        },
        [13349] = {
            description = "We need to keep our momentum going. Let's not give the Scourge forces any " ..
                "respite.\n\nSindragosa's Fall lies east just beyond the Valley of Lost Hope. The Cult of " ..
                "the Damned operate there, under close supervision of the Lich King's undead vrykul " ..
                "lackeys.\n\nIt is a place of great power, possibly a blue dragonflight graveyard. The " ..
                "feared frostbrood are raised there from the bones of blue dragons.\n\nAn attack there " ..
                "would have great impact on the enemy's access to frost wyrms. Are you up to it, <name>?",
            rewardChoices = {{39115, 1}, {39130, 1}, {39133, 1}, {39135, 1}, {39136, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13361] = {
            description = "Before the prince became a king, he fought many battles... but only one where " ..
                "he came close to dying.\n\nIt was fought right here. After you let me show you what " ..
                "happened, you'll understand everything.\n\nFind a bloodstained stone and pick it up from " ..
                "the floor. You'll see what happened.",
            rewardChoices = {{38741, 1}, {39040, 1}, {39066, 1}, {39108, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [13364] = {rewardMoney = 222000},
        [13367] = {
            description = "These fools have actually stumbled upon something that could pose a serious " ..
                "threat to our plans!\n\nThe leader of this particular sect, Alumeth, has ritualistically " ..
                "sacrificed himself and now his underlings are channeling power to his soul.\n\nIf he's " ..
                "allowed to rest, their efforts will soon transform him into a mighty " ..
                "adversary.\n\nCombine his heart, skull, scepter and robes from around their chamber and " ..
                "use his remains on the crystal there.\n\nHurry, <race>! Destroy him before he becomes " ..
                "any more powerful!",
            rewardChoices = {{44393, 1}, {44394, 1}, {44395, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 222000,
        },
        [13369] = {
            description = "At the behest of Lady Proudmoore, I will allow a diplomatic mission to " ..
                "Orgrimmar to question the Horde's Warchief, Thrall. You will assist her in this journey " ..
                "and keep her safe from harm. Return to me with news from Orgrimmar.\n\nSpeak to Jaina " ..
                "when you are ready to leave.",
            startedBy = {{29611}},
        },
        [13370] = {
            description = "Your champion, Bolvar, died in defense of our world. The Horde is saddened by " ..
                "the loss of such a great hero, but the Horde was not responsible for the cowardly " ..
                "attacks made by Putress at the Wrath Gate. We have also lost mighty heroes because of " ..
                "this betrayal.\n\nTell your king that we will do everything in our power to bring the " ..
                "perpetrators of this cowardly act to justice. We will do all that we can to avoid " ..
                "conflict with the Alliance, but we will not hesitate to defend ourselves if provoked.",
            startedBy = {{32363}},
        },
        [13371] = {
            description = "I sent Broll and Valeera to the Undercity before you left for Orgrimmar. In " ..
                "fact, they're now stationed outside the sewer entrance to the ruins, awaiting " ..
                "orders.\n\nLady Proudmoore will open a portal to our forces outside the Undercity. Go " ..
                "there and report to Broll. Jaina and I will be close behind.",
            startedBy = {{29611}},
        },
        [13375] = {
            description = "A potent thrumming of magical nature can be heard and felt emanating from the " ..
                "eye-shaped jewel dropped from Sapphiron's clutches. To mortal ears it is nearly painful " ..
                "to be in the presence of the stone.\n\nSurely such a powerful item of import can only be " ..
                "taken to the queen of the dragons, Alexstrasza the Life-Binder. Seek her counsel atop " ..
                "Wyrmrest Temple in the Dragonblight.",
            rewardItems = {{44581, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 296000,
        },
        [13377] = {
            description = "Deep inside the bowels of the Undercity hides the assassin responsible for the " ..
                "deaths of Bolvar and our brave soldiers at the Wrath Gate.\n\nVarian has brought the " ..
                "full might of the Alliance with him to assist in the take down. Join him and Lady " ..
                "Proudmoore in the manhunt and earn your place among the greatest champions of the " ..
                "Alliance!\n\nSpeak to King Varian Wrynn when you are ready.",
            rewardChoices = {{44591, 1}, {44592, 1}, {44593, 1}, {44594, 1}, {44595, 1}, {44596, 1}},
            rewardItems = {{44597, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 224000,
            startedBy = {{32376}},
        },
        [13387] = {rewardMoney = 74000},
        [13394] = {
            description = "You're going to use this machine against the Scourge? You're not going to win " ..
                "against them like that.\n\nYou can destroy hundreds... even thousands of them. But you " ..
                "won't win. Not out here.\n\nWhen you're done playing with your machine, meet me to the " ..
                "north. There is an old army encampment. What I will show you will teach you a little bit " ..
                "about who you're up against.",
            rewardChoices = {{43847, 1}, {43881, 1}, {43892, 1}, {43930, 1}, {43932, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13396] = {
            description = "Do you see now? Sending your men against the prince's armies just swells their " ..
                "numbers.\n\nI don't expect you to understand... you'll probably just end up like the " ..
                "others. You'd best return to whoever sent you. They might be worried.",
            rewardMoney = 37000,
        },
        [13397] = {
            description = "You're a real star, <name>. See, when I give one of these other soldiers an " ..
                "assignment, the odds of them getting it done are about fifty-fifty. The odds of them " ..
                "coming back... well, slightly worse.\n\nBut with you, it's always a guaranteed thing. " ..
                "Like gnomish clockwork!\n\nAnyway, I have another one for you. Sindragosa's Fall, east " ..
                "of the valley. There is some serious cultist activity, including and not limited to, the " ..
                "raising of frost wyrms. I need you to go kick their teeth in.\n\nI hate cultists.",
            rewardChoices = {{39115, 1}, {39130, 1}, {39133, 1}, {39135, 1}, {39136, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13403] = {
            description = "Just this morning, my scouts informed me of a Cult of the Damned procession " ..
                "leaving from Icecrown Citadel to the Cathedral of Darkness, bearing an artifact.\n\nAnd " ..
                "now I learn that it might be Arthas's own heart... a thing containing the last bit of " ..
                "his remaining humanity.\n\nThis is a sign of the Light. As long as such an artifact " ..
                "exists, there is a chance that Arthas Menethil can become a man again!\n\nMeet me at the " ..
                "cathedral's entrance. Be sure to bring a cultist's hood -- we're going incognito.",
            rewardChoices = {{44745, 1}, {44746, 1}, {44747, 1}, {44748, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 222000,
        },
        [13408] = {
            description = "The Hellfire Citadel wages constant battles with our forces. We are holding " ..
                "our own so far, but we can't yet launch a real offensive against them. To do that, we " ..
                "need forward staging areas.\n\nOur scouts identified three fortifications near Hellfire " ..
                "Citadel. We want you to help secure these forts. Capture each fort, and then report back " ..
                "to me.\n\nMay fortune shine upon you in the conflicts ahead, <name>, for you will no " ..
                "doubt clash with Horde forces eager to gain these same fortifications.",
            rewardItems = {{40476, 1}, {24579, 3}},
            rewardMoney = 7000,
        },
        [13409] = {
            description = "The fel orcs of Hellfire Citadel must be scoured from our birthland! To attack " ..
                "them, we must first secure forward staging points near the Citadel.\n\nOur outrunners " ..
                "found three fortifications that will suit this purpose, but the Alliance has the same " ..
                "idea and even now sends forces to take them!\n\nWe want you to stop the Alliance and " ..
                "capture these forts. Aid in the capture of each fort and then return to me.\n\nFor the " ..
                "Horde!",
            rewardItems = {{40477, 1}, {24581, 3}},
            rewardMoney = 7000,
        },
        [13410] = {
            description = "The Hellfire Citadel wages constant battles with our forces. We are holding " ..
                "our own so far, but we can't yet launch a real offensive against them. To do that, we " ..
                "need forward staging areas.\n\nOur scouts identified three fortifications near Hellfire " ..
                "Citadel. We want you to help secure these forts. Capture each fort, and then report back " ..
                "to me.\n\nMay fortune shine upon you in the conflicts ahead, <name>, for you will no " ..
                "doubt clash with Horde forces eager to gain these same fortifications.",
            rewardItems = {{24579, 3}},
            rewardMoney = 7000,
        },
        [13411] = {
            description = "The fel orcs of Hellfire Citadel must be scoured from our birthland! To attack " ..
                "them, we must first secure forward staging points near the Citadel.\n\nOur outrunners " ..
                "found three fortifications that will suit this purpose, but the Alliance has the same " ..
                "idea and even now sends forces to take them!\n\nWe want you to stop the Alliance and " ..
                "capture these forts. Aid in the capture of each fort and then return to me.\n\nFor the " ..
                "Horde!",
            rewardItems = {{24581, 3}},
            rewardMoney = 7000,
        },
        [13412] = {
            description = "Greetings, <class>. Might I impose on you for a favor?\n\nCorastrasza is the " ..
                "sister of Raelorasz - the red dragon in charge of our outpost here. Against his will, " ..
                "she has ascended to one of the upper rings of the Nexus to observe some frighteningly " ..
                "powerful blue drakes.\n\nThough he will never say it, he worries about her, and would " ..
                "welcome any news of her well-being.\n\nPlease seek her out. Ask her to put her pride " ..
                "aside and send word to her brother.",
            rewardMoney = 19000,
        },
        [13413] = {
            description = "You possess the courage to draw so near to Malygos' lair, mortal? Or is it " ..
                "simply ignorance? Soon we shall know....\n\nI am a seasoned trainer of the graceful " ..
                "drakes of the red dragonflight. My business here is to study the enemy and teach my " ..
                "precious pets the tactics that will be most effective when we face the master of the " ..
                "blues.\n\nTo demonstrate your nerve and ability, I will allow you to ride one of my " ..
                "drakes against the enemy's minions.\n\nThe opportunity is yours for the asking...",
            rewardChoices = {{44354, 1}, {44355, 1}, {44356, 1}, {44357, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [13414] = {
            description = "Again we meet, <race>. I confess, your presence is beginning to grow on " ..
                "me.\n\nAm I correct in assuming that you've come to hone your aerial combat " ..
                "skills?\n\nAs always, my pets stand ready to bring fiery destruction to the " ..
                "enemy.\n\nSpeak, and they shall be at your disposal.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13416] = {
            description = "Norgannon's shell is within our reach, <name>. Take the inventor's disk into " ..
                "the library's interior. There should be a console there that you can activate with the " ..
                "disk. I imagine Mimir stored more there than just Norgannon's shell. There are probably " ..
                "enough schematics stored there to keep Ironforge's engineers occupied for " ..
                "years!\n\nAnyway, bring the disk to the console. Hopefully, Mimir hasn't decided to put " ..
                "any more obstacles in our way.",
            rewardMoney = 37000,
        },
        [13429] = {
            description = "< Xi'ri pulses with lights as the Aldor and Scryer forces around him respond " ..
                "to his orders. Xi'ri 's army is ready to push Illidan's forces back and create a " ..
                "distraction for Akama. The naaru awaits your request to begin the attack.>",
            rewardItems = {{32649, 1}},
        },
        [13430] = {
            description = "Four trials you must pass before you are deemed worthy by the naaru.\n\nOnly " ..
                "one obstacle remains, mortal. Gather an army and travel to the lair of Magtheridon, deep " ..
                "inside Hellfire Citadel. Battle your way to the heart of the chamber and destroy the " ..
                "foul corrupter!",
            rewardItems = {{31746, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 132000,
        },
        [13506] = {
            description = "These appear to be orders dispatched to the overseers at the ruins from a " ..
                "superior in the Shatterspear War Camp. Most of the document contains negligible " ..
                "strategic value, but a couple lines stick out to you.\n\n\"We captured another night elf " ..
                "spying on our operation. She has been taken back to the camp to be tortured for more " ..
                "information. Keep an eye out for additional spies - we cannot afford for our operation " ..
                "to be compromised.\"\n\nThe Lieutenant will surely want this information.",
            rewardMoney = 600,
        },
        [13521] = {
            description = "Greetings!\n\nI'm helping Tharnariun here try to unravel what's been " ..
                "corrupting the wildlife in the area. I've set up some machines in the field that can " ..
                "analyze animal parts and possible corruption agents. If you can get me some good " ..
                "samples, we can get to the bottom of this affliction quickly.\n\nThe first machine is " ..
                "Buzzbox 413. I set it up on the beach just east of town. I'll need you to gather some " ..
                "flesh from the nearby corrupted tide crawlers and bring it to the machine so that I can " ..
                "analyze it.",
            rewardMoney = 350,
        },
        [13524] = {
            description = "You... you're not one of them? Quick! Let me out!\n\nWe have to get to " ..
                "Amberpine Lodge immediately! Once Lieutenant Dumont finds out who these people really " ..
                "are, this town will be reduced to rubble!",
            rewardChoices = {{38733, 1}, {39031, 1}, {39059, 1}, {39097, 1}, {38750, 1}},
        },
        [13537] = {
            description = "Between boat rides and building, I'm exhausted... and hungry. You know what " ..
                "sounds tasty? Fish. Fish sound delicious.\n\nDarkshore is known for its grouper. If you " ..
                "fish me up some, I'll make it worth your time.",
            rewardItems = {{46337, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 400,
        },
        [13539] = {
            description = "While the Alliance may be pounding on our doors, a true tactician looks beyond " ..
                "the obvious.\n\n\"Attack him where he is unprepared, appear where you are not " ..
                "expected.\"\n\n<name>, I need you to travel across the Wintergrasp River and destroy one " ..
                "of the three towers to the south. Our Warlocks report that the towers are draining power " ..
                "we could use to bolster our own troops.\n\nReturn to me once you've destroyed a tower.",
            rewardMoney = 114000,
        },
        [13542] = {
            description = "If we're going to take the Ruins of Auberdine back from the Twilight's Hammer, " ..
                "the elementals that they've summoned must be dealt with on a permanent basis.\n\nThat's " ..
                "where you come in.\n\nLook, I don't expect you to retake the town, but while we're " ..
                "healing up here, you can soften them up for us.\n\nTo permanently deal with the frenzied " ..
                "cyclones, head west, kill them, take their bracers, and put them in the moonwell. That " ..
                "will destroy the bracers and keep those elementals from being resummoned.",
            rewardChoices = {{52593, 1}, {52617, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 700,
        },
        [13554] = {
            description = "<Some unintelligible speech spews forth from the machine before you make out " ..
                "Wizbang's voice again.>\n\nDuskrats! They've been eating the duskrats! Those little " ..
                "buggers only come from one place, a cave against the cliff-face to the east. Find a path " ..
                "up to the northeast and look for an opening under the waterfall.\n\nThe duskrats there " ..
                "are either getting into something nasty or someone's intentionally spreading some agent " ..
                "through them - in either case, just bring me back several samples of the stuff!",
            rewardChoices = {{52583, 1}, {52619, 1}, {52631, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 400,
        },
        [13558] = {
            description = "Aetherion is almost in our world, but he can still be dealt with!\n\nAt the " ..
                "end of the dock floats a ritual orb. I want you to use it to complete the ritual, " ..
                "beckoning the elemental lord down from his vortex.\n\nTrust me, <name>, I and the other " ..
                "spirits that you have freed will greatly weaken Aetherion. However, it will be up to you " ..
                "to finish him off for good and save the Kaldorei people of Darkshore from utter " ..
                "destruction.\n\nDeliver his essence to Corvine Moonrise at the refugee camp so he will " ..
                "know.",
            rewardChoices = {{52596, 1}, {52622, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 1600,
        },
        [13560] = {
            description = "You look like an able sort!\n\nThere are a great number of wrecks off of the " ..
                "coast here... most old, some new. For quite some time, I've been trying to get at their " ..
                "holds and put their valuables to more use, but there's a nasty infestation of murlocs " ..
                "that seem to have other ideas. I've sent scores of adventurers and none have " ..
                "returned.\n\nWorry not, I've learned my lesson, and that is not your fate. Swim to the " ..
                "due north and look for Gary. He'll explain the new plan. It's pretty simple really.",
            rewardChoices = {{52646, 1}, {52652, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 600,
        },
        [13563] = {
            description = "I would like to extend my gratitude for saving us. I would call myself " ..
                "fortunate, but my beloved, Anaya, lays long dead. I am alone and deeply troubled, and " ..
                "sadly, I require your aid yet again.\n\nWandering the woods of Darkshore after my " ..
                "rescue, I found myself in the ruins of Bashal'Aran... where I saw the haunted spirit of " ..
                "my beloved.\n\nShe must be freed, but I lack the heart to do it. Her spirit must be " ..
                "destroyed.",
            rewardChoices = {{52599, 1}, {52654, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 400,
        },
        [13568] = {
            description = "In these woods reside three great spirits, that of the Stag, that of the " ..
                "Thistle Bear, and that of the Moonstalker. These spirits make powerful allies, but you " ..
                "can only align yourself with one of them.\n\nIf you wish to align yourself with the " ..
                "Great Moonstalker Spirit, take this incense to the land just south of the Ruins of " ..
                "Lornesta. Meditate before the great spirit while burning the incense on the ground " ..
                "between you, and face his trial to earn his blessing. Should you succeed, return to me.",
        },
        [13580] = {
            description = "Their fiery spirits are contained in the totem now. Take it to the top of the " ..
                "Jagged Reef near the Blazing Strand and set it on the ground.\n\nThe totem's soothing " ..
                "energies will slowly wash over the elementals until their fury simmers down to " ..
                "calm.\n\nYou must protect the totem, for fire does not react favorably to the ritual of " ..
                "soothing.",
            rewardChoices = {{52598, 1}, {55134, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 900,
        },
        [13583] = {
            description = "Wildkin with Elune. Aroom in your debt now.\n\nAroom help you now. Return to " ..
                "Malfurion, I join you soon.",
        },
        [13584] = {
            description = "I would be neglecting my responsibility if I abandoned my post just now, with " ..
                "so many elementals out of control in the ruins.\n\nLet us deal with them first, before " ..
                "we see how we can aid Malfurion. What do you say, small one?",
            rewardChoices = {{52620, 1}, {52634, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 800,
        },
        [13586] = {
            description = "Our efforts in containing the destruction don't appear to be quite enough. I " ..
                "fear we're going to need aid from beyond the waking world.\n\nTwilight cultists inside " ..
                "the Earthshatter Cavern to the east have opened a gateway to a nightmare-infested " ..
                "section of the Emerald Dream. They hold a green dragon prisoner named Thessera " ..
                "there.\n\nGo through the nightmare portal and free her. She will be a powerful ally.",
        },
        [13588] = {
            description = "Twilight riders circle the skies above the vortex. I fear it is their magic " ..
                "that has kept the cataclysmic forces from being contained by our efforts.\n\nTake to the " ..
                "skies with Thessera and destroy the riders and the portal from whence they came.",
            rewardChoices = {{52584, 1}, {52636, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 900,
        },
        [13593] = {
            description = "Welcome, champion. Word of your combat prowess has already reached my ears. Do " ..
                "you seek to join Stormwind's tournament delegation?\n\nYou will train and rise through " ..
                "the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Stormwind, your " ..
                "squire will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",
        },
        [13594] = {
            description = "Evenar and the other apprentices may not be much use in a battle, but you look " ..
                "like you can more than hold your own. The Horde scum across the road to the east at " ..
                "Bathran's Haunt need to be taught a lesson.\n\nTheir new warlord, Garrosh Hellscream, " ..
                "has them up to no good. Feel like teaching them a thing or two?\n\nI'd come with you, " ..
                "but my assignment is to stay here and protect Orendil's apprentices, and that's exactly " ..
                "what I'm going to do.",
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13595] = {
            description = "These creatures... these so-called Horde... they have cut me down in my prime " ..
                "and they are harvesting my hair for their evil plans.\n\nWill you help me to put an end " ..
                "to it, little <race>?\n\nI have overheard their herbalists speaking of something called " ..
                "wildfire upon their table across the way. If you were to take the bottle of this " ..
                "unnatural stuff and throw it at my corpse to the northeast, it would burn and no more of " ..
                "my hair will grow here.\n\nI am already dead and it is a small price to pay to stop them.",
        },
        [13597] = {
            description = "In these woods reside three great spirits, that of the Stag, that of the " ..
                "Thistle Bear, and that of the Moonstalker. These spirits make powerful allies, but you " ..
                "can only align yourself with one of them.\n\nIf you wish to align yourself with the " ..
                "Great Thistle Bear Spirit, take this incense to a cave just east of the great whirlpool. " ..
                "Meditate before the great spirit while burning the incense on the ground between you, " ..
                "and face his trial to earn his blessing. Should you succeed, return to me.",
        },
        [13598] = {
            description = "I have no doubts that Grimclaw will recover with the help of my healing " ..
                "magics, though I can't say the same for the poachers that attacked him. Still, I could " ..
                "use some salve to close his wounds and lessen his pain while he heals.\n\nTo the east " ..
                "you will find the Ruins of Lornesta. Among the crumbled stones, there is a variety of " ..
                "fuming toadstool that flourishes in the damp environment. Bring me some of the " ..
                "toadstools so that I can mix a salve for our friend here.",
            rewardMoney = 500,
        },
        [13602] = {
            description = "There is evil lurking on the coast to the west.\n\nThe Zoram Strand is the " ..
                "resting place of the doomed city of Zoram, destroyed during the Sundering and submerged " ..
                "beneath the seas. It has been lost to the night elves for ages. Lost, and nearly " ..
                "forgotten.\n\nNow, the naga have returned, and for what reason we do not know. But " ..
                "reason matters little; we must slay these fiends and throw them back to the depths!",
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13603] = {
            description = "Good, honest, honed steel may not carry the day. The other combatants are " ..
                "using enchanted blades and I find myself at a disadvantage, but all is not " ..
                "lost.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's " ..
                "form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the " ..
                "shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse " ..
                "is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, " ..
                "you'll catch warts.",
            rewardItems = {{44987, 2}},
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13604] = {
            description = "This platinum disc is surprisingly symmetrical and devoid of any scratches or " ..
                "imperfections. Engraved along its edge, bold runes spell out the word " ..
                "\"ARCHIVUM.\"\n\nThere must be a device inside Ulduar capable of reading the disc.",
            rewardMoney = 222000,
        },
        [13612] = {
            description = "Lok'tar, <race>!\n\nThe campaign is finally underway! Soon, all of Ashenvale " ..
                "will be in the grip of the Horde.\n\nAs we expected, our offensive is forcing the enemy " ..
                "to test our defenses at every position.\n\nHere at Mor'shan, their assault has been " ..
                "decimated! But as the vice tightens, they will have no choice but to continue to press " ..
                "us here.\n\nScout the region, <class>. Search for night elf survivors and cut them down " ..
                "before they can regroup for another assault!",
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13613] = {
            description = "Our forces are holding up admirably, <class>.\n\nBe that as it may, there are " ..
                "yet wounded to attend to - many still in the field of battle.\n\nI have created a salve " ..
                "that should grant the wounded enough energy to return to the ramparts for treatment. " ..
                "Please administer it to any in need before they become lost to us.",
            rewardChoices = {{56633, 1}, {56634, 1}, {56635, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13615] = {
            description = "Greetings, <class>, and welcome to the Ramparts.\n\nThings may appear a little " ..
                "chaotic here but do not worry. Kadrak has this juncture sealed up tight. Not a single " ..
                "elf has breached our lines!\n\nWhile you're here... I'm expecting a shipment of fresh " ..
                "supplies from Orgrimmar any day, but our watchmen are running dangerously low on " ..
                "arrows.\n\nBring me any you find and I will make it worth your trouble.",
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13617] = {
            description = "<name>, I have a friend who could make good use of particular talents. His " ..
                "name is Talen and he's an archaeologist of sorts. Recently he's been fascinated with the " ..
                "upheaval of the old city of Zoram and its treasures.\n\nIf you're willing to lend him a " ..
                "hand, you can find him at the Blackfathom Camp down the path to the west.",
        },
        [13618] = {
            description = "Gorat is one of the Horde's most adept assassins.\n\nThe mere mention of his " ..
                "name strikes fear into the hearts of our Alliance foes.\n\nHe is reliable, fiercely " ..
                "loyal, and - until now - punctual.\n\nSomething's not right, <class>.\n\nGorat 's " ..
                "mission was to find and eliminate the elf in charge of this assault on the " ..
                "ramparts.\n\nHe should be somewhere in the region of Fallen Sky Lake.\n\nFind him!",
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13619] = {
            description = "< Gorat coughs deeply as he strains to speak.>\n\nIt was... an " ..
                "ambush....\n\nWe were... returning to the ramparts. All of us... lost....\n\nWe... " ..
                "discovered their leader...\n\n< Gorat painstakingly fills a vial with the blood spilling " ..
                "from one of his wounds.>\n\nMy men... must be avenged.... Bring this... to " ..
                "Kadrak....\n\nHe will know what to do....\n\n< Gorat expires.>",
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13620] = {
            description = "The Horde may have never known one more loyal than Gorat. He never failed to " ..
                "complete a mission, and it would seem that he refuses to allow this to be his " ..
                "first.\n\nGorat had you deliver this vial for a purpose. Dinah is the daughter of a " ..
                "revered shaman, and is more powerful than she appears. Bring her the vial and hope that " ..
                "we are not too late.",
            rewardMoney = 125,
        },
        [13621] = {
            description = "Fortune is with us this day, <race>.\n\nGorat's blood was fresh enough for me " ..
                "to conduct a special ritual taught to me as a child.\n\nUse this imbued blood on Gorat's " ..
                "corpse to summon forth his lingering spirit.\n\nDo his final bidding, then report back " ..
                "here to Kadrak.\n\nSpirits keep you safe, friend.",
            rewardChoices = {{56644, 1}, {56645, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 2500,
        },
        [13622] = {
            description = "The pieces fit together to form an elegant hammer. Its construction appears to " ..
                "be at least partially Titan in nature.\n\nThe console inside the Archivum might have " ..
                "some information regarding this artifact.",
        },
        [13623] = {
            description = "Quickly, <name>. I will put the Bathran's Hair into this bag, but you must " ..
                "deliver it to my master, Orendil Broadleaf. You will find him at Maestra's Post, just " ..
                "south down the road on the left.\n\nBut beware, we've received reports that the post is " ..
                "under attack from the Horde!",
        },
        [13624] = {
            description = "I certainly hope that you're here to help, <class>. The situation is as dire " ..
                "as it appears. To put it quite simply, we are losing!\n\nMy girls and I are the last " ..
                "line of defense against the Horde, but we're not going to get out of this one without " ..
                "taking the fight to them. Up for a challenge?\n\nI have a small squad of sentinels that " ..
                "I can loan to you. Get them close and I'm certain that their magic arrows can destroy " ..
                "those wreckers and invaders.\n\nSpeak to me again if you need replacements.",
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13625] = {
            description = "Most of the tournament's competitions require competitors to master the " ..
                "command of a mount in battle. In order to familiarize you with mounted combat, we've put " ..
                "up training dummies all over the northern part of the tournament grounds.\n\nVisit the " ..
                "stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up on the Quel'dorei steed. " ..
                "Familiarize yourself with the tactics available to you and use them to defeat the three " ..
                "different kinds of training dummies.",
            rewardItems = {{45192, 2}},
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [13626] = {
            description = "There were two humans here: Feero Ironhand and Delgren the Purifier. They were " ..
                "members of a holy organization known as The Argent Dawn. Both fell defending the post " ..
                "when the Horde first attacked.\n\nI'm going to loan you my magical cloak. It was a gift " ..
                "from Cenarius that allows me to move invisibly.\n\nFind both of their corpses and " ..
                "retrieve Feero's hammer and Delgren's prayer book. Feero's corpse is in the courtyard " ..
                "and Delgren's is atop the tower.\n\nBeware, the warlock up there will be able to see you.",
            rewardChoices = {{56630, 1}, {56631, 1}, {56632, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13628] = {
            description = "Kadrak has just received fresh orders for our troops. I hear we're to begin " ..
                "offensive strikes into Ashenvale!\n\nI have far too few supplies to support an assault, " ..
                "and my shipment from Orgrimmar has yet to arrive.\n\nI am forced to improvise, and could " ..
                "use your help, <class>.\n\nSpeak with Kadrak and ask him for the reins to Brutusk. The " ..
                "kodo will take you to the Warsong Labor Camp. Once there, seek out Gorka and ask her to " ..
                "load you up with logs.",
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13630] = {
            description = "The furbolg have descended from the heights and overrun the Ruins of " ..
                "Ordil'Aran to the north. I believe they did so because they were attracted to what the " ..
                "dead cultists there uncovered: three moonstones.\n\nLiladris Moonriver will counsel you " ..
                "to deal with the furbolg in a more direct manner, and I will not gainsay her, but I " ..
                "would ask that you go to the ruins and deactivate the moonstones.",
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13632] = {
            description = "The moon priestess has a plan to make sure that no further furbolg descend " ..
                "upon us from the highlands. I am more concerned with those that are already at the " ..
                "ruins, some of which are massing just outside of the post.\n\nDistasteful as it may be, " ..
                "I must ask that you head north into the Ruins of Ordil'Aran and slay the furbolg. We " ..
                "cannot fight on two fronts!\n\nThank you, <class>.",
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13640] = {
            description = "Truun needs wood, huh? Normally I could provide, but not today.\n\nWith " ..
                "constant elf attacks, gathering lumber is dangerous work. The peons I have left are " ..
                "reluctant to venture into the woods.\n\nYou want wood? Then you go convince the peons to " ..
                "work.\n\nAnd keep them safe! I cannot afford to lose any more!",
            rewardChoices = {{56627, 1}, {56628, 1}, {56629, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13642] = {
            description = "The concoction is not quite complete; it must be bathed within the Light of " ..
                "Elune before we can even think about giving it to the child.\n\nThere is a known " ..
                "location just to the west at Lake Falathim where the goddess's moonlight always touches " ..
                "down, day or night. Please, <name>, I implore you for the sake of Relara, take the " ..
                "concoction and bathe it in Elune's radiance.\n\nBut beware, strange things have befallen " ..
                "the area of the lake, and I fear that it is no longer safe to go there.",
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13644] = {
            description = "When I sensed these... things... rising from below, I came to put them back " ..
                "down. I found the corpse of your friend and dragged him as far as I could before one of " ..
                "my fetlocks was broken. It is all that I can do to hold off these foul " ..
                "tendrils.\n\nThere is one that controls the tendrils and eyes. It calls itself Harbinger " ..
                "Aphotic -- I'm sure that you have heard it yelling from the south.\n\nThe harbinger " ..
                "stands out of range of my magic, but you could get to him. If you dare....",
            rewardChoices = {{56652, 1}, {56653, 1}, {56654, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 3000,
        },
        [13645] = {
            description = "I would ask you to deliver the gem directly to Raene Wolfrunner. Last I heard, " ..
                "she was still in Astranaar to the southeast.\n\nAt least the road between here and there " ..
                "is still relatively safe, so it should be a simple matter of following it there. Of " ..
                "course, if you'd rather, I believe that Sentinel Avana would be willing to loan you one " ..
                "of her nightsabers to swiftly make the trip.\n\nWhatever you choose, good health to you, " ..
                "<name>. May our paths cross again soon.",
        },
        [13646] = {
            description = "You have been of great assistance to us, <name>. Without you, we would have " ..
                "been wiped out by now.\n\nIt would be my pleasure to offer you one of my nightsabers " ..
                "anytime to ride to Astranaar up and to the southeast. I'm sure that you have very " ..
                "important business to attend to there.\n\nI would consider it a great kindness if you " ..
                "would speak with my sister, Sentinel Luara, when you arrive to tell her that I am " ..
                "well.\n\nJust speak to me again when you are ready to go, and anytime that you need a " ..
                "ride it is yours.",
        },
        [13648] = {
            description = "A dark iron spy has infiltrated the town, stolen documents from the Explorers' " ..
                "League establishment, and is now in hiding somewhere nearby. He was last sighted near " ..
                "the top of the hill to the south of town.\n\nA sizable reward awaits anyone who can " ..
                "bring this spy to justice. Dead or alive - dead preferred.",
            rewardMoney = 1000,
        },
        [13651] = {
            description = "You have your wood, but the encroaching elves have made it impossible for your " ..
                "kodo to return to Mor'shan Ramparts.\n\nI've dispatched a runner to Splintertree to " ..
                "summon aid. It shouldn't take long for their forces to clear the way.\n\nIn the " ..
                "meantime, I would ask that you do us a service. Rust has rendered our shredders " ..
                "inoperable. A little lubrication and they'll be as good as new.\n\nThe oil from the " ..
                "rotting slimes just north of here should work just fine.",
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13653] = {
            description = "There will be no help coming from Splintertree.\n\nThe elves have launched a " ..
                "major assault on our stronghold there and they have the place surrounded!\n\nWe must " ..
                "inform Kadrak or die trying!\n\nYour kodo has been loaded up with the wood you " ..
                "collected. Let me know when you're ready and we'll charge the enemy lines.",
            rewardChoices = {{56639, 1}, {56640, 1}, {56641, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 1000,
        },
        [13666] = {
            description = "Some of the champions believe an ancient weapon born of Northrend will bring " ..
                "them luck in the tourney. I have agreed to help them search for these " ..
                "weapons.\n\nThere's an old legend from Grizzly Hills about a maiden cursed with a frog's " ..
                "form to protect the blade she has long guarded. She lives among the lake frogs on the " ..
                "shore of Ashwood Lake, just east of Ashwood Post. The only thing said to break the curse " ..
                "is a kiss, freely given. Apply this balm before kissing anything, <name>. Otherwise, " ..
                "you'll catch warts.",
            rewardItems = {{45192, 2}},
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [13670] = {
            description = "The Ironforge grand champion's squire told me an intriguing story.\n\nIn " ..
                "southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord " ..
                "Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the " ..
                "center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden " ..
                "encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever " ..
                "frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, " ..
                "<name>.",
            rewardItems = {{45192, 2}},
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [13671] = {
            description = "The tournament is a time for testing your skills against your peers, but we " ..
                "must not forget that the real enemy, the Scourge, will not wait. As you learn to master " ..
                "mounted combat, do not forget to practice the skills that have served you well all these " ..
                "years. Show us that you can face the Scourge with honor and bravery, and you will earn " ..
                "your right to compete in this tournament.\n\nTravel to Icecrown and slay any Scourge you " ..
                "see there, but stay clear of the Bombardment, where you would be overwhelmed.",
            rewardItems = {{45192, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [13674] = {
            description = "Our champions have taken a liking to ancient weapons produced here in " ..
                "Northrend.\n\nI've heard the bards telling tales of travelers offering winter hyacinths " ..
                "to a lonely maiden in return for gifts. Those hyacinths grow only on the ice flowing " ..
                "from the Ironwall Dam, on Crystalsong Forest's northwestern border with Icecrown. Gather " ..
                "the flowers and take them to the circle of lamps in Drak'Mar Lake in northeastern " ..
                "Dragonblight, near Zul'Drak and Grizzly Hills. Ask the lonely maiden for a worthy blade.",
            rewardItems = {{45192, 2}},
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [13675] = {
            description = "I heard an interesting story from one of the Orgrimmar valiants.\n\nIn " ..
                "southern Crystalsong Forest, overlooking the Crystal Vice's exit, you will find Lord " ..
                "Everblaze. Kill him and take the everburning ember from his corpse.\n\nBring it to the " ..
                "center of Winter's Breath Lake in northern Howling Fjord, and use it to free the maiden " ..
                "encased in ice. She is the guardian of an ancient sword and will award it to whoever " ..
                "frees her.\n\nProve your worth and earn the weapon that she has guarded for so long, " ..
                "<name>.",
            rewardItems = {{45192, 2}},
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [13677] = {
            description = "Most of the tournament's competitions require competitors to master the " ..
                "command of a mount in battle. In order to familiarize you with mounted combat, we've put " ..
                "up training dummies all over the northern part of the tournament grounds.\n\nVisit the " ..
                "stables outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up on the Sunreaver " ..
                "hawkstrider. Familiarize yourself with the mount and use its abilities to defeat the " ..
                "three different kinds of training dummies.",
            rewardItems = {{45192, 2}},
            rewardMoney = 58000,
        },
        [13683] = {
            description = "I could not help but overhear Illiyana's loss. I understand her need for " ..
                "revenge. I am wondering if while you are exacting it, you could do us a service?\n\nNo " ..
                "doubt you have already seen the satyr of Satyrnaar and Xavian conducting vile rituals. I " ..
                "believe that they are preparing their rituals to corrupt any of the night elves they " ..
                "capture, turning them into satyrs. We draenei also have problems with fel magic " ..
                "exposure.\n\nWould you disturb their ritual gems while you are there?",
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13688] = {
            description = "You've proven yourself worthy of competing under the banner of Gnomeregan, " ..
                "<name>. Now, you should introduce yourself to Ambrose Boltspark, who leads the " ..
                "Gnomeregan delegation. As the gnomish grand champion, he will enter you into the " ..
                "tournament on behalf of the city and oversee your training and testing as valiant.\n\nIt " ..
                "has been an honor working with you, <name>, and I wish you luck in the competition ahead.",
            rewardMoney = 7400,
        },
        [13692] = {
            description = "My sword was lost at sea. Catch it and bring it back!",
            rewardItems = {{34863, 1}},
        },
        [13698] = {
            description = "I hate to send you back in there, but based on your description of what's " ..
                "going on, we can't let them use all of those explosives they have stored up!\n\nIt's too " ..
                "dangerous for you to try to destroy them yourself, but if you were to steal one of their " ..
                "shredders, I'm sure they're tough enough to withstand the explosions.\n\nAfter you've " ..
                "destroyed their explosives, return here with the shredder. There's no sense in letting " ..
                "them have it back.",
            rewardChoices = {{56646, 1}, {56647, 1}, {56648, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 2500,
        },
        [13702] = {
            description = "Congratulations, <name>. You have mastered many kinds of combat and overcome " ..
                "all the challenges you've faced. There can be no doubt that you are ready to compete " ..
                "with the best warriors who have gathered at the tournament, against the champions of the " ..
                "capital cities.\n\nJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, <name>, and to " ..
                "formally enter you in the champions' grand melee.",
            rewardItems = {{44998, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 148000,
        },
        [13704] = {
            description = "Welcome, champion. Word of your combat prowess has already reached my ears. " ..
                "Gnomeregan's delegation could really benefit from a <class> like you.\n\nYou will train " ..
                "and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of " ..
                "Gnomeregan, your squire will have the option of carrying our banner into battle.",
        },
        [13712] = {
            description = "You're coming with me, <name>.\n\nThere's no one else that I can spare, and we " ..
                "cannot afford for Splintertree to be lost.\n\nPrepare yourself, and speak to me again " ..
                "when you are ready.",
            rewardItems = {{60644, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 1000,
        },
        [13716] = {
            description = "In your training as a valiant, you'll have the chance to test your skills " ..
                "against valiants representing other cities. Although a valiant's battles are not a " ..
                "formal part of the competition, you will learn valuable lessons about the fighting " ..
                "styles and weaknesses of your opponents.\n\nThe valiants are a spirited lot, competing " ..
                "amongst themselves for honor and notoriety.\n\nTrain as a valiant until you are " ..
                "confident of your ability to best all who face you, then bring me the seals you have " ..
                "earned.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13727] = {
            description = "You are nearly ready to compete in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy " ..
                "of this honor, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables " ..
                "outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up. Speak to Squire Danny at the " ..
                "Argent Valiants' Ring on the western edge of the grounds. The squire will call out your " ..
                "opponent when you're ready.\n\nAfter the battle is concluded, we will speak of the " ..
                "outcome.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13729] = {
            description = "You are nearly ready to compete in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy " ..
                "of this honor, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables " ..
                "outside the pavilion, equip your lance, and mount up. Speak to Squire Danny at the " ..
                "Argent Valiants' Ring on the western edge of the grounds. The squire will call out your " ..
                "opponent when you're ready.\n\nAfter the battle is concluded, we will speak of the " ..
                "outcome.",
            rewardMoney = 74000,
        },
        [13730] = {
            description = "<Draaka leans down to speak to you.>\n\nListen... Before you say anything, I " ..
                "KNOW we're not to meddle with demonic energies....\n\nBut look around you! These are " ..
                "desperate times, <class>.\n\nWe'll most likely die here, regardless. May as well go out " ..
                "in a blaze of glory, I say!\n\nSo... Are you in?\n\nTake this canister and go southeast " ..
                "to Felfire Hill. Use it near the patches of felfire and bring it back to me when you've " ..
                "filled it.\n\nOh, and best not to mention this to anyone....",
            rewardChoices = {{56649, 1}, {56650, 1}, {56651, 1}},
            rewardMoney = 1300,
        },
        [13731] = {
            description = "You are nearly ready to compete in the grand melee. To prove yourself worthy " ..
                "of this honor, you must defeat a champion of the Argent Crusade.\n\nGo to the stables " ..
